    "homepage_text": "Mingsheng Long - Tsinghua University\nMingsheng Long\nAssociate Professor\n(with tenure and with endowed professorship)\nMachine Learning Group\nSchool of Software\nTsinghua University\nlongmingsheng@gmail.com\n,\nmingsheng@tsinghua.edu.cn\nRoom 11-413, East Main Building, Tsinghua University, Beijing 100084, China\n[\nPublications\n]\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n[\nGitHub\n]\n[\nWeChat Official Account\n]\nBiography\nMy research spans machine learning theory, algorithms and models, with persistent commitment to creating strong learning machines from big data that adapt to both digital and physical worlds. I am working on deep learning and foundation models, scientific learning and world models, transfer learning and model adaptation.\nOur Machine Learning Group is interested in powering machine learning for representation, prediction, and generation of big data with a good tradeoff between accuracy, efficiency, and generalizability. Our mission is to solve open science problems and to enable major engineering applications, including AGI, AI for Science, and AI for Industry.\nMy Quote\n“\nEverything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.\n” --Albert Einstein\nResearch Interests\nMachine Learning:\nDeep Learning, Transfer Learning, Scientific Learning\nArtificial Intelligence:\nPhysical AI, World Models, Multimodal Foundation Models\nEducation\nPhD in Computer Science, 2008-2014\nDepartment of Computer Science and Technology\n, Tsinghua University, Beijing, China\nSupervisor: Prof.\nJianmin Wang\nBachelor in Electrical Engineering, 2004-2008\nDepartment of Electrical Engineering\n, Tsinghua University, Beijing, China\nResearch Experience\nPostdoc in Machine Learning, 2014-2015\nDepartment of Computer Science\n,\nUC Berkeley\nAdvisor: Prof.\nMichael I. Jordan\nPostdoc in Data Science, 2014-2016\nSchool of Software\n, Tsinghua University, Beijing, China\nAdvisor: Prof.\nJianmin Wang\nHighlights\nBig nowcasting model for extreme precipitation (\nNowcastNet\n) was reported in\nNews and Views\nand published in\nNature 2023\nUnified forecasting model for worldwide stations (\nCorrformer\n) was published as the\nCover Article\nin\nNat Mach Intell 2023\nTask general model for time series analysis (\nTimesNet\n) was ranked\n14th of the most influential papers in ICLR 2023\nBase forecasting model for time series (\nAutoformer\n) was ranked\n4th of the most influential papers in NeurIPS 2021\nConditional Domain Adversarial Network (\nCDAN\n) was ranked\n6th of the most influential papers in NeurIPS 2018\nJoint Adaptation Network (\nJAN\n) was ranked\n10th of the most influential papers in ICML 2017\nDeep Adaptation Network (\nDAN\n) was ranked\n5th of the most influential papers in ICML 2015\n, Test of Time Award at FTL-IJCAI\nJoint Distribution Adaptation (\nJDA\n) was ranked\n2nd of the most influential papers in ICCV 2013\nSelected Publications [\nFull List\n] [\nDBLP\n] [\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n(✉️\nCorresponding Author\n)\nThesis\nMingsheng Long\n.\nTransfer Learning: Problems and Methods\n. 1-127, 2014 [\nPDF\n] (In Chinese)\nJournal Articles\nSkilful Nowcasting of Extreme Precipitation with NowcastNet\nYuchen Zhang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\n, Kaiyuan Chen, Lanxiang Xing, Ronghua Jin, Michael I. Jordan\n✉️\n, Jianmin Wang\n✉️\nNature\n619\n, 526–532, 2023 [\nLink\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nHot Paper\n⚑\nOutstanding Paper Award, World AI Conference\nInterpretable Weather Forecasting for Worldwide Stations with a Unified Deep Model\nHaixu Wu, Hang Zhou,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\n, Jianmin Wang\n✉️\nNature Machine Intelligence (\nNat Mach Intell\n)\n5\n, 602-611, 2023 [\nLink\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nCover Article\n⚑\nOutstanding Paper Award Honorable Mention, World AI Conference\ndepyf: Open the Opaque Box of PyTorch Compiler for Machine Learning Researchers\nKaichao You, Runsheng Bai, Meng Cao, Jianmin Wang, Ion Stoica,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nJournal of Machine Learning Research (\nJMLR\n)\n, 26(25):1-18, 2025 [\nLink\n] [\nPyTorch Introduction\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nPyTorch Award\nPredRNN: A Recurrent Neural Network for Spatiotemporal Predictive Learning\nYunbo Wang, Haixu Wu, Jianjin Zhang, Zhifeng Gao, Jianmin Wang, Philip S. Yu,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n)\n, 45(2):2208-2225, 2023 [\nLink\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nHot Paper\nTransferable Representation Learning with Deep Adaptation Networks\nMingsheng Long\n, Yue Cao, Zhangjie Cao, Jianmin Wang, Michael I. Jordan\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nTPAMI\n)\n, 41(12):3071-3085, 2019 [\nLink\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nHighly Cited Paper\nConference Proceedings\nVid2World: Crafting Video Diffusion Models to Interactive World Models\nSiqiao Huang, Jialong Wu, Qixing Zhou, Shangchen Miao,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2026 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\nPhySense: Sensor Placement Optimization for Accurate Physics Sensing\nYuezhou Ma, Haixu Wu, Hang Zhou, Huikun Weng, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nOral Paper\nRLVR-World: Training World Models with Reinforcement Learning\nJialong Wu, Shaofeng Yin, Ningya Feng,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\nSundial: A Family of Highly Capable Time Series Foundation Models\nYong Liu, Guo Qin, Zhiyuan Shi, Zhi Chen, Caiyin Yang, Xiangdong Huang, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2025 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nOral Paper\nDynamical Diffusion: Learning Temporal Dynamics with Diffusion Models\nXingzhuo Guo, Yu Zhang, Baixu Chen, Haoran Xu, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2025 [\nPDF\n] [\nOpenReview\n] [\nCode\n]\nRoPINN: Region Optimized Physics-Informed Neural Networks\nHaixu Wu, Huakun Luo, Yuezhou Ma, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2024 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\niVideoGPT: Interactive VideoGPTs are Scalable World Models\nJialong Wu, Shaofeng Yin, Ningya Feng, Xu He, Dong Li, Jianye Hao,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2024 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\nTransolver: A Fast Transformer Solver for PDEs on General Geometries\nHaixu Wu, Huakun Luo, Haowen Wang, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2024 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n                        ⚑\nSpotlight Paper\nTimer: Generative Pre-trained Transformers are Large Time Series Models\nYong Liu, Haoran Zhang, Chenyu Li, Xiangdong Huang, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2024 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\niTransformer: Inverted Transformers Are Effective for Time Series Forecasting\nYong Liu, Tengge Hu, Haoran Zhang, Haixu Wu, Shiyu Wang, Lintao Ma,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2024  [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nSpotlight Paper\nPre-training Contextualized World Models with In-the-wild Videos for Reinforcement Learning\nJialong Wu, Haoyu Ma, Chaoyi Deng,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2023 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\nTimesNet: Temporal 2D-Variation Modeling for General Time Series Analysis\nHaixu Wu, Tengge Hu, Yong Liu, Hang Zhou, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2023 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nRanks 14th in ICLR 2023\nFlowformer: Linearizing Transformers with Conservation Flows\nHaixu Wu, Jialong Wu, Jiehui Xu, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2022 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\nAnomaly Transformer: Time Series Anomaly Detection with Association Discrepancy\nJiehui Xu, Haixu Wu, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2022 [\nPDF\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nSpotlight Paper\nAutoformer: Decomposition Transformers with Auto-Correlation for Long-Term Series Forecasting\nHaixu Wu, Jiehui Xu, Jianmin Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2021 [\nPDF\n] [\nAppendix\n] [\narXiv\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nRanks 4th in NeurIPS 2021\nBridging Theory and Algorithm for Domain Adaptation\nYuchen Zhang, Tianle Liu,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\n, Michael I. Jordan\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2019 [\nPDF\n] [\nAppendix\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nOral Paper\nConditional Adversarial Domain Adaptation\nMingsheng Long\n, Zhangjie Cao, Jianmin Wang, Michael I. Jordan\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2018 [\nPDF\n] [\nPoster\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nRanks 6th in NeurIPS 2018\nPredRNN: Recurrent Neural Networks for Predictive Learning using Spatiotemporal LSTMs\nYunbo Wang,\nMingsheng Long\n✉️\n, Jianmin Wang, Zhifeng Gao, Philip S. Yu\nNeural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2017 [\nPDF\n] [\nCode\n]\nDeep Transfer Learning with Joint Adaptation Networks\nMingsheng Long\n, Han Zhu, Jianmin Wang, Michael I. Jordan\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2017 [\nPDF\n] [\nSlides\n] [\nPoster\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nRanks 10th in ICML 2017\nLearning Transferable Features with Deep Adaptation Networks\nMingsheng Long\n, Yue Cao, Jianmin Wang, Michael I. Jordan\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (\nICML\n)\n, 2015\n                        [\nPDF\n] [\nSlides\n] [\nPoster\n] [\nCode\n]\n⚑\nRanks 5th in ICML 2015\n⚑\nTest of Time Award at FTL-IJCAI 2021\nSoftware\nTransfer Learning Library (TLlib)\n: An easy-to-use library for transfer learning [\nCode @ GitHub\n]\nTime Series Library (TSlib)\