    "homepage_text": "Lexing Ying\nLexing Ying\nProfessor of Mathematics\nStanford University\nPhone: 650-723-2221\nEmail: lexing at stanford dot edu\nAddress: 450 Jane Stanford Way, Bldg 380, Stanford, CA 94305-2125\nRecent research talks\nHarmonic analysis for quantum algorithms\n[Link]\nEigenmatrix for unstructured sparse recovery\n[Link]\nMultimodal sampling via approximate symmetries\n[Link]\nQuantum pseudo-differential operators and robust quantum phase estimation\n[Link]\nQuantum numerical analysis\n[Link]\nSome mathematical aspects of deep learning and stochastic gradient descent\n[Link]\nCorrecting convexity bias\n[Link]\nProny's method, analytic continuation, and quantum signal processing\n[Link]\nOptimization formulations and algorithms of Markov decision problems\n[Link]\nNeural networks and partial differential equations\n[Link]\nSobolev Regularization Effect of SGD for neural networks\n[Link]\nSolving inverse problems with deep learning\n[Link]\nTeaching\nMy current courses are hosted\n        at\ncanvas.stanford.edu\nStudents and postdocs\nCurrent\nHaoxuan Chen\nHongrui Chen\nYa-Chi Chu (co-advised with Madeleine Udell)\nRajat Dwaraknath (co-advised with Mert Pilanci)\nHongkang Ni\nLeah Reeder\nYinuo Ren (co-advised with Grant Rotskoff)\nNan Sheng\nXun Tang (postdoc)\nPrevious\n----PhD students\nXun Tang (2025)\nMilo Marsden (2025, co-advised with Persi Diaconis)\nHaoya Li (2024)\nYiping Lu (2023, co-advised with Jose Blanchet)\nZach Izzo (2023, co-advised with James Zou)\nPhilip Etter (2022)\nPanagiotis Lolas (2022, co-advised with Iain Johnstone)\nCindy Catherine Orozco Bohorquez (2021)\nJordi Feliu Faba (2021)\nJing An (2021)\nFei Liu (2018)\nVictor Minden (2017)\nYingzhou Li (2017)\nAnil Damle (2016)\nHaizhao Yang (2015)\nPaul Tsuji (2012)\nJack Poulson (2012)\nPhillip Schmitz (2010)\n----Postdocs\nAlice Cortinovis (2024, co-advised with Emmanuel Candes)\nChao Ma (2023)\nYuhua Zhu (2022)\nYuwei Fan (2019)\nYuehaw Khoo (2019)\nKenneth Ho (2015)\nJack Poulson (2014)\nJingwei Hu (2014)\nPublications\nSee Google Scholar\n[Link]\nSoftware\nSee Github\n[Link]\nEigenmatrix for unstructured sparse recovery.\n[Code]\nStable factorization for phase factors of quantum signal processing\n[Code]\nSweeping preconditioner\n[Code]\nAdditive sweeping preconditioner\n[Code]\nRecursive sweeping preconditioner\n[Code]\n1D synchrosqueezed wave packet transforms\n[Code]\nMultiscale Butterfly Algorithm\n[Code]\nButterfly factorization\n[Code]\nButterflyLab\n[Code]\nDirectional FMM (3D parallel) for Helmholtz Equation\n[Code]\nDirectional FMM (3D sequential) for Helmholtz Equation\n[Code]\nDirectional FMM (2D sequential) for Helmholtz Equation\n[Code]\nWave atom transforms\n[Code]\nFast discrete Curvelet transform\n[Code]\nManifold-based surface construction of arbitrary smoothness\n[Code]\nKernel independent fast multipole method\n[Code]"
