    "github": "https://github.com/jingxuxie",
    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/jingxuxie/",
    "homepage_text": "About me - Jingxu Xie\nEmail: jingxuxie [at] berkeley [dot] edu\nFollow\nBerkeley, CA\nResearchGate\nLinkedIn\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nAbout me\nHi, welcome to my homepage!\nI am a PhD candidate in the\nDepartment of Physics at UC Berkeley\nand in the\nLawrence Berkeley National Laboratory\nworking with\nProf. Feng Wang\n. I am interested in the light-matter interactions and the electrical transport in condensed matter physics, with an emphasis on novel quantum phenomena emerging in low-dimensional materials.\nFeel free to contact me if you would like to connect!"
  },
