    "homepage_text": "Wengang Zhou\nWengang Zhou\nProfessor\nEEIS Department, USTC\nzhwg@ustc.edu.cn\nGoogle Scholar Record\nResearch Interest\nComputer Vision\nEmbodied AI\nEducation & Work Experience\n2018.12~present, Professor\nEEIS Department, University of Science and Technology of China\n2013.09~2018.11, Associate Professor\nEEIS Department, University of Science and Technology of China\n2011.08~2013.09, Post-Doctorate Researcher\nComputer Science Department, University of Texas at San Antonio\nSupervisor:\nProf. Qi Tian\n2006.09~2011.07, PhD in Signal and Information Processing\nEEIS Department, University of Science and Technology of China\nSupervisor:\nProf. Houqiang Li\n2002.09~2006.07, BSc in Electronic Information Engineering\nEIS Department, Wuhan University\nProfessional Service\n2022/08, Lead Guest Editor of Special Issue\n“Pre-trained Models for Multi-modality Understanding” of IEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n2022/07 to 2024/07, Associate Editor of IEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n2021/06, Publication Chair of IEEE ICME\nCite\n×\nCopy\nDownload"
