    "homepage_text": "ï»¿\nDr. Qu Yanyun, Associate Professor-School of Information Science and Engineering\nEnglish\n|\nä¸­æç\nHome\nAbout\nSchool of Information Science and Engineering\nXiamen University\nHistory\nFacts&Figures\nAnnual Report\nContact Us\nPrograms\nUndergraduate\nGraduate\nDoctoral Programs\nMaster Programs\nAdmission\nProfessional Students\nCenter of Collaborative Education in Information Science\nPeople\nFaculty\nProfessor\nAssociate Professor\nAssistant Professor\nAdjunct Professor\nHonorary Professor\nDistinguished Professor\nStaff\nDepartment of Computer Science\nDepartment of Communication Science\nDepartment of Cognitive Science and Technology\nDepartment of Cyber Space Security\nAlumni\nWork Opportunity\nDepartments\nDepartment of Computer Science\nDepartment of Communication Science\nDepartment of Cognitive Science and Technology\nDepartment of Cyber Space Security\nResearch\nKey Labs\nResearch Institutes\nResearch Centers\nNews&Events\nNews\nEvents\nAssociate Professor\nFaculty\nProfessor\nAssociate Professor\nAssistant Professor\nAdjunct Professor\nHonorary Professor\nDistinguished Professor\nStaff\nDepartment of Computer Science\nDepartment of Communication Science\nDepartment of Cognitive Science and Technology\nDepartment of Cyber Space Security\nAlumni\nWork Opportunity\nHome\n>>\nPeople\n>>\nFaculty\n>>\nAssociate Professor\n>>\r\n                Content\nDr. Qu Yanyun, Associate Professor\nResearch Interestsï¼computer vision, pattern recognition, image processing\nEmailï¼yyqu (AT) xmu.edu.cn\nResumeï¼\nSelected Publications\n[1] Li J, Qu Y, *Li C, Xie Y, Image super-resolution based on multi-kernel regression, Multimedia Tools and Applications, DOI:10.1007/s11042-015-3016-4 (Springer: SCI/EI).\n[2] Li J, *Qu Y, Li C, Xie Y, Wu Y, Fan J, 2015. Learning local Gaussian process regression for image super-resolution, Neurocomputing, 154(2015):284-295 (Elsevier: SCI/EI).\n[3] *Qu Y, Zhang B, Fan J, 2015. Parallel AP Clustering and Re-ranking for Automatic Image-Text Alignment and Large-Scale Web Image Search, ACM International Conference on Multimedia Retrieval (ICMR): 451-454 (ACM:EI).\n[4] *Qu Y, Lin L, Liao W, Liu J, Wu Y, Wang H, 2015. Text Localization with Hierarchical Multiple Feature Learning, Pacific-Rim Conference on Multimedia (PCM):634-643 (Springer: EI).\n[5] Lu C, *Qu Y, Shi C, Fan J, Wu Y, Wang H, 2015. Hierarchical Learning for Large-scale Image Classification via CNN and Maximum Confidence Path, Pacific-Rim Conference on Multimedia (PCM):236-245 (Springer: EI).\n[6] Zhao T, *Qu Y, Fan J, 2015. Fast Learning Discriminative Dictionaries for Large-scale Visual Recognition, International Workshop on Multimedia Signal Processing (MMSP): In press (Springer: EI).\nQuick Links\nXiamen University\nSchool of Information Science and Engineering\nAdmission Office of Xiamen University\nCenter of Collaborative Education in Information Science\nOverseas Education College of Xiamen University\nCopyright Â© School of Information Science and Engineering\nTop"
