    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/lei-xu-b78238a4/",
    "homepage_text": "About Me\nLei Xu (徐 磊)\nPh.D. in Computer Science, MIT\nML Researcher at OpenEvidence\nEmail:\nleix328@gmail.com\n[Publications]\nAbout Me\nI’m an ML researcher at\nOpenEvidence\n, on a mission to revolutionize healthcare through AI. 🏥✨\nI believe LLMs have the potential to transform how we augment human capabilities. My research focuses on building more reliable LLM systems that can genuinely support critical decision-making.\nPreviously, I was an Applied Scientist at\nAmazon AWS\n, where I pioneered LLMs for medical scribing.\nI earned my Ph.D. in Computer Science from\nMIT\nin 2023, researching language model robustness and synthetic data, and my B.Eng. from\nTsinghua University\n.\nNews\nDec 2025\n: Thrilled to join\nOpenEvidence\n! 🚀 Onward to building AI systems that truly serve healthcare and humanity."
  },
