    "homepage_text": "Guokun Lai\nGuokun Lai\nEmail:\nguokun@cs.cmu.edu\nScholar Page:\nGoogle Scholar\nI am a last year PhD student working with Professor\nYiming Yang\nin Language Technologies Institute of School of Computer Science at Carnegie Mellon University. Prior to that, I received my B.E. in Computer Science & Engineering from Tsinghua University.\nMy on-going research spans several subfields of deep learning, such as natural language pretraining, machine translation and neural architecture search.\nPublication\nUnsupervised Parallel Corpus Mining on Web Data\n[\npdf\n]\nGuokun Lai\n, Zihang Dai, Yiming Yang\nPreprint\nFunnel-Transformer: Filtering out Sequential Redundancy for Efficient Language Processing\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nZihang Dai*,\nGuokun Lai*\n, Yiming Yang, Quoc V. Le\nNeurIPS 2020\nCorrelation-aware Change-point Detection via Graph Neural Networks\n[\npdf\n]\nRuohong Zhang*, Yu Hao*, Donghan Yu, Wei-Cheng Chang,\nGuokun Lai\nand Yiming Yang\nICONIP 2020\nBridging the domain gap in cross-lingual document classification\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nGuokun Lai\n, Barlas Oguz, Yiming Yang, Veselin Stoyanov\nPreprint\nRe-examination of the Role of Latent Variables in Sequence Modeling\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nGuokun Lai*\n, Zihang Dai*, Yiming Yang, Shinjae Yoo\nNeurIPS 2019\nStochastic WaveNet: A Generative Latent Variable Model for Sequential Data\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nGuokun Lai\n, Bohan Li, Guoqing Zheng, Yiming Yang\nICML2018 Workshop\nLearning Graph Convolution Filters from Data Manifold\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nGuokun Lai\n, Hanxiao Liu, Yiming Yang\nPreprint\nLarge-scale Cloze Test Dataset Designed by Teachers\n[\npdf\n] [\ndata\n]\nQizhe Xie*,\nGuokun Lai*\n, Zihang Dai, Eduard Hovy\nEMNLP2018\nModeling Long- and Short-Term Temporal Patterns with Deep Neural Networks\n[\npdf\n] [\ndata\n]\nGuokun Lai\n, Wei-Cheng Chang, Yiming Yang, Hanxiao Liu\nSIGIR2018\nRACE: Large-scale ReAding Comprehension Dataset From Examinations\n[\npdf\n] [\ndata\n]\nGuokun Lai*\n, Qizhe Xie*, Hanxiao Liu, Yiming Yang, Eduard Hovy\nEMNLP2017\nDaily-aware personalized recommendation based on feature-level time series analysis\n[\npdf\n]\nYongfeng Zhang, Min Zhang, Yi Zhang,\nGuokun Lai\n, Yiqun Liu, Honghui Zhang, Shaoping Ma\nWWW2015\nExplicit factor models for explainable recommendation based on phrase-level sentiment analysis\n[\npdf\n]\nYongfeng Zhang,\nGuokun Lai\n, Min Zhang, Yi Zhang, Yiqun Liu, Shaoping Ma\nSIGIR2014\nâ*â indicates equal contribution.\nEducation\nCarnegie Mellon university\nPhD in Computer Science - Language Technologies: from 2016 to -\nTsinghua University\nBachelor of Computer Science and Technology: from 2012 to 2016\nWork Experimence\nResearch Intern, Google Brain, Summer 2020\nPerform weight sharing neural architecture search on large-scale model search space with improved accuracy, better search efficiency and smaller size of model paraemters compared with EfficientNet\nResearch Intern, Facebook AI, Summer 2019\nImprove cross-lingual document classification with semi-supervised learning and language pretraining technique.\nProfessional Activities\nReviewer:\nNeurIPS, ICML, ACL, EMNLP\nLast updated on: Sep, 2020"
