 arXiv:2410.20011 2024\nA survey of small language models\narXiv preprint arXiv:2412.01762 2024\nXQ-GAN: An Open-source Image Tokenization Framework ...\narXiv preprint arXiv:2412.02142 2024\nPersonalized Multimodal Large Language Models: A Survey\narXiv preprint arXiv:2412.10533 2024\nSUGAR: Subject-Driven Video Customization in a Zero-...\n2023\n(18)\n▼\nKnowledge distillation for neural networks using mul...\nICCV 2023\nHigh-Quality Entity Segmentation\nWACV 2023\nLayerDoc: layer-wise extraction of spatial hierarchi...\nACL 2023\nA critical analysis of out-of-distribution detection...\nACL 2023\nLearning the visualness of text using large vision-l...\nPreserving user-entity differential privacy in natur...\nEnhanced document visual question answering system v...\nNeurIPS 2023\nAIMS: all-inclusive multi-level segmentation for any...\nAAAI 2023\nDocedit: language-guided document editing\nNeurIPS Workshop 2023\nLlavar: Enhanced visual instruction tuning for text-...\nFacilitating identification of fillable regions in a...\nOpen vocabulary instance segmentation\nAdaptive sparse attention pattern\nSystems and methods for product retrieval\nEMNLP 2023\nA critical analysis of document out-of-distribution ...\nMultimodal extraction across multiple granularities\nOpen vocabulary instance segmentation with noise est...\nNeurIPS Workshop 2023\nReflection-tuning: Data recycling improves llm instr...\n2022\n(19)\n▼\nGenerating scene graphs from digital images using ex...\nAAAI 2022\nUNISON: Unpaired cross-lingual image captioning\nT-PAMI 2022\nOpen world entity segmentation\nCVPR 2022\nOpen-vocabulary instance segmentation via robust cro...\nCVPR 2022\nTowards language-free training for text-to-image gen...\nECCV 2022\nCa-ssl: Class-agnostic semi-supervised learning for ...\nBig Data 2022\nUser-entity differential privacy in learning natural...\nAAAI 2022\nTigan: Text-based interactive image generation and m...\nACM Web 2022\nFedkc: Federated knowledge composition for multili