, D., Huang, Q., Leng, G., Gao, L., Wei, X.,\nPeng, J.\n(2024):\nEffects of interaction of multiple large-scale atmospheric circulations on precipitation dynamics in China\nSci. Total Environ.\n923\n, art. 171528\n10.1016/j.scitotenv.2024.171528\nEisenhauer, N., Frank, K., Weigelt, A., Bartkowski, B., Beugnon, R., Liebal, K...[truncated]"
