  "serper::Zhu Li": {
    "homepage": "https://zhuli.name/",
    "emails": [],
    "github": "https://github.com/zhuligs",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Zhu Research Group @ Rutgers\nUnlock the secrets of Matter.\nWe study energy landscapes to\nunlock the secrets of matter and predict novel materials\n.\nInterested in joining us? Please contact\n[email protected]\nRecent News\nJuly 2025\n: Welcome to our new high school interns, Alex Fu from Union County Magnet High School and Collins Esubonteng from Science Park High School. We are excited to have them join our group!\nApril 2025\n: Congrats to Shuo Tao for successfully defending his PhD thesis!\nAug 2024\n: Congratulations to Dr. Ying Sun, who will join the Department of Physics at Jilin University as an Associate Professor.\nJune 2024\n: Welcome to Nathaniel Esubonteng and Kira Bhatia, who will join our group as high school interns this summer.\nFeb 2024\n: Congratulations to Shuo, who won the competitive Dean's Dissertation Fellowship.\nSep 2023\n: Welcome to Meiyan, who joins our group as a PhD student."
  },
