nocarcinoma\nStrasser, M. K., Gibbs, D. L., Gascard, P., Bons, J., Hickey, J. W., Pan, D., Caruso, J. A., Wang, X., Chen-Tanyolac, C., Bai, R., Schürch, C. M., Tan, Y., Black, S., Chu, P., Ozkan, A., Basisty, N., Sangwan, V., Rose, J., Shah, S. & Burton, J. B.\n& 22 others\n,\nCamilleri-Broet, S., Fiset, P. O., Bertos, N., Berube, J., Djambazian, H., Li, R., Oikonomopoulos, S., Elliott, D. R. F., Vernovsky, S., Shimshoni, E., Collyar, D., Russell, A., Ragoussis, J., Stachler, M. D., Goldenring, J. R., McDonald, S. A. C., Ingber, D. E., Schilling, B., Nolan, G. P., Tlsty, T. D.,\nHuang, S.\n& Ferri, L. E.\n,\nOct 20 2025\n,\nIn:\nDevelopmental Cell.\n60\n,\n20\n,\np. 2807-2824.e7\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nAdenocarcinoma\n100%\nStroma\n100%\nBarrett Esophagus\n100%\nFibroblast\n100%\nMulti-Omics\n100%\n2\nScopus \n citations\nFokker-Planck diffusion maps of microglial transcriptomes reveal radial differentiation into substates associated with Alzheimer’s pathology\nBaumgartner, A., Robinson, M., Ertekin-Taner, N., Golde, T. E., Jaydev, S.,\nHuang, S.\n,\nHadlock, J.\n& Funk, C.,\nDec 2025\n,\nIn:\nCommunications Biology.\n8\n,\n1\n, 279.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFacilitated Diffusion\n100%\nTranscriptome\n100%\nMicroglia\n75%\nInnate Immunity\n25%\nGene Expression\n25%\n1\nScopus \n citations\nGenomic determinants of therapy response in ETV6::RUNX1 leukemia\nOksa, L., Moisio, S., Maqbool, K., Kramer, R., Nikkilä, A., Jayasingha, B., Mäkinen, A., Foroughi-Asl, H., Rounioja, S., Suhonen, J., Krali, O., Voutilainen, M., Lahnalampi, M., Vepsäläinen, K.,\nHuang, S.\n, Duque-Afonso, J., Hauer, J., Nordlund, J., Wirta, V. & Lohi, O.\n& 1 others\n,\nHeinäniemi, M.\n,\nSep 2025\n,\nIn:\nLeukemia.\n39\n,\n9\n,\np. 2125-2139\n15 p.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nRUNX1\n100%\nETV6\n100%\nGenomics\n100%\nTranscriptomics\n66%\nB Cell\n66%\n2\nScopus \n citations\nPhase 2 trial of perioperative chemo-immunotherapy for gastro-esophageal adenocarcinoma: The role of M2 macrophage landscape in predicting response\nAlcindor, T., Tankel, J., Fiset, P. O., Pal, S., Opu, T., Strasser, M., Dehghani, M., Bertos, N., Zuo, D., Mueller, C., Cools-Lartigue, J., Hickeson, M., Marcus, V., Camilleri-Broet, S., Spatz, A., Evaristo, G., Farag, M., Artho, G., Elkrief, A. & Saleh, R.\n& 5 others\n,\nBailey, S., Park, M.,\nHuang, S.\n, Sangwan, V. & Ferri, L.\n,\nApr 15 2025\n,\nIn:\nCell Reports Medicine.\n6\n,\n4\n, 102045.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nEsophageal Adenocarcinoma\n100%\nChemoimmunotherapy\n100%\nM2 Macrophages\n100%\nProgrammed Death-Ligand 1\n100%\nImmunotherapy\n100%\n8\nScopus \n citations\nView all 191 Research outputs\nYour message has successfully been sent.\nYour message was not sent due to an error.\nx\nContact Sui Huang, MD, PhD\nSubject\n*\nMessage\n*\nYour name:\n*\nYour email:\n*\nSend me a copy of this message\n*required field\nSee privacy policy in the footer of the page\nCancel\nSend"
