    "homepage_text": "æ¸åå¤§å­¦ Yuantao Gu--Home--Home\nClick:\nThe Last Update Time:\n-\n-\nä¸­æ\nFaculty Profile\nHome\nScientific Research\nAcademic Achievement\nSelected Publications\nPatents\nBooks and Book Chapters\nProjects\nTeaching Research\nTeaching Resources\nTeaching Information\nTeaching Achievement\nAwards&Honors\nEnrollment Information\nStudent Information\nMy Album\nBlog\nYuantao Gu\nProfessor\nSupervisor of Doctorate Candidates\nSupervisor of Master's Candidates\nName (Simplified Chinese):Yuantao Gu\nName (English):Yuantao Gu\nE-Mail:\n6468a673ef1ca907d2ecff3cd2b393d63cad82f0bc733314bf3429429e4dd599a2758cb927fd6d814fbf1513283574ebcad7328522143eb132ef27334da163c81fd7dd26970bc718d3b3d06d975b80840d316c71512c3db1c3cc17c31e94254852aea3e41e806543190063f33d88481179d7d99db031b27502d6ae69aafed2f8\nSchool/Department:Department of Electronic Engineering, Tsinghua University\nBusiness Address:9-104, Rohm Building\nContact Information:gyt@tsinghua.edu.cn\nProfessional Title:Professor\nStatus:Employed\nAcademic Titles:Professor\nTeacher College:DZGCX\nPersonal homepage:http://gu.ee.tsinghua.edu.cn\nContact Information\nZipCodeï¼\n62bda03a21f6be47d99c58a3772613a27075eef9c35da2856ed9b226889e41867227c6d5288df5775bdffa3e06db6496816d5d6cd700f5bb35d04d0728684ae30a8db31218d4e25b1fea65356f3cb4d4662cc1d728d84e751699278cde613657cae6afc0fea1e743a48b12e1db617e89a267dbcbcf6612307f12c01734616445\nFaxï¼\n6ae48fa1f6a5e4d1beb1ef32152bb231596732db01cf2bddecfc6d7b43ea32e5975a9937c66c6e99ca62f49f8b4a483e00b2b27442732c9c016b35c1710bc8f8e38353195e6f5844fb059229ea2af19f187c83532a1a96fe601e9118d61653ae29ecd1f723197b5e4ac3bc3b34b5fa5aa34c58a2c6a6ebeb67c88e9dc556a70b\nPostalAddressï¼\nb5013f0c6f70c8eccb9553574ad33b82e668b05adc37350ed1b83acc273ae4a3442d338f71ad1640f0f16209fe0253ad7d3b8119a9b68bb540b1c7d0913fce1e1ff3d3391a38ca7945d4228d1b24f5fe8af1df17b32bb74cd6cfcd9e020c4af4501d528ab1ba42f3e2093a8ef2f241b6a2dae5713efb69811c3daf7812374b20\nOfficePhoneï¼\n426f9fb0ef8aad94b50c09f8d47d0ef0bf42be6efb2a25c7af07625d60aa1945096c3ce974ba604a7d626f7b4812bb6a6984464d043de8f98de52b333651ff15e7435f9cc8879c386b7cfbc21b20cfdcfed29d8982a7e27891b43d91725c3fca5db87d87cf1fbb2c209e1f2926ca555facad25d4daae63c951317acb2365129a\nEmailï¼\n6468a673ef1ca907d2ecff3cd2b393d63cad82f0bc733314bf3429429e4dd599a2758cb927fd6d814fbf1513283574ebcad7328522143eb132ef27334da163c81fd7dd26970bc718d3b3d06d975b80840d316c71512c3db1c3cc17c31e94254852aea3e41e806543190063f33d88481179d7d99db031b27502d6ae69aafed2f8\nProfile\nResearch Focus\nSocial Affiliations\nYuantao Gu received the B.E. degree from Xiâan Jiaotong University, in 1998, and the Ph.D. degree (Hons.) from Tsinghua University, in 2003, both in electronic engineering.\nIn 2003, he joined the faculty of Tsinghua University and currently holds the position of Professor with the Department of Electronic Engineering. During his career, he also served as a Visiting Scientist with Microsoft Research Asia from 2005 to 2006, with the Research Laboratory of Electronics, Massachusetts Institute of Technology from 2012 to 2013, and with the Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science, University of Michigan, Ann Arbor, in 2015.\nHis research interests encompass high-dimensional statistics, sparse signal recovery, temporal-space, and graph signal processing, as well as related topics in wireless communications and information networks.\nHe has been an Elected Member of the IEEE Machine Learning for Signal Processing (MLSP) Technical Committee since 2019. From 2019 to 2023, he served as a Senior Area Editor for the IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing. Prior to that, he was an Associate Editor for the IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing from 2015 to 2019 and a Handling Editor for Elsevier Digital Signal Processing from 2015 to 2017. He was also an Elected Member of the IEEE Signal Processing Theory and Methods (SPTM) Technical Committee from 2017 to 2022.\nIn recognition of his contributions, he has received several awards, including the Best Paper Award at IEEE GlobalSIP in 2015, the Award for Best Presentation of a Journal Paper at IEEE ChinaSIP in 2015, the Zhang Si-Ying (CCDC) Outstanding Youth Paper Award in 2017 (shared with one of his students), and the Best Paper Award at ICCSPS in 2019. Additionally, he has received the Outstanding Reviewer Award and Outstanding Editorial Board Member Award for his services at IEEE ICASSP in 2019 and for IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing in 2021, respectively.\nInformation Detection and Intelligent Sensing\nMachine Learning Theory and Methods\nSignal Processing Theory and Methods\nCommunications Signal Processing\nNo content\nStanding Director, Teaching and Textbook Research Association for Circuits, Signals and Systems in Higher Education Institutions (China)\nSenior Member, Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers (IEEE)\nSenior Area Editor (SAE), IEEE Transactions on Signal Processing\nEditorial Board Member, China Communications (Journal)\nMember, IEEE Signal Processing Theory and Methods Technical Committee (SPTM TC)\nMember, IEEE Machine Learning for Signal Processing Technical Committee (MLSP TC)\nMember, Committee on Mathematics and Industry, Chinese Society for Industrial and Applied Mathematics (CSIAM)\nEducation Background\n1.\n1998.9-2003.7\nTsinghua University  | Electronic Engineering,  | Doctoral degree\n2.\n1994.9-1998.7\nXiâan Jiaotong University  | Electronic Engineering  | Bachelor's degree\nPositions & Employments\n1.\n2018.12-Now\nTsinghua Univeristy | Department of Electronic Engineering | Professor\n2.\n2015.9-2015.10\nUniversity of Michigan at Ann Arbor | Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science | Senior Visiting Professor\n3.\n2013.5-2013.8\nStandord University | Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science | Visiting Scholar\n4.\n2012.8-2013.5\nMassachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT) | Department of Electrical Engineering and Computer Science | Visiting Scientist\n5.\n2006.12-2018.12\nTsinghua University, | Department of Electronic Engineering | Associate Professor, Professor\n6.\n2003.8-2006.12\nTsinghua University | Department of Electronic Engineering | Lecturer\nAll rights reserved. Department of electronic engineering, Tsinghua University Address: Tsinghua University, Haidian District, Beijing, 100084"
  },
