 Zhang*\n, Di Chang*, Fang Li, Mohammad Soleymani, Narendra Ahuja\nTMLR 2025\nProject\nGitHub\nLoading...\nS3O: A Dual‑Phase Approach for Reconstructing Dynamic Shape and Skeleton\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Samyak Rawlekar, Narendra Ahuja\nICML 2024\nPaper\nLIMR: Learning Implicit Representation for Reconstructing Articulated Objects\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Samyak Rawlekar, Narendra Ahuja\nICLR 2024\nPaper\nCSL: Class‑Agnostic Structure‑Constrained Learning for Segmentation\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Lu Qi, Ming‑Hsuan Yang, Narendra Ahuja\nAAAI 2024\nPaper\nOpen‑NeRF: Towards Open Vocabulary NeRF Decomposition\nHao Zhang\n, Fang Li, Narendra Ahuja\nWACV 2024\nPaper\nExperience & Education\nWork Experience\nWorld Labs\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2026 Jan – Now\nSnap Research\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2025 Summer – 2025 Dec\nStability AI\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2024 Fall – 2025 Summer\nPIXOCIAL\nAI\nPixocial AI Lab\nResearch Scientist Intern\n2024 Summer\nShanghai AI Lab\nResearch Intern\n2021.10 – 2022.6\nShow More Experience\nEducation\nUniversity of Illinois Urbana‑Champaign\nPh.D. in Computer Vision\n2022–2027 (expected)\nUniversity of Southern California\nM.S. in ECE\n2019–2020\nCUHK, Shenzhen\nVisiting Student\n2021.3 – 2021.10\nCivil Aviation University of China\nB.S. in Telecommunication Engineering\n2014–2018\nMy Beloved Companions\nFifi\nBorn:\n2022-08-14\nWeight:\n6 lbs\nAge:\nLoading...\nTaotao\nBorn:\n2025-02-14\nWeight:\n4 lbs\nAge:\nLoading...\nProfessional Activities\nConference Reviewer\nICLR, NeurIPS, ECCV,\nCVPR, ICML, AAAI, ICCV\nJournal Reviewer\nTIP, TPAMI"
