    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "XinwangLiu' Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nXinwangLiu' Homepage\nXinwang LIU\nProfessor\nwith the school of computer, National University of Defense Technology (\nNUDT\n), Changsha, Hunan, China.\nMy research interests include\nkernel learning\n,\nmulti-view clustering, deep clustering analysis\nand some related topics.\nPlease drop me a message if you also have interests with me by my email:\nxinwangliu@nudt.edu.cn\nor\n1022xinwang.liu@gmail.com\n.\nEducation\nJan. 2020 - present, Professor, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT).\nJan. 2019 - Dec. 2019,  Associate Professor, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT).\nJan. 2014 – Dec. 2018, Assistant Researcher, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT).\nJun. 2014--Feb. 2015, Visiting Fellow,  University of Wollongong,  Australia.\nOct. 2011--Nov. 2013, Visiting PhD student of University of Wollongong (UoW) & University of Technology Sydney (UTS),  Australia.\nSep. 2010--Sep. 2011, Visiting PhD student of research school of information science and engineering,  The Australian National University,  Canberra, Australia.\nFeb. 2009-- Aug. 2010,  PhD student of school of computer, National University of Defense Technology (NUDT).\nSep. 2006--Dec. 2008,  Master, student of school of computer,  National University of Defense Technology (NUDT), Changsha, Hunan, China.\nSep. 2002--July. 2006, Bachelor, school of computer,  Chongqing Technology and Business University (CTBU), Chongqing, China.\nRepresentative Work\nXinwang Liu\n, Miaomiao Li, Chang Tang, Jingyuan Xia, Jian Xiong, Li Liu, Marius Kloft and En Zhu:\nEfficient and Effective Incomplete Multi-view Clustering\n. IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nT-PAMI\n). (Accepted Feb 14th, 2020)\nXinwang Liu\n, Lei Wang, Xinzhong Zhu, Miaomiao Li, En Zhu, Tongliang Liu, Li Liu, Yong Dou and Jianping Yin:\nAbsent Multiple Kernel Learning Algorithms\n.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nT-PAMI\n). (Accepted Jan. 2019)\nXinwang Liu\n, Xinzhong Zhu, Miaomiao Li, Lei Wang, En Zhu, Tongliang Liu, Marius Kloft, Dinggang Shen, Jianping Yin and Wen Gao:\nMultiple Kernel k-means with Incomplete Kernels\n. IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nT-PAMI\n). (Accepted Jan. 2019)\nXinwang Liu\n, Xinzhong Zhu, Miaomiao Li, Lei Wang, Chang Tang, Jianping Yin, Dinggang Shen, Huaimin Wang and Wen Gao:\nLate Fusion Incomplete Multi-view Clustering\n. IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (\nT-PAMI\n)\n41(10): 2410-2423 (2019)\nXinwang Liu\n, Lei Wang, Jian Zhang, Jianping Yin and Huan Liu:\nGlobal and Local Structure Preservation for Feature Selection\n. IEEE\nT-NNLS\n25(6): 1083-1095 (2014)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
