    "homepage_text": "Yeyun Gong at Microsoft Research\nSkip to main content\nMicrosoft\nResearch\nResearch\nResearch\nSearch\nSearch Microsoft Research\nNo results\nCancel\nYeyun Gong\nPrincipal Research Manager\nAbout\nDr. Yeyun Gong is a principal research manager in Artificial Intelligence Reasoning & System group at Microsoft Research Asia. His current research interests focus on large language models.\nHe has published more than 70 papers in top-tier conferences, such as ICLR, ICML, NeurIPS, ACL, EMNLP NAACL and so on.\nWe are hiring LLM interns!  If you’re interested in large language model, please contact me through yegong@microsoft.com.\nOpens in a new tab\nResearch areas\nArtificial intelligence\nHuman language technologies\nFollow us:\nFollow on X\nLike on Facebook\nFollow on LinkedIn\nSubscribe on Youtube\nFollow on Instagram\nSubscribe to our RSS feed\nShare this page:\nShare on X\nShare on Facebook\nShare on LinkedIn\nShare on Reddit"
