    "homepage_text": "Kyungwoo Song's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nKyungwoo Song's Homepage\nkyungwoo song\nProfessor of Mathematics\nSpace21 #517, Kyung Hee University\nKyungheedae-ro 26, Dongdaemun-gu\nSeoul, Korea 02447\nE-mail:\nkyusong\n<at>\nkhu.ac.kr\nTelephone: +82-2-961-0893 (\nFax:\n+82-2-961-0\n644)\nResearch Interest  -\nNonlinear\npartial differential equations arising from physics\nEducation\nPh.D Mathematics,\nIndiana University\n, Bloomington, IN USA  (1997.09 - 2002.0\n5\n)\nThesis advisor: Yuxi Zheng (currrently at Penn State University)\nAcademic Positions\nProfessor, Associate Professor, Assistant Professor,\nKyung Hee University\n, Seoul Korea (2005.03 - present)\nRalph Boas Assistant Professor,\nNorthwestern University\n, Evanston, IL USA (2002.09 - 2005.02).\nVisiting Associate Professor,\nYeshiva University\n, NYC, NY USA (2011.09 - 2012.08)\nVisiting Professor,\nUniversity of British Columbia\n, Vancouver, BC CANADA (2018.09 - 2019.08)\nVisiting Professor,\nKorea Institute for Advanced Study (\nKIAS)\n, Seoul (2024.09-2025.02)\nProfessional Activities\nHandling e\nditor of Communications of the Korean Mathematical Society (2016.01 - present)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
