    "homepage_text": "Guo-Jun Qi's Home Page\nBiography\nPublications\nResearch\nProjects\nTeam\nTeaching\nServices\nSponsors\nAwards\n中文\nWestlake University\r\nhomepage\nLaboratory\r\n for MAchine Perception and LEarning (MAPLE)\nResearch\n|\nAwards\n|\nProjects\n|\nStudents\n|\nPublications\n|\nTeaching\n|\nServices\n|\nNews\n|\nSponsors\nGuo\n-Jun\r\nQi, Ph.D.,\nFellow of\r\nIEEE, IAPR and AAIA\nACM\r\nDistinguished Scientiest\nI am\r\nhiring Principal/Staff/Senior/Research Scientists for developing\r\nmultimodal AI/AIGC and physical-virtual interaction systems\r\nmulti-continent  Research Centers/Labs.\r\n Interested\r\ncandidates can reach me directly.\nEmail:\nguojunq\nat\ngmail\ndot com\nLaboratory:\nMa\nchine\nP\nerception\r\nand\nLe\narning\r\n(MAPLE)\nhttp://maple-lab.net\n[\nurl\n]\nProject\r\ngithub\r\nhomepage:\nhttps://github.com/maple-research-lab\n[\ngithub\n]\nFollow me on:\nX\n,\nLinkIn\n,\nFacebook,\nTwitter,\nZhihu\n,\nXiaohongshu\nResearch Interests\nFoundation Models and Multimodal\r\nLLMs\nGeneral-Purpose AI/AIGC\nMultimodal\r\nEmbodied AI\nOngoing Projects (to be\r\nupdated)\nEffectively Training Language Models for Complex Tasks\nReinforcing\nD\niffusion\nC\nhain of\nL\nateral\nT\nhoughts (DCoLT) [\npdf\n]\nPrompt-aware Test-time Optimization of Large Language Models [\npdf\n]\nReinforced Diffusion\r\nTraining - Scheduling Diffusion Time On the\r\nFly [\npdf\n|\ngithub\n]\nEfficient Diffusion and\r\nFlow-based Generative Models\nOne-Step Diffuion Model\n[\nNeurIPS 2024:\npdf\n|\ngithub\n]\nOne-Step Flow Generator Model [\npdf\n|\r\ngithub]\nInference-time\r\nScaling Laws for Improving Generative Foundation Models\nSelf-Guidance\r\nover Time of Diffusion Processes\n[\npdf\n| github]\nContrastive\r\nDecoding for Multimodal LLMs\n[pdf\r\n| github]\nNews\nRecent\r\nNews [\nMore News\n]:\n[November 2023] I am honored\r\nto be elected Changjiang Scholar Chair Professorship by Ministry of\r\nEducation.\n[November 2022]  I\r\nwill serve as a member