    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "ä½æå----Laboratory of Brain Cognition and Brain-inspired Intelligence\nPeople\nProfessor\nAssociate Professor\nAssistant Professor\nEngineer\nPeople\nProfessor\nAssociate Professor\nAssistant Professor\nEngineer\nProfessor\nLocationï¼\nHome\n>\nPeople\n>\nProfessor\nHuiguang He\nTitleï¼\nProfessor\nE-mailï¼\nhuiguang.he@ia.ac.cn\nDepartmentï¼\nLaboratory of Brain Atlas and Brain-inspired Intelligence\nAddressï¼\n95 Zhongguancun East Road, 100190, Beijing, China\nZip Codeï¼\n100190\nCurriculum Vitae\nHuiguang He,professor with Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences (CASIA),doctoral supervisor.He is a distinguished core researcher of the Chinese Academy of Sciences and a national high-level leading talent. He has presided over a number of important projects, including the National Natural Science Foundation of China, the 863 Project, and the National Key Research Program. He has won two second prizes of the National Science and Technology Progress Award (ranked second and third), two Beijing Science and Technology Progress Awards, the first prize of the Ministry of Education Science and Technology Progress Award (ranked third), and the first Outstanding Doctoral Dissertation Award of the Chinese Academy of Sciences. He was selected into the National High-level Talent Program, Beijing Science and Technology Rising Star, \"Lu Jiaxi Young Talent Award\" of the Chinese Academy of Sciences, and an outstanding member of the Youth Innovation Promotion Association of the Chinese Academy of Sciences. His research fields are artificial intelligence, medical image analysis, brain-computer interface, etc., and his research results have been published in more than 200 articles in IEEEâTPAMI/TNNLS/TCYB/TMI/TMM, ICML, etc. He is a member of the editorial board of Acta Automatica Sinica and the Chinese Journal of Image and Graphics. IEEE Senior Member, CCF/CSIG Distinguished Member. Recipient of the 70th Anniversary Medal of the Founding of the People's Republic of China.\nResearch Direction\nPattern Recognition, Medical Image Processing, Brain Cognition, Brain Computer Interface.\nResearch Projects\nNational Natural Science Foundation of China\nRepresentative Works\n(1) Changde Du; Kaicheng Fu; Jinpeng Li ; Huiguang He ; Decoding Visual Neural Representations by Multimodal Learning of Brain-Visual-Linguistic Features, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysisâand Machine Intelligence, 2023, 45(9): 10760-10777\n(2) Zhongyu Huang; Yingheng Wang; Chaozhuo Li ; Huiguang He ; Growing Like a Tree: Finding Trunks From Graph Skeleton Trees, IEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence,â2023\n(3) Changde Du; Changying Du; Lijie Huang; Huiguang He ; Reconstructing Perceived Images From Human Brain Activities With Bayesian Deep Multiview Learning, IEEE Transactions on NeuralâNetworks and Learning Systems(TNNLS), 2019.8, 30(8): 2310-2323\n(4) Jinpeng Li ; Shuang Qiu; Yuan-Yuan Shen; Cheng-Lin Liu; Huiguang He ; Multisource Transfer Learning for Cross-subject EEG Emotion Recognition, IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics, 2020.7,â50(7): 3281-3293\n(5) Zhiqiang Chen; Ting-Bing Xu; Changde Du; Cheng-Lin Liu; Huiguang He ; Dynamical Channel Pruning by Conditional Accuracy Change for Deep Neural Networks, IEEE Transactions on NeuralâNetworks and Learning Systems, 2021.2, 32(2): 799-813\nCopyright\nInstitute of Automation Chinese Academy of Sciences All Rights Reserved\nAddress: 95 Zhongguancun East Road, 100190, BEIJING, CHINA\nEmailï¼\nbrain-ai@ia.ac.cn"
  },
