    "homepage_text": "Yao Cheng | Florida Atlantic University\nSkip to main content\nCollege of Engineering & Computer Science\nSUB MENU\nCollege Home\nAbout\nAbout the College\nMessage from the Dean\nCollege Advisory Board\nPrograms\nCivil Engineering (BS, MS)\nComputer Engineering (BS, MS, PhD)\nComputer Science (BS, MS, Prof MS, PhD, Prof PhD, Minor)\nData Science (BS, MS, Cert)\nElectrical Engineering (BS, MS, PhD)\nEnvironmental Engineering (BS)\nGeomatics Engineering (BS, Minor)\nMechanical Engineering (BS, MS, PhD)\nOcean Engineering (BS, MS, PhD)\nArtificial Intelligence (MS, Prof MS, Cert, Prof Cert)\nBiomedical Engineering (BS, MS, Cert)\nInformation Technology & Management (MS, Prof MS)\nBig Data Analytics (Cert, Prof Cert)\nCybersecurity (Minor, Cert)\nCorrosion (Cert)\nOffshore Engineering (Cert)\nTransportation Engineering (Cert)\nTransportation, Logistics, and Supply Chain Management (Cert)\nSurveying and Mapping (Cert)\nDepartments\nCivil, Environmental & Geomatics Engineering (CEGE)\nElectrical Engineering & Computer Science (EECS)\nOcean & Mechanical Engineering (OME)\nBiomedical Engineering (BME)\nPeople\nFaculty\nDean's Office\nResearch\nStudent Advising (CASE)\nProspective Students\nResources\nStudent\nWomen in Engineering & Computer Science\nClubs & Organizations\nScholarships\nPhD Dissertation Defense\nFaculty\nEmeriti\nPolicies\nSenior Design\nTechnical Services Group\nBranding\nContact Us\nDean's Office & Departments\nVisitor Information\nYao Cheng\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment of Civil, Environmental and Geomatics Engineering\n777 Glades Road, EW 225\nBoca Raton, FL 33431-0991\np: 561-297-3743\nchengy@fau.edu\nEducation\nPh.D., University of Maryland, 2020\nMS, University of Maryland, 2014\nResearch Interest\nTraffic operation\nTraffic safety\nMachine learning\n©"
