    "homepage_text": "Tuanfeng Y. Wang\nTuanfeng Y. Wang        ᶘ ᵒᴥᵒᶅ\nI am currently a Research Scientist at Adobe Research. I got my PhD from University College London, advised by Niloy J. Mitra, and B.S. from University of Science and Technology of China, advised by Ligang Liu.\nMy research interests are computer graphics and computer vision, including neural rendering, geometry processing, computational fabrication, computational geometry, 3D reconstruction, augmented/visual reality, etc.\nI regularly host Research Intern at Adobe Research. Please contact me if you are interested!\nContact\nGoogle Scholar\nPublications\nV-RGBX: Video Editing with Accurate Controls over Intrinsic Properties\nYe Fang, Tong Wu, Valentin Deschaintre, Duygu Ceylan, Iliyan Georgiev, Chun-Hao Paul Huang, Yiwei Hu, Xuelin Chen, Tuanfeng Yang Wang\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2026\nWebsite\nReasonX: MLLM-Guided Intrinsic Image Decomposition\nAlara Dirik, Tuanfeng Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Stefanos Zafeiriou and Anna Frühstück\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2026\nPaper\nSpaceTimePilot: Generative Rendering of Dynamic Scenes Across Space and Time\nZhening Huang, Hyeonho Jeong, Xuelin Chen, Yulia Gryaditskaya, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Joan Lasenby, Chun-Hao Huang\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2026\nWebsite\nCan3Tok: Canonical 3D Tokenization and Latent Modeling of Scene-Level 3D Gaussians\nQuankai Gao, Iliyan Georgiev, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Krishna Kumar Singh, Ulrich Neumann, Jae Shin Yoon\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV) 2025\nWebsite\nComprehensive Relighting: Generalizable and Consistent Monocular Human Relighting and Harmonization\nJunying Wang, Jingyuan Liu, Xin Sun, Krishna Kumar Singh, Zhixin Shu, He Zhang, Jimei Yang, Nanxuan Zhao, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Simon S. Chen, Ulrich Neumann, Jae Shin Yoon\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2025\nWebsite\nPerm: A Parametric Representation for Multi-Style 3D Hair Modeling\nChengan He, Xin Sun, Zhixin Shu, Fujun Luan, Sören Pirk, Jorge Alejandro Amador Herrera, Dominik L. Michels, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Meng Zhang, Holly Rushmeier, and Yi Zhou\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2025 (Spotlight)\nWebsite\nDigital Salon: An AI and Physics-Driven Tool for 3D Hair Grooming and Simulation\nChengan He*, Jorge Alejandro Amador Herrera*, Yi Zhou*, Zhixin Shu, Xin Sun, Yao Feng, Sören Pirk, Dominik L. Michels, Meng Zhang, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Holly Rushmeier\nACM SIGGRAPH Asia (Live Demo), 2024.\nWebsite\nIntrinsicDiffusion: Joint Intrinsic Layers from Latent Diffusion Models\nJundan Luo, Nanxuan Zhao, Wenbin Li, Duygu Ceylan, Julien Philip, Christian Richardt, Jae Shin Yoon, Anna Frühstück, Tuanfeng Y. Wang\nACM SIGGRAPH (conference), 2024.\nWebsite\nSynCHMR: Synergistic Global-space Camera and Human Reconstruction from Videos\nYizhou Zhao, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Bhiksha Raj, Min Xu, Jimei Yang, Chun-Hao Paul Huang\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2024.\nPaper (coming soon)\nGenerative Rendering: Controllable 4D-Guided Video Generation with 2D Diffusion Models\nShengqu Cai, Duygu Ceylan, Matheus Gadelha, Chun-Hao Paul Huang, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Gordon Wetzstein\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2024.\nPaper\nPattern Guided UV Recovery for Realistic Video Garment Texturing\nYouyi Zhan, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Tianjia Shao, Kun Zhou\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics, 2024.\nPaper\nNeural Garment Dynamics via Manifold-Aware Transformers\nPeizhuo Li, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Timur Levent Kesdogan, Duygu Ceylan, Olga Sorkine-Hornung\nACM Eurographics 2024.\nPaper\nNeural 3D Face Rendering conditioned on 2D appearance via GAN Disentanglement Method\nRuizhao Chen, Ran Yi, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Lizhuang Ma\nComputer & Graphics 2023.\nPaper\nBest Paper Honorable Mention\nBlowing in the Wind: CycleNet for Human Cinemagraphs from Still Images\nHugo Bertiche, Niloy J. Mitra, Kuldeep Kulkarni, Chun-Hao Paul Huang, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Meysam Madadi, Sergio Escalera, Duygu Ceylan\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2023.\nWebsite\nUS Patent\nNormal-guided Garment UV Prediction for Human Re-texturing\nYasamin Jafarian, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Jimei Yang, Nathan Carr, Yi Zhou, Hyun Soo Park\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2023 (Highlight paper).\nWebsite\nUS Patent\nComplete 3D Human Reconstruction from a Single Incomplete Image\nJunying Wang, Jae Shin Yoon, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Krishna Kumar Singh, Ulrich Neumannn\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2023.\nWebsite\nUS Patent\nLearning a Style Space for Interactive Line Drawing Synthesis from Animated 3D Models\nZeyu Wang, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Julie Dorsey\nPacific Conference on Computer Graphics and Applications (PG), 2022.\nCode\nUS Patent\nGarment Ideation: Iterative View-aware Sketch-based Garment Modeling\nPinaki Nath Chowdhury, Tuanfeng Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Yi-Zhe Song, Yulia Gryaditskaya\nInternational Conference on 3D Vision (3DV) 2022 (Oral).\nPaper\nCode\nA Repulsive Force Unit for Garment Collision Handling in Neural Networks\nQingyang Tan, Yi Zhou, Tuanfeng Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Xin Sun, Dinesh Manocha\nThe European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV) 2022.\nPaper\nCode\nUS Patent\nLearning Motion-Dependent Appearance for High-Fidelity Rendering of Dynamic Humans from a Single Camera\nJae Shin Yoon, Duygu Ceylan, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Jingwan (Cynthia) Lu, Jimei Yang, Zhixin Shu, Hyun Soo Park\nIEEE Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR) 2022.\nWebpage\nUS Patent\nDance In the Wild: Monocular Human Animation with Neural Dynamic Appearance Synthesis\nTuanfeng Y. Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Krishna Kumar Singh, Niloy J. Mitra\nInternational Conference on 3D Vision 2021 (Oral).\nWebpage\nUS Patent\nDynamic Neural Garments\nMeng Zhang, Tuanfeng Y. Wang, Duygu Ceylan, Niloy J. Mitra\nACM SIGGRAPH Asia 2021.\nPaper/code/data\nUS Patent\nD