    "homepage_text": "Professor - People - 计算数学与科学工程计算研究所\n2026-03-25 Wednesday\nSign in\nCN\nHome\nAbout\nAbout us\nPeople\nCAS/CAE Academician\nProfessor\nSupporting Staff of ICMSEC\nPost-doctors\nActivities\nConferences\nColloquia & Seminars\nFeng Kang Youth Forum on Scientific Computing\nPeople\nCAS/CAE Academician\nProfessor\nSupporting Staff of ICMSEC\nPost-doctors\nProfessor\nHome\n- People\nView your home page\nYifa Tang,\nProfessor\nResearch direction：\nSymplectic Algorithms for Hamiltonian Systems, Numerical Analysis of Fractional Differential Equations with Applications\nRepresentative work：\n[1] Y.F. Tang, The Symplecticity of Multi-Step Methods, Computers & Mathematics with Applications, 25(3), 83-90 (1993), https://doi.org/10.1016/0898-1221(93)90146-M.\r\n[2] W.P. Bu, Y.F. Tang & J.Y. Yang, Galerkin Finite Element Method for Two-Dimensional Riesz Space Fractional Diffusion Equations, Journal of Computational Physics, 276, 26-38 (2014), http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2014.07.023.\r\n[3] B.B. Zhu, R.L. Zhang, Y.F. Tang, X.B. Tu & Y. Zhao, Splitting K-symplectic methods for non-canonical separable Hamiltonian problems, Journal of Computational Physics, 322, 387-399 (2016), http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2016.06.044.\r\n[4] P.Z. Jin, Y.F. Tang & A.Q. Zhu, Unit Triangular Factorization of the Matrix Symplectic Group, SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications, 41(4), 1630-1650 (2020), https://doi.org/10.1137/19M1308839.\r\n[5] A.Q. Zhu, S.D. Wu & Y.F. Tang, Error Analysis Based on Inverse Modified Differential Equations for Discovery of Dynamics Using Linear Multistep Methods and Deep Learning, SIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis, 62(5), 2087-2120 (2024), https://doi.org/10.1137/22M152373X.\nContact information：\nOffice：Room 712, South Building\nTelephone：0086-10-82541923\nEmail：tyf@lsec.cc.ac.cn\nYifa Tang\nYifa Tang,\nProfessor\n[1] Y.F. Tang, The Symplecticity of Multi-Step Methods, Computers & Mathematics with Applications, 25(3), 83-90 (1993), https://doi.org/10.1016/0898-1221(93)90146-M.\r\n[2] W.P. Bu, Y.F. Tang & J.Y. Yang, Galerkin Finite Element Method for Two-Dimensional Riesz Space Fractional Diffusion Equations, Journal of Computational Physics, 276, 26-38 (2014), http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2014.07.023.\r\n[3] B.B. Zhu, R.L. Zhang, Y.F. Tang, X.B. Tu & Y. Zhao, Splitting K-symplectic methods for non-canonical separable Hamiltonian problems, Journal of Computational Physics, 322, 387-399 (2016), http://dx.doi.org/10.1016/j.jcp.2016.06.044.\r\n[4] P.Z. Jin, Y.F. Tang & A.Q. Zhu, Unit Triangular Factorization of the Matrix Symplectic Group, SIAM Journal on Matrix Analysis and Applications, 41(4), 1630-1650 (2020), https://doi.org/10.1137/19M1308839.\r\n[5] A.Q. Zhu, S.D. Wu & Y.F. Tang, Error Analysis Based on Inverse Modified Differential Equations for Discovery of Dynamics Using Linear Multistep Methods and Deep Learning, SIAM Journal on Numerical Analysis, 62(5), 2087-2120 (2024), https://doi.org/10.1137/22M152373X.\nView your home page\nAddress\n北京市海淀区中关村东路55号\nTelephone\n0086-10-82541923\nPostal code\n100190     2719信箱\nOffice\nRoom 712, South Building\nFax\n0086-10-82541993\nCopyright © 计算数学与科学工程计算研究所\n京ICP备05002806号-10\n京公网安备110402500020号"
