    "homepage_text": "HeheFan's Homepage\nHehe Fan\nZhejiang University\nHome\nPublications\nChallenge\nAward\nDirections\nBIO\nI am currently a ZJU100 Young Professor with the College of Computer Science and Technology at Zhejiang University. \n        Before that, I was a Research Fellow with Prof. Mohan S. Kankanhalli at National University of Singapore. \n        My research focuses on deep learning, computer vision, multimedia and AI for science. \n        I received my PhD degree at University of Technology Sydney, advised by Prof. Yi Yang.\nI am looking for highly motivated visiting students with exceptional coding ability and research experience. \n        Please drop me an email if you're interested.\nGoogle Scholar\nGitHub\nChinese\nNews\nJuly 2025\nTwo papers accepted to ACM MM 2025.\nJune 2025\nThree papers accepted to ICCV 2025.\nMay 2025\nTwo papers accepted to ICML 2025.\nApr 2025\nOne paper accepted to SIGIR 2025, Two papers accepted to IJCAI 2025.\nMar 2025\nThree papers accepted to CVPR 2025, with one Highlight.\nJan 2025\nTwo papers accepted to ICLR 2025.\nDec 2024\nTwo papers accepted to AAAI 2025.\nNov 2024\nTwo papers accepted to ACM TOMM.\nOct 2024\nACM Multimedia 2024 Outstanding Area Chair.\nSept 2024\nOne paper accepted to NeurIPS 2024 Spotlight.\nAug 2024\nReceived 2024 Intel China Academic Excellence Program Honorary Scholar Award.\nAug 2024\nOne paper accepted to IJCV.\nJuly 2024\nTwo papers accepted to ECCV 2024. One paper accepted to ACM MM 2024.\nJuly 2024\nWe won the 1st place in the Track 1 of the Micro-gesture Classification of MiGA-IJCAI 2024 Challenge."
  },
