    "homepage_text": "Yuqing Ma（马宇晴）\nAbout Me\nAcademic Group\nResearch Interests :\nLLM alignment · Agent Reasoning · Embodied intelligence · AI for Mental Illness and Brain Science\nAcademic Appointments:\nYouth Editorial Board, Journal of Intelligent Safety |\r\n                                Workshop Chair, IJCAI (3 consecutive editions) |\r\n                                Deputy Chief Referee, AI Engineering Technology, 2nd National Vocational Skills Competition\nEmail:\nmayuqing@buaa.edu.cn\n|\nvickyfoxmyq@gmail.com\nAcademic Group\nPhD Candidates (8)\nTianbo Wang, Zhange Zhang, Yajun Gao, Duorui Wang, Chujie Xu, Xiangyang Xun, Jingbin Shi, Xiaotong Zhu\nMaster Students (4)\nYulong Wang, Zhicheng Geng, Yudie Wang, Kewei Liao\nGroup Life\nIJCAI 2025\nPsychiatric Assoc 2024\nShandong Brain Science\nACL 2025 Vienna\nProspective Interns\nWe are always looking for highly motivated\nvisiting interns\nwho are passionate about LLM and brain-inspired computing.  \r\n                                    If you have a solid background in deep learning and strong coding skills (PyTorch / Python), please send your\nCV + transcript + one-page research statement\nto\ntianbowang@buaa.edu.cn\n. We look forward to your joining us!\nUpdates\nOur textbook 人工智能安全导论 (introduction to AI Security) has been published. Available on\nJD\nand\nTaobao\n.\nJan, 2026: one paper accepted for\nICLR\n.\nOct, 2025: Best Paper Award, RichMediaGenAI Workshop @\nACM Multimedia.\nJul, 2025: Outstanding Paper Award, MAS-2025 Workshop @\nICML.\nSelected into Beijing High-tech Innovation Plan Youth Talent Support Project.\nNov, 2025: three papers accepted for\nAAAI\n.\nSep, 2025: two papers accepted for\nNeurIPS\n.\nOct, 2025: one paper accepted for\nTMM\n.\nAug, 2025: one paper accepted for\nEMNLP\n.\nJul, 2025: one paper accepted for\nNeural Networks\n.\nJul, 2025: one paper accepted for\nACL\n.\nApr, 2025: First Prize, AI Challenge of the 9th Young Medical Physics Scholars Conference.\nApr, 2025: 5th Place, Generalizable Dose Prediction for Heterogenous Multi-Cohort & Multi-Site Radiotherapy Planning Challenge\n(GDP-HMM)\n.\nApr, 2025: one paper accepted for\nWWW\n.\nApr, 2025: two papers accepted for\nIJCAI\n.\nMar, 2025: one paper accepted for\nPattern Recognition\n.\nFeb, 2024: one paper accepted for\nScience China (Information Sciences)\n.\nPublications\nSelected Publications\nAll Publications\nCASE: Conflict-assessed Knowledge-sensitive Neuron Tuning for Lifelong Model Editing.\nZhange Zhang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Yulong Wang, Tianbo Wang, Jiakai Wang, Simin Li, Xianglong Liu\nWWW, 2026\n.\nQuery-Routed Activation Editing with Truth-hierarchical Preference Optimization.\nKewei Liao, Tianbo Wang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Zhange Zhang, Zhicheng Geng, Xiaowei Zhao, Jiakai Wang, Xianglong Liu\nAAAI, 2026\n.\nConflict-Aware Knowledge Editing in the Wild: Semantic-Augmented Graph Representation for Unstructured Text.\nZhange Zhang, Zhicheng Geng,\nYuqing Ma\n, Tianbo Wang, Kai Lv, Xianglong Liu\nNeurIPS, 2025\n.\nLexical Diversity-aware Relevance Assessment for Retrieval-Augmented Generation.\nZhange Zhang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Yulong Wang, Shan He, Tianbo Wang, Siqi He, Jiakai Wang, Xianglong Liu\nACL, 2025\n.\n[pdf]\nInversed Pyramid Network with Spatial-adapted and Task-oriented Tuning for few-shot learning.\nXiaowei Zhao, Duorui Wang, Shihao Bai, Shuo Wang, Yajun Gao, Yu Liang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Xianglong Liu\nPattern Recognition, 2025\n.\n[pdf]\nDual Intention Escape: Penetrating and Toxic Jailbreak Attack against Large Language Models.\nYanni Xue, Jiakai Wang, Zixin Yin,\nYuqing Ma\n, Haotong Qin, Renshuai Tao, Xianglong Liu\nThe ACM on Web Conference, 2025\n.\n[pdf]\nToken-Aware Inference-Time Intervention for Large Language Model Alignment.\nTianbo Wang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Kewei Liao, Chengzhao Yang, Zhange Zhang, Jiakai Wang, Xianglong Liu.\nEMNLP, 2025\n.\n[pdf]\nCognitMoE: A cognition-aware collaborative multi-expert network for bipolar disorder diagnosis.\nXiaotong Zhu, Yudie Wang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Zhange Zhang, Yujun Gao\nNN, 2025\n.\n[pdf]\nContinuous Diffusive Prediction Network for Multi-Station Weather Prediction.\nChujie Xu,\nYuqing Ma*\n, Haoyuan Deng, Yajun Gao, Yudie Wang, Kai Lv, Xianglong Liu\nIJCAI, 2025\n.\nSeeMore: a spatiotemporal predictive model with bidirectional distillation and level-specific meta-adaptation.\nYuqing Ma\n, Wei Liu, Yajun Gao, Yang Yuan, Shihao Bai, Haotong Qin, Xianglong Liu\nScience China Information Sciences, 2024\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\nAnnealing-based Label-Transfer Learning for Open World Object Detection.\nYuqing Ma\n, Hainan Li, Zhange Zhang, Jinyang Guo, Shanghang Zhang, Ruihao Gong, Xianglong Liu\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition, 2023\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\nTowards Real-world X-ray Security Inspection: A High-quality Benchmark and Lateral Inhibition Module for Prohibited Items Detection.\nRenshuai Tao, Yanlu Wei, Xiangjian Jiang, Hainan Li, Haotong Qin, Jiakai Wang,\nYuqing Ma\n, Libo Zhang, Xianglong Liu.\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV’2021)\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\nStratified Rule-Aware Network for Abstract Visual Reasoning.\nSheng Hu*,\nYuqing Ma*\n, Xianglong Liu, Yanlu Wei, Shihao Bai (* equal contribution)\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI’2021)\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\n[bibtex]\nOccluded Prohibited Items Detection: an X-ray Security Inspection Benchmark and De-occlusion Attention Module.\nYanlu Wei, Renshuai Tao, Zhangjie Wu,\nYuqing Ma\n, Libo Zhang, Xianglong Liu\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM’20)\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\n[bibtex]\nSpatiotemporal Attacks for Embodied Agents.\nAishan Liu, Tairan Huang, Xianglong Liu, Yitao Xu,\nYuqing Ma\n, Xinyun Chen, Stephen Maybank, Dacheng Tao\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV’20)\n.\n[pdf]\n[code]\n[media]\nFew-shot Visual Learning with Contextual Memory and Fine-grained Calibration.\nYuqing Ma\n, Shihao Bai, Wei Liu, Qingyu Zhang, Aishan Liu, Weimin Chen, Xianglong Liu\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI’20)\n[pdf]\n[code]\nTransductive Relation-Propagation Network for Few-shot Learning.\nYuqing Ma\n, Shihao Bai, Shan An, Wei Liu, Aishan Liu, Xiantong Zhen, Xianglong Liu\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI’20)\n[pdf]\n[code]\nMain Awards & Honors\nBest Paper Award, RichMediaGenAI Workshop @ ACM Multimedia 2025\nOutstanding Paper Award, MAS-2025 Workshop @ ICML 2025\nSelected for Beijing High-tech Innovation Plan Youth Talent Support Project, 2025\nFirst Prize in the Artificial Intelligence Challenge of the 9th Annual Conference of Young Medical Physics Scholars, 2025\nthe 5th Place Team of The Generalizable Dose Prediction for Heterogenous Multi-Cohort and Multi-Site Radiotherapy Planning Challenge, 2025\nBronze Medal of the 17th Beijing Invention and Innovation Competition, Beijing Invention Association, Beijing Workers and Technical Association, 2023\nTop Ten Outstanding Papers in Intelligent Security, Editorial Department of Intelligent Security, 2024\nMain Co-authors\nXianglong Liu\nAishan Liu\nJinyang Guo\nJiakai Wang"
