    "github": "https://github.com/ChuanqiTan",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Chuanqi Tan's Homepage\nChuanqi Tan\nI received Ph.D. degree in Computer Sciences and Technology from\nTsinghua University\nin July 2019, under the supervision of Prof. Fuchun Sun.\nI am currently focused on research and development in the field of LLMs and their applications. I am also a Post-doctoral Fellow at\nThe University of Hong Kong\n, under the supervision of Prof. Dong Xu.\nMy research interests include: Deep Learning, Transfer Learning, Computer Vision, BCI, LLM and Robot.\nWork Experience\nCTO at\nDeepAI\n, in 2023-2024.\nSenior algorithm researcher at\nTencent\n, in 2019-2022.\nVisiting scholar at\nThe University of Sydney\n, with the support of CSC Scholarship in 2018-2019.\nLeader of technical department at TDRH education, in 2014-2015.\nSenior research & develop engineer at\nBaidu\n, in 2013-2014.\nResearch & develop engineer at\nChina Search\n, in 2012-2013.\nSelected Publications\nFull paper list can be found on\nGoogle Scholar\n:\n(ICCV 2021)\nMeta Gradient Adversarial Attack.\n(T-IP)\nCross-Modal Knowledge Adaptation for Language-Based Person Search.\n(T-CSVT)\nShow, tell and summarize: Dense video captioning using visual cue aided sentence summarization.\n(T-IP)\nFeature pyramid reconfiguration with consistent loss for object detection.\n(ICASSP 2019)\nAttention based Transfer Learning for Brain Computer Interface.\n(IJARS)\nAutoencoder-based transfer learning in brain–computer interface for rehabilitation robot.\n(ICANN 2018)\nA Survey on Deep Transfer Learning.\n(T-FS)\nLDS-FCM: A linear dynamical system based fuzzy C-means method for tactile recognition.\n(T-CSDS)\nFused Fuzzy Petri Nets: A Shared Control Method for Brain–Computer Interface Systems.\n(ICASSP 2018)\nDeep Transfer Learning for EEG-based Brain Computer Interface.\n(ICONIP 2017)\nMultimodal Classification with Deep Convolutional-Recurrent Neural Networks for Electroencephalography.\n(Best Student Paper Award)\nAcademic Services\nReviewer of Journal:\nNature Communications\n, IEEE RA-L, IEEE T-II, IJARS, IJ-BHI, JCAS, JJCIT, KAIS, Neurocomputing, IEEE Access\nReviewer of Conference:\nAAAI, IJCNN, IROS, ICANN, ICONIP, ICCSIP, IEEE-MFi, IEEE-CYBER\nProgram Committee:\nIEEE-CYBER 2018, ICANN 2019, ICONIP 2019, ICONIP 2021\nAwards\nExcellence Research Award of Tencent\n, 2020\nOutstanding Contributor of Tencent, 2020\nCSC Scholarship, 2018\nBest Student Paper Award from ICONIP\n, 2017\nExcellent Graduate Student of BIT, 2011\nIBM Blue Road Award, 2011\nBIT Scholarship, 2009\nUpdated on\n2025\n, thank you for visiting.\ntanchuanqi.com"
  },
  "serper::Shaoli Huang": {
