    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Websoft: Yuzhong Qu\napache\njspωiki\nG’day (anonymous guest)\nUser Preferences\nLog in\nRegister a new user!\nFor full search, hit enter...\nRecent Searches\nYuzhong Qu\n☰\nInfo\n1\nVersion :\n1\nDate Modified :\n12-Jul-2022 12:45\nAuthor :\r\n\t\t程龚\nMore Info...\nAttachments\n1\nReading time: 1.1 mins, 242 words\nE\ndit\nMore...\nView Page Source\nShow Reader View\nEmail\n: yzqu#nju.edu.cn\nOffice\n: Room 808, Building of Computer Science Technology, Nanjing University Xianlin Campus, 163 Xianlin Avenue, Nanjing 210023, China\n中文\nHe is a Professor at the Department of Computer Science and Technology, Nanjing University. He got the Ph.D. in Computer Software from Nanjing University in 1995, M.S. in Mathematics from Fudan University in 1988, and B.S. in Mathematics from Fudan University in 1985. His research interest includes Semantic Web, Web Science and novel software technology for the Web. His research has been supported by New Century Excellent Talents (NCET) in University Program.\nCurrently, he is the principal investigator of several projects supported by National Science Foundation of China. He is leading the \"Websoft Research Group at Nanjing University\" to pursue a science of the Web. The missions of the research group are to conduct cutting-edge research on Web softwares and to make the vision of Semantic Web become reality.\nResearch Interests\n#\nAt present, his research is focused on\nQuestion answering over knowledge graphs\nNatural language understanding based on knowledge graphs\nDeep processing technologies of knowledge graphs\nPublications\n#\nDBLP page\nRoles\n#\nAcademic organizations\n#\nMember of China Computer Federation Technical Committee on Systems Software\nMember of China Computer Federation Technical Committee on Software Engineering\nDeputy director of JiangSu Association of Artificial Intelligence Technical Committee on Knowledge Engineering and Intelligent Service\nChairing\n#\nGeneral Chair of CSWS 2009\nPC Chair of JIST 2012\nPC member of\n#\nWWW，ISWC，AAAI，IJCAI, et al.\nThis page (revision-1) was last changed on\n12-Jul-2022 12:45\nby\n程龚\nTop\n/*hide the default jspwiki logo */\na.logo { border:none; text-indent:-99em;}\na.logo b:before { content:\"\"; }\n/* put the new logo, attached to this page */\na.logo {\n    background: url(\n);\n    background-size: contain;\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    background-position: center;\n    height: 60px;\n    width: 60px;\n/* add a fancy button like effect */\n    /* box-shadow:0 0 .25em white; */\n    /* border-radius:2em; */\n    /* background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); */\n}\n首页\n成员\n项目\n论著\n内部\nHome\nMembers\nPublications\nGitHub\n欢迎访问万维网软件研究组 Welcome to Websoft\nJSPWiki v2.11.2"
  },
