D 2024\nFedBAT: Communication-efficient Federated Learning via Learnable Binarization\n, Shiwei Li, Wenchao Xu, Haozhao Wang, Xing Tang, Yining Qi, Shijie Xu, Weihong Luo, Yuhua Li,\nXiuqiang He\n, and Ruixuan Li, 41...[truncated]"
