    "homepage_text": "华中科技大学主页平台管理系统 PENG QIN MU--英文主页--Home\nCN\nHome\nScientific Research\nResearch Field\nPaper Publications\nPatents\nPublished Books\nResearch Projects\nTeaching Research\nTeaching Resources\nTeaching Information\nTeaching Achievement\nAwards and Honours\nEnrollment Information\nStudent Information\nMy Album\nBlog\nPersonal Homepage\nCN\nHome\nScientific Research\nResearch Field\nPaper Publications\nPatents\nPublished Books\nResearch Projects\nTeaching Research\nTeaching Resources\nTeaching Information\nTeaching Achievement\nAwards and Honours\nEnrollment Information\nStudent Information\nMy Album\nBlog\n彭勤牧\nPENG QIN MU\nAssociate professor      \n          Supervisor of Master's Candidates\nProfessional Title:Associate professor\nDepartment:School of Electronic Information and Communications\nEducation Level:Postgraduate (Doctoral)\nDegree:Doctoral Degree in Engineering\nMORE\nProfile\n+ MORE\n彭勤牧，电信学院副教授，硕士生导师，先后在香港浸会大学计算机系获博士学位、美国宾夕法尼亚大学从事博士后研究。主要开展视觉计算、防伪识别及人工智能等研究。在国际权威刊物及国际会议上发表论文80余篇，获授权专利24项，美国专利1项，获得2019年湖北省科学进步一等奖和2022年湖北省自然科学一等奖。先后主持国家重点研发计划青年科学家项目、承担和参与完成国家支撑计划、自然科学基金、国防纵向等国家级项目和省部级及企...\nEducational experience\nAward information\n2011.9~2015.9\n香港浸会大学  计算机   Postgraduate (Doctoral)\nNo content\nWork experience\nSocial work\nResearch direction\n2023.3~Now\n华中科技大学   副教授\n2018.4~2023.3\n华中科技大学   讲师\n2015.10~2018.4\n美国宾夕法尼亚大学   博士后\n+ MORE\n以下期刊、会议的审稿人: IEEE TNNLS, IEEE TIP, IEEE TMM, IEEE TCSVT, Pattern Recognition,  Neurocomputing, NeurIPS, ICCV, ECCV, CVPR, ICIP, ICPR, ICML, ICLR.\nNo content\nPaper Publications\nPatents\nPublished Books\nBo Li, Xinge You, Jing Wang, Qinmu Peng*, Shi Yin,Ruinan Qi, Qianqian Ren, Ziming Hong, “IAS-NET: Joint Intra-classly Adaptive GAN and Segmentation network for unsupervised cross-domain in Neonatal Brain MRI segmentation”, Medical Physics, 2021.\nShengeli Shu, Ziming Hong, Qinmu Peng, Xiaoyue Zhou, Tianjng Zhang, Jing Wang, Chuansheng Zheng, “A machine-learning-based method to predict adverse events in patients with dilated cardiomyopathy and severely reduced ejection fractions”, The British Journal of Radiology, 2021.\nJia Liu; Qing Zhu; Licheng Zhu; Yun Yang; Yiran Zhang; Xiaoming Liu; Lan Zhang; Yuxi Jia; Qiumu Peng; Jiazheng Wang; Peng Sun; Wenliang Fan；Jing Wang.“Altered brain network in first-episode, drug-naive patients with major depressive disorder”, Journal of Affective Disorders, 2021.\nBeihao Xia, Conghao Wong, Qinmu Peng, Wei Yuan, and Xinge You, “CSCNet: Contextual Semantic Consistency Network for Trajectory Prediction in Crowded Spaces”, Pattern Recognition, 2022.\nZhengqiang Zhang, Qinmu Peng*, Sichao Fu, Wenjie Wang, Yiu-ming Cheung, Yue Zhao,Shujian Yu, and Xinge You.“A Componentwise Approach to Weakly-Supervised Semantic Segmentation Using Dual Feedback Network”, IEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems, 2022.\nNo content\nNo content\nTeam\n+ MORE\nName of Research Group:\n数据科学与计算机视觉实验室\nDescription of Research Group:\n数据科学与计算机视觉实验室是科技部国家防伪工程技术研究中心的核心研究团队，华中科技大学电子信息与通信学院重点建设研究团队之一。实验室长期从事计算机视觉和机器学习的前沿基础理论研究和工程应用的开发。\nTotal Visits\nMonth Visits\nDay Visits\nRecommended MA Supervisor\nCopyright © 2017 Huazhong University of Science & Technology"
  },
