    "homepage_text": "Yuanfu's Homepage\nYuanfu Lu\nApplication Researcher\nWeChat, Tencent Inc.\nEmail: luckyuanfu [at] foxmail.com ;  luyfroot [at] gmail.com\n[Google Scholar]\n[DBLP]\n[Github]\n[Blog]\nResearch Interests: Graph Representation Learning, Recommender System, Meta Learning, Data Mining\nPublications\n|\nEducation and Experience\n|\nAwards\n|\nTalks and Services\nNews!\n[Oct 2021]\t\tGot two papers accepted at WSDM 2022 in Meta-learning on Graphs.\n[Aug 2021]\t\tGot two papers accepted at CIKM 2021 in GNN Pre-training and Social Influence Maximization.\n[Apr 2021]\t\tGot one paper accepted at SIGIR 2021 in Social Recommendation.\nPublications\n2022\nFew-shot Link Prediction in Dynamic Networks.\nCheng Yang, Chunchen Wang,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Xumeng Gong, Chuan Shi, Wei Wang, Xu Zhang.\nThe Fifteenth International Conference on Web Search and Data Mining, 2022. (\nWSDM'22\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nLong Short-Term Temporal Meta-learning in Online Recommendation.\nRuobing Xie, Yalong Wang, Rui Wang,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Yuanhang Zou, Feng Xia, Leyu Lin.\nThe Fifteenth International Conference on Web Search and Data Mining, 2022. (\nWSDM'22\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\n2021\nContrastive Pre-training of GNNs on Heterogeneous Graphs.\nXunqiang Jiang,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Yuan Fang, Chuan Shi.\nThe 30th ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management, 2021. (\nCIKM'21\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nInfluence Maximization in Multi-Relational Social Networks.\nWei Wang, Haili Yang,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Yuanhang Zou, Xu Zhang, Shuting Guo, Leyu Lin.\nThe 30th ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management, 2021. (\nCIKM'21\n)\n. \n\tFull Applied Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nPackage Recommendation with Intra- and Inter-Package Attention Networks.\nChen Li,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Wei Wang, Chuan Shi, Ruobing Xie, Haili Yang, Cheng Yang, Xu Zhang, Leyu Lin.\nThe 44th International ACM SIGIR Conference on Research and Development in Information Retrieval, 2021. (\nSIGIR'21\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nLearning to Pre-train Graph Neural Networks.\nYuanfu Lu\n, Xunqiang Jiang, Yuan Fang, Chuan Shi.\nThe 35th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2021. (\nAAAI'21\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nSequence-aware Heterogeneous Graph Neural Collaborative Filtering.\nChen Li, Linmei Hu, Chuan Shi, Guojie Song,\nYuanfu Lu\n.\nSIAM International Conference on Data Mining, 2021. (\nSDM'21\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\n2020\nMeta-learning on Heterogeneous Information Networks for Cold-start Recommendation.\nYuanfu Lu\n, Yuan Fang, Chuan Shi.\nThe 26th ACM SIGKDD International Conference on Knowledge Discovery & Data Mining, 2020. (\nKDD'20\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nSocial Influence Attentive Neural Network for Friend-Enhanced Recommendation.\nYuanfu Lu\n, Ruobing Xie, Chuan Shi, Yuan Fang, Wei Wang, Xu Zhang, Leyu Lin.\nThe European Conference on Machine Learning and Principles and Practice of Knowledge Discovery in Databases, 2020. (\nECML-PKDD'20\n)\n. \n\tFull Applied Data Science Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nDynamic Heterogeneous Information Network Embedding with Meta-path based Proximity.\nXiao Wang*,\nYuanfu Lu*\n, Chuan Shi, Ruijia Wang, Peng Cui, Shuai Mao.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering, 2020. (\nTKDE'20\n)\n.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nRHINE: Relation Structure-Aware Heterogeneous Information Network Embedding.\nChuan Shi,\nYuanfu Lu\n, Linmei Hu, Zhiyuan Liu, Huadong Ma.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering, 2020. (\nTKDE'20\n)\n.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\n2019\nTemporal Network Embedding with Micro-and Macro-dynamics.\nYuanfu Lu\n, Xiao Wang, Chuan Shi, Philip S. Yu, Yanfang Ye.\nThe 28th ACM International Conference on Information and Knowledge Management, 2019. (\nCIKM'19\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nRelation Structure-aware Heterogeneous Information Network Embedding.\nYuanfu Lu\n, Chuan Shi, Linmei Hu, Zhiyuan Liu.\nThe 33th AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2019. (\nAAAI'19\n)\n. \n\tFull Research Paper.\n[Paper]\n[Code&data]\n[Slides]\n[BibTex]\nThesis\nRepresentation Learning on Dynamic Heterogeneous Information Network. M.S. Thesis.\n[PDF]\nEducation and Experience\nJul. 2020 - present. Application Researcher, WeChat, Tencent Inc., Beijing.\nNov. 2019 - Apr. 2020. Visiting Student, School of Information Systems, Singapore Management University, Singapore.\nAdvisor:\nProf. Yuan Fang\nSep. 2017 - Jul. 2020. M.S., School of Computer Science, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications, Beijing, China.\nAdvisor:\nProf. Chuan Shi\nSep. 2013 - Jul. 2017. B.S., School of Computer Science, Nanjing University of Posts and Telecommunications, Nanjing, China.\nSep. 2010 - Jul. 2013. Ganyu high school, Lianyungang, Jiangsu, China.\nAwards\nJul. 2020. The Second Scholarship, Tencent Rhino-Bird Elite Training Program\nJun. 2020. Beijing Excellent Graduate.\nJun. 2020. Excellent Graduate, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications.\nJun. 2020. Nomination for Top Ten Pioneers, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications.\nOct. 2019. National Scholarship.\nApr. 2019. Tencent Rhino-Bird Elite Training Program.\nNov. 2018. Student Scholarship, AAAI-19.\nTalks and Services\nTalks\nRepresentation Learning on Dynamic Heterogeneous Information Network. DMGroup, BUPT, 2020.\n[Slides]\nNetwork Embedding: Problem, Methodology and Application. WeChat, Tencent Inc., 2019.\n[Slides]\nServices\nIEEE TKDE Reviewer\nAAAI-21 Reviewer\nAAAI-19 Student Volunteer"
