    "homepage_text": "Yachao Zhang(张亚超) - Dr. Yachao Zhang\nYachao Zhang\nFollow\nXiamen University\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nORCID\nYachao Zhang(张亚超)\n🌈 I am an Assistant Professor at School of Informatics, Xiamen University in Xiamen, Fujian, China. Previously, I worked as a postdoctoral researcher at the Intelligent Computing Lab, SIGS of Tsinghua University.\n🏳️‍🌈 My research interests include, but are not limited to:\n3D Computer Vision\n(3D computer vision, 3D digital human avatar),\nMachine Learning\n(weakly-supervised learning, unsupervised learning, transfer learning). If you are interested in my research or have any use cases that you want to share, feel free to contact me!\n🤡\nI am actively recruiting self-motivated master students.\n🤝\nI plan to admit 2 master students.\nI am also recruiting several high-year undergraduate interns. The recruitment is aimed at students majoring in computer science, automation, mathematics, and related fields.\nI require a down-to-earth attitude, the drive to improve, a strong sense of self-motivation, and compliance with the laboratory’s unified management.\n注意：推免的同学请直接报名，无需套磁；考研的同学，通过复试后联系；\n注意：课题组学习、科研要求比较高，想水个硕士不要联系；\n注意：想加入课题组的，请提前联系跟随课题组学习（学习产生的成果归你所有），发邮件注明：学习XX个月，未认真读以上信息的不予回复；\n_______________________________________________________________________________________________________\nNews滚动展示\n✍News\n[Feb 2026]\nTwo papers about multi-modal open vocabulary learning are accepted by CVPR 2026!\n[Nov 2025]\nFour papers about multi-modal open vocabulary learning are accepted by AAAI 2026!\n[Oct 2025]\nOne paper about AI ChoreoMaster is accepted by TPAMI!\n[Jul 2025]\nThree papers about multi-modal learning are accepted by ACMMM 2025!\n[Jun 2025]\nThree papers about multi-modal learning are accepted by ICCV 2025!\n[May 2025]\nOne paper about image recognition is accepted by TPAMI!\n[May 2025]\nOne paper about the application of image generation in architecture is accepted by ACL 2025!\n[Apr 2025]\nOne paper about multi-modal learning is accepted by PR!\n[Feb 2025]\nOne paper about Text-to-Motion Generation with GPT-4Vision Reward is accepted by CVPR 2025!\n[Feb 2025]\nOne paper about cross-modal 3D semantic segmentation is accepted by TCSVT!\n[Jan 2025]\nOne paper about weakly-supervised point cloud semantic segmentation is accepted by TNNLS!\n[Dec 2024]\nOne paper about multi-modal learning is accepted by AAAI 2025!\n[Sep 2024]\nThree papers about multi-modal learning are accepted by NeurIPS 2024!\n[Aug 2024]\nThree papers about multi-modal learning are accepted by ACMMM 2024!\n[Jul 2024]\nOne paper about multi-modal label efficient learning is accepted by ECCV 2024!\n[Jun 2024]\nOne paper about Object Detection is accepted by TNNLS!\n[Feb 2024]\nOne paper about AI ChoreoMaster is accepted by CVPR 2024!\n[Jan 2024]\nOne paper about camouflaged object detection is accepted by ICLR 2024!\n[Dec 2023]\nThree papers about digital human avatar and cross-modal zero-shot learning are accepted by ICASSP 2024!\n[Dec 2023]\nTwo papers about multi-modal understanding and multi-modal gestures generation are accepted by AAAI 2024!\n[Oct 2023]\nOur paper about Semi-Supervised Defect Segmentation is accepted by TNNLS!\n[Sep 2023]\nOne paper about weakly supervised learning is accepted by NeurIPS 2023!\n[Aug 2023]\nMy application of the National Natural Science Foundation of China is approved!\n[Jul 2023]\nOne paper about multi-modal unsupervised domain adaptation semantic segmentation is accepted by ACMMM 2023!\n[Jul 2023]\nFour papers about multi-modal learning, ANN2SNN, and\nAI ChoreoMaster\nare accepted by ICCV 2023!\n[Jun 2023]\nMy application of the China Postdoctoral Science Foundation is approved!\n[Apr 2023]\nOne paper about zero-shot learning is accepted by IJCAI 2023!\n[Mar 2023]\nOne paper about camouflaged object detection is accepted by CVPR 2023!\n[Feb 2023]\nOne paper about long-tailed learning is accepted by ICASSP 2023!\n[Nov 2022]\nOne paper about weakly-supervised point cloud semantic segmentation is accepted by AAAI 2023!\n[Aug 2022]\nOne paper about binary multi-view cluster is accepted by TNNLS!\n[Jul 2022]\nTwo papers about multi-modal unsupervised domain adaptation semantic segmentation are accepted by ACMMM 2022!\n[Jun 2022]\nI am the winner of the title of \"Outstanding Graduate\" of Xiamen University!\n[Jun 2022]\nI successfully defended my PhD thesis!\n[Mar 2022]\nI am the winner of Xiamen University Liu Yubin Youth Science and Technology Scholarship!\n[Nov 2021]\nI am the winner of the title of \"Outstanding Student\" of Xiamen University!\n[Dec 2021]\nI am the winner of the first prize of the 2021 Excellent Paper Award of Fujian Computer Society!\n[Jul 2021]\nOne paper about weakly-supervised point cloud semantic segmentation is accepted by ICCV 2021!\n[Mar 2021]\nOne paper about PolSAR Image Classification is accepted by Remote Sensing!\n[Dec 2020]\nOne paper about weakly-supervised large scale point cloud semantic segmentation is accepted by AAAI 2021!\n_______________________________________________________________________________________________________\n📚Selected Publications (1️⃣ Equal contribution, 📧 Corresponding author)\nxMHashSeg: Cross-modal Hash Learning for Training-free Unsupervised LiDAR Semantic Segmentation\nJialong Zhang,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Yao Wu, Jiangming Shi, FangyongWang, Yanyun Qu📧.\nThe Fortieth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2026)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nPC-CrossDiff: Point-Cluster Dual-Level Cross-Modal Differential Attention for Unified 3D Referring and Segmentation\nWenbin Tan, Jiawen Lin,\nYachao Zhang\n📧，Yanyun Qu📧, Yuan Xie, FangyongWang, Yong Xie.\nThe Fortieth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2026)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nBeyondSparse: Facilitating Mamba to Enhance Cross-Domain 3D Semantic Segmentation in Adverse Weather\nYao Wu, Mingwei Xing,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Fangyong Wang, Xiaopei Zhang, Yanyun Qu📧.\nThe Fortieth AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2026)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nSeqVLM: Proposal-Guided Multi-View Sequences Reasoning via VLM for Zero-Shot 3D Visual Grounding\nJiawen Lin, Shiran Bian, Yihang Zhu, Wenbin Tan,\nYachao Zhang\n📧 Yuan Xie, Yanyun Qu📧.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACMMM 2025)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nTask-Aware Prompt Gradient Projection for Parameter-Efficient Tuning Federated Class-Incremental Learning\nHualong Ke,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Jiangming Shi, FangyongWang, Yuan Xie, Yanyun Qu📧.\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV 2025)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode coming soon!\n]\nAToM: Aligning Text-to-Motion Model at Event-Level with GPT-4Vision Reward\nHaonan Han, Xiangzuo Wu, Huan Liao, Zunnan Xu, Zhongyuan Hu, Ronghui Li,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Xiu Li📧.\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR, 2025)\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject Page\n] [\nCode\n]\nCross-Cloud Consistency for Weakly Supervised Point Cloud Semantic Segmentation\nYachao Zhang\n, Yuxiang Lan, Yuan Xie, Cuihua Li, Yanyun Qu📧.\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS, 2025)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nUniDSeg: Unified Cross-Domain 3D Semantic Segmentation via Visual Foundation Models Prior\nYao Wu, Mingwei Xing,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Xiaotong Luo, Yuan Xie, Yanyun Qu📧\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS 2024)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nMambaTalk: Efficient Holistic Gesture Synthesis with Selective State Space Models\nZunnan Xu, Yukang Lin，Haonan Han, Sicheng Yang, Ronghui Li,\nYachao Zhang\n📧，Xiu Li📧.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS 2024)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n][\nProject\n]\nConsistent123: One image to highly consistent 3d asset using case-aware diffusion priors\nYukang Lin，Haonan Han, Chaoqun Gong, Zunnan Xu,\nYachao Zhang\n📧，Xiu Li📧.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACMMM 2024)\n[\nPaper\n][\nProject\n]\nChain of Generation: Multi-Modal Gesture Synthesis via Cascaded Conditional Control\nZunnan Xu，\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Sicheng Yang, Ronghui Li, Xiu Li📧.\nAssociation for the Advance of Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2024)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nCross-Modal Match for Language Conditioned 3D Object Grounding\nYachao Zhang\n, Runze Hu, Ronghui Li, Yanyun Qu, Yuan Xie, Xiu Li📧.\nAssociation for the Advance of Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2024)\n[\nPaper\n]\nDual Pseudo-Labels Interactive Self-Training for Semi-Supervised Visible-Infrared Person Re-Identification\nJiangming Shi\n1️⃣\n,\nYachao Zhang1️⃣\n, Xiangbo Yin, Yuan Xie, Zhizhong Zhang, Jianping Fan, zhongchao shi, Yanyun Qu.\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV 2023)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nEfficient Converted Spiking Neural Network for 3D and 2D Classification\nYuxiang Lan,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Xu Ma, Yanyun Qu, Yun Fu.\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV 2023)\n[\nPaper\n]\nBEV-DG: Cross-Modal Learning under Bird’s-Eye View for Domain Generalization of 3D Semantic Segmentation\nMiaoyu Li,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Xu Ma, Yanyun Qu, Yun Fu.\nIEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV 2023)\n[\nPaper\n]\nWeakly Supervised 3D Segmentation via Receptive-driven Pseudo Label Consistency and Structural Consistency\nYuxiang Lan\n1️⃣\n,\nYachao Zhang1️⃣\n, Yanyun Qu, Cong Wang, Yuan Xie, Zongze Wu.\nThirty-Seventh AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI 2023)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nVS-Boost: Boosting Visual-Semantic Association for Generalized Zero-Shot Learning\nXiaofan Li,\nYachao Zhang\n📧, Shiran Bian, Yanyun Qu, Yuan Xie, Zhongchao Shi, Jianping Fan.\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI 2023)\n[\nPaper\n]\nCross-Domain and Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation in Domain Adaptation for 3D Semantic Segmentation\nMiaoyu Li\n1️⃣\n,\nYachao Zhang1️⃣\n,Miaoyu Li, Yuan Xie, Zhizhong Zhang, Cuihua Li, Yanyun Qu.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACMMM 2022)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nLearning All-In Collaborative Multiview Binary Representation for Clustering\nYachao Zhang\n, Yuan Xie, Zongze Wu, Cuihua Li, Yanyun Qu.\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS 2022)\n[\nPaper\n][\nCode\n]\nSSE-xMUDA: Self-supervised Exclusive Learning for 3D Segmentation in Cross-Modal Unsupervised Domain Adaptation\nYa...[truncated]"
