    "homepage_text": "Zhenguang Liu's Homepage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nZhenguang Liu's Homepage\nZhenguang Liu\nI was a postdoctor in School of Computing,\nNational University of Singapore (NUS)\n. Supervisors: Prof.\nChua Tat Seng\n& Prof.\nRoger Zimmermann\n.\nI also worked as a research fellow in A*STAR (\nSingapore's Agency for Science, Technology, and Research\n) and National University of Singapore.\nI received the B. E. and PhD degree from Shandong University and Zhejiang University in 2010, 2015, respectively. My research interest includes multimedia data analysis, deep learning, and blockchain.\nEmail: liuzhenguang2008 AT gmail.com\nSelected Publications\nZhenguang Liu, Peng Qian, Xiang Wang, at al.: Smart Contract Vulnerability Detection: From Pure Neural Network to Interpretable Graph Feature and Expert Pattern Fusion. IJCAI 2021\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nZhenguang Liu, Haoming Chen, Runyang Feng, et al.: Deep Dual Consecutive Network for Human Pose Estimation, CVPR 2021\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nZhenguang Liu, Kedi Lyu, Shuang Wu, et al.: Aggregated Multi-GANs for Controlled 3D Human Motion Prediction. AAAI 2021\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nZhenguang Liu,\nSihao Hu\n,\nYifang Yin\n,\net al.\n:\nInteractive Rare-Category-of-Interest Mining from Large Datasets.\nAAAI 2020\n: 496\n5-4972\n[PDF]\nYuan Zhuang\n, Zhenguang Liu,\nPeng Qian\n,\net al.\n:\nSmart Contract Vulnerability Detection using Graph Neural Network.\nIJCAI 2020\n: 3283-3290\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nMeng-Jiun Chiou,\nZhenguang Liu\n, Yifang Yin,\net al.\n：Zero-Shot Multi-View Indoor Localization via Graph Location Networks. ACM Multimedia 2020\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nZhenguang Liu, Shuang Wu, Shuyuan Jin, et al.: Towards Natural and Accurate Future Motion Prediction of Humans and Animals, CVPR 2019\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nYifang Yin, Meng-Jiun Chiou, Zhenguang Liu, et al.: Multi-Level Fusion based Class-aware Atention Model for Weakly Labeled Audio Tagging, ACM MM 2019\n[PDF]\nJianhai Chen, Deshi Ye, Shouling Ji, et al.: A Truthful FPTAS Mechanism for Emergency Demand Response in Colocation Data Centers, INFOCOM 2019\nQi Liu, Yue Zhang, Zhenguang Liu, et al.: Multi-Modal Multi-Task Learning for Automatic Dietary Assessment. AAAI 2018\n[PDF]\nXiangnan He, Zhankui He, Jingkuan Song, Zhenguang Liu, et al.: NAIS: Neural Attentive Item Similarity Model for Recommendation. TKDE 2018\n[PDF]\n[Source Code]\nZhenguang Liu, Li Cheng, Anan Liu, et al.: Multiview and Multimodal Pervasive Indoor Localization ACM MM 2017\n[PDF]\nZhenguang Liu, Luming Zhang, Qi Liu, et al.: Fusion of Magnetic and Visual Sensors for Indoor Localization: Infrastructure-Free and More Effective. IEEE Trans. Multimedia (TMM) 2017\n[PDF]\nZhenguang Liu, Yingjie Xia, Qi Liu, et al.: Towards Personalized Activity Level Prediction in Community Question Answering Websites. ACM Trans. Multimedia Computing Communications and Applications (TOMM) 2019\n[PDF]\nProfessional Services\nGuest Editor of Multimedia Systems Special Issue\nProgram Committee Member of\nACM MM\n2018, 2019, 2020,2021\nSenior Program Committee Member of\nIJCAI\n2021\nProgram Committee Member of\nAAAI\n2020,2021\nProgram Committee Member of\nCVPR\n2020,2021\nProgram Committee Member of\nICCV\n2020,2021\nSession Chair\nof ICGIP 2019\nLocal Chair\nof KSEM\n2020\nProgram Committee Member of\nICME\nProgram Committee Member of International Conference on Multimedia Modeling (\nMMM)\nInvited Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\nInvited Reviewer for ACM Transactions on Multimedia Computing Communications and Applications\nInvited Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Multimedia\nInvited Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Dependable and Secure Computing\nInvited Reviewer for IEEE Transactions on Industrial Informatics\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
