    "homepage_text": "Yunhang Shen 沈云航's Homepage\nYunhang Shen 沈云航\nEmails: shenyunhang01 AT gmail.com (best), yhshen AT stu.xmu.edu.cn\n[\nGoolge Scholar\n][\nGitHub\n]\n                [\nCurriculum Vitae\n]\n(Last updated on July 2021.)\nI finished the Ph.D study from\n                    Department of Artificial Intelligence, School of Informatics, Xiamen University, in 2021. My advisor is Prof.\nRongrong Ji\n.\nI received the B.S. and M.S. Degree in\n                    Cognitive Science and Technology of Xiamen University in 2014 and 2017, respectively.\nI was a research intern from May, 2016 to\n                    June, 2017 at Microsoft Research Asia (MSRA) under the supervision of Dr.\nChanghu Wang\nand Dr.\nKuiyuan Yang\n.\n.\nResearch Interests\nMy research interests are in Computer Vision, Multimedia and Machine Learning.\nRecently, I focus on:\nWeakly supervised object detection and semantic segmentation\nVideo analysis, including detection and classification\nMulti-label classification\nFull Publication List\nSelected Publications\nE\n2\nNet : Excitative-Expansile\n                Learning for Weakly Supervised Object Localization\nZhiwei Chen, Liujuan Cao*,\nYunhang Shen\n, Feihong Lian, Yongjian Wu, Rongrong Ji\n            ACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACMMM), 2021.\n[Code]\nParallel\n                Detection-and-Segmentation Learning for Weakly Supervised Instance Segmentation\nYunhang Shen\n, Liujuan Cao*, Zhiwei Chen, Baochang Zhang, Chi Su, Yongjian Wu, Feiyue Huang,\n            Rongrong Ji\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2021.\n[Code]\nToward\n                Joint Thing-and-Stuff Mining for Weakly Supervised Panoptic Segmentation\nYunhang Shen\n, Liujuan Cao*, Zhiwei Chen, Feihong Lian, Baochang Zhang, Chi Su, Yongjian Wu,\n            Feiyue Huang, Rongrong Ji\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2021.\n[Code]\nUWSOD:\n                Toward Fully-Supervised-Level Capacity Weakly Supervised Object Detection\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Zhiwei Chen, Yongjian Wu, Feiyue Huang\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2020.\n[Code]\nEnabling Deep\n                Residual Networks for Weakly Supervised Object Detection\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Yan Wang, Zhiwei Chen, Feng Zheng, Feiyue Huang, Yunsheng\n            Wu\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2020.\n[Supplementary\n                Material]\n[Caffe2 Code]\n[PyTorch Code]\nNoise-Aware\n                Fully Webly Supervised Object Detection\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Zhiwei Chen, Xiaopeng Hong, Feng Zheng, Jianzhuang Liu,\n            Mingliang Xu, Qi Tian\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2020.\n[Code]\nCategory-Aware Spatial Constraint for Weakly Supervised\n                Detection\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Kuiyuan Yang, Cheng Deng, Changhu Wang\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP), 2019.\n[Code]\nA Part Power Set Model for Scale-Free Person\n                Retrieval\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Xiaopeng Hong, Feng Zheng, Xiaowei Guo, Yongjian Wu, Feiyue\n            Huang\nInternational Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2019.\n[Code]\nCyclic\n                Guidance for Weakly Supervised Joint Detection and Segmentation\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Yan Wang, Yongjian Wu, Liujuan Cao\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019.\n[Code]\nGenerative\n                Adversarial Learning towards Fast Weakly Supervised Detection\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Shengchuan Zhang, Wangmeng Zuo, and Yan Wang\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2018.\n[Code]\nWeakly Supervised Object Detection via\n                Object-Specific Pixel Gradient\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Changhu Wang, Xi Li, and Xuelong Li\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems (TNNLS), 2018.\n[Code]\nBefore 2017\nThe Distributed System for\n                Inverted Multi-index Visual Retrieval\nXianming Lin,\nYunhang Shen\n, Ling Cai, Rongrong Ji*\nNeurocomputing, 2016.\nHacking Chinese Touclick CAPTCHA by Multi-Scale\n                Corner Structure Model with Fast Pattern Matching\nYunhang Shen\n, Rongrong Ji*, Donglin Cao, Min Wang\nACM International Conference on Multimedia (ACM MM), 2014.\n[Code]\nRobotic Free Writing of\n                Chinese Characters via Human–Robot Interactions\nFei Chao, Fuhai Chen,\nYunhang Shen\n, Wenli He, Yan Sun, Zhengshuai Wang, Changle Zhou\n            and Min Jiang\nInternational journal of humanoid robotics, 2014.\nHonors and Awards\nNational Scholarship, 2019\nNational Scholarship, 2016\nNational Scholarship, 2015\n1st Prize and new records, Award on the Music Information Retrieval Evaluation eXchange, 2015\nNational Endeavor Scholarship, 2013\n1st Prize, Award on the National Intelligent Design Competition, 2013\nNational Endeavor Scholarship, 2011"
