    "homepage_text": "Po-Ling Loh\nWelcome to Po-Ling's website\nI am a Professor in the\nStatistical\n                    Laboratory\nin the\nDepartment\n                    of Pure Mathematics and Mathematical Statistics\nat the\nUniversity\n                    of Cambridge\n. I am also a Fellow of\nSt. John's College\n.\nMy current research interests include\n                  high-dimensional statistics, optimization,  network\n                  inference,  robust statistics, and differential privacy.\n                  I am also interested in statistical applications to medical\n                  imaging and epidemiology. Here is a copy of my\nCV\n."
