    "homepage_text": "Horng-Tzer Yau Homepage\nHorng-Tzer Yau\nEditor in Chief\nCommunications of Mathematical Physics\nSeminars:\nRandom Matrix Seminar\nHorng-Tzer Yau\nMerton Professor of Mathematics\nOffice\n: Science Center 240\nTel\n: (617) 496-8425\nFax\n: (617) 495-5132\nEmail\nhtyau@math.harvard.edu\nPostal Address:\nDepartment of Mathematics\nHarvard University\nOne Oxford Street\nCambridge, MA 02138-2901\nResearch\nProbability theory, quantum dynamics, random matrices, differential equations, and nonequilibrium physics.\nPapers MathSciNet\nPreprints Arxiv\nDynamical Approach To Random Matrix Theory\n(a preliminary version), joint work with Lászó Erdős\nHorng-Tzer Yau\n|\nDepartment of Mathematics\n|\nHarvard University"
