    "homepage_text": "Nicolò Cesa-Bianchi\nnicolò cesa-bianchi\nProfessor of Computer Science\nDipartimento di Informatica\nUniversità degli Studi di Milano\nDEIB\n,\nPolitecnico di Milano\nRoom 7007\nvia Celoria 18\n20133 Milano, Italy\nPhone:   +39-02-503-16280\nEmail:   nicolo.cesa-bianchi  [at]  unimi.it\nRESEARCH\nEVENTS\nAlgorithms for online learning and statistical learning.\nAlgorithms for sequential decision-making, with applications to digital markets.\nAlgorithms for multi-agent learning.\nLaboratory for AI and Learning Algorithms\nPapers\nPerdition, burning, and flames\n(a hell of a book)\n30 Years of Game Theory at Institut Henri Poincaré\nWorkshop on regret, optimization & games\nWorkshop on online learning and optimization\nIBIS 2025\nWorkshop on Interactive Learning and Interventional Representations\nat the\nELLIS UnConference + EurIPS\nWorkshop on Theory of Explainable Machine Learning\nat the\nELLIS UnConference + EurIPS\nPROFESSIONAL ACTIVITIES\nTEACHING\nELLIS\nBoard member, Fellow and co-director of the\nMilan ELLIS unit\nMember of the\nAccademia Nazionale dei Lincei\nThe\nEuropean Lighthouse on Secure and Safe AI\n(ELSA)\nThe\nEuropean Lighthouse of AI for Sustainability\n(ELIAS)\nThe\nFAIR foundation\nAssociate editor for:\nTheoretiCS\nStatistical Methods for Machine Learning (since 2009)\n2025-26 edition\nReinforcement Learning\n(since 2023)\nComplementi di Algoritmi e Strutture Dati\n(dal 2016)\nLecture notes:\nInformation Theory\n(in Italian)\nGraph Theory"
