    "homepage_text": "Team | VITA Group@UT Austin\ntop of page\nAbout Us\nThe PI feels most proud of being surrounded by some of the world's most brilliant students. His Ph.D. students have won:\n​\nEleven Prestigious Ph.D. Fellowships\n(NSF GRFP, Google, Apple, NVIDIA, Adobe, IBM\ntwice\n, Amazon\ntwice\n, Qualcomm, and Snap), among\nmany other honors\n​\nFive Best Paper Awards\n(NeuS 2025, CVPR 2025 AI4CC, ACM MM 2025 MFMSI, IEEE SPS Young Author 2024, LoG 2022) and\nTwo Honorable Mentions\n(MLSys 2025, VLDB 2024)\n​\nSix Competition Prizes\nat CVPR, ICCV, and ECCV\n​\nAlumni have gone on to become\nEight Tenure-track Faculty Members\nand\nNinet\neen Research Scientists\nin industry\nPrincipal Investigator\nAtlas Wang\nTemple Foundation Endowed Associate Professor (Tenured)\n(Now focused on training his next-generation super intelligence - see the photo!)\n​\n[Professional Bio]\natlaswang@utexas.edu (\nquite responsive\n)\n512-471-1866 (\nnot responsive at all\n)\nMeet The Team\nPostdoctoral Researchers\nNeel P. Bhatt\nRead More\nPh.D., University of Waterloo, 2023. Co-hosting with Prof. Ufuk Topcu (Fall 2023 - )\nHezhen Hu\nRead More\nPh.D., University of Science and Technology of China, 2023\n(Fall 2023 - )\nSina Alemohammad\nRead More\nPh.D., Rice University, 2025\n(Summer 2025 - )\n​\nJianing Zhu\nRead More\nPh.D., Hong Kong Baptist University, 2025\n(Fall 2025 - )\n​\nPh.D. Students\nGreg Holste\nRead More\n(Fall 2021 - )\nPeihao Wang\nRead More\n(Fall 2021 - )\nRuisi Cai\nRead More\n(Fall 2022 - )\nTong Wang\nRead More\n(Fall 2022 - )\nWenyan Cong\nRead More\n(Fall 2022 - )\nSeo Young Lee\nRead More\n(Fall 2023 - )\nYan Zheng\nRead More\n(Spring 2024 - )\nJunbo Li\nRead More\n(Fall 2024 - )\nYuehao Wang\nRead More\n(Fall 2024 - )\nKevin Wang\nRead More\n(Fall 2024 - )\nYeonju Ro\nRead More\n(Spring 2025 - )\nJiajun Zhu\nRead More\n(Fall 2025 - )\nJinghan Ke\nRead More\n(Fall 2025 - )\nJohn Robertson\nRead More\n(Fall 2025 - )\nZhizhou Sha\nRead More\n(Fall 2025 - )\nTushaar Gangavarapu\nRead More\n(Fall 2025 - )\nZiyi Yang\nRead More\n(Spring 2026 - )\nUndergraduate Students\nRohan Siva\nECE@UT Austin,\nJan 2025 - present\nVincent Ha\nECE@UT Austin,\nJan 2026 - present\nAlumni\nPh.D Students/Postdocs (8 in Academia, 19 in Industry)\nYe Yuan (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2015 - Summer 2020 (with VITA: since Fall 2017)\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Tiktok, Seattle\n​\nZhenyu Wu (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2017 - Summer 2021\nCurrent: Research Engineer, Waymo\nGuoliang Kang (Postdoc)\nRead More\nco-hosted with Prof. Philipp Krähenbühl, Mar - Oct 2021\nCurrent: Full Professor, ECE@Beihang University\n​\n​\nXiaohan Chen (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2017 - Summer 2022\nCurrent:\nSenior Applied Scientist, Amazon\n​\n​\n​\nJunru Wu (Ph.D)\nRead More\nSpring 2018 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Research Engineer, Google Deepmind\n​\n​\n​\nHaotao Wang (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2018 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Qualcomm AI Research\n​\n​\n​\nZiyu Jiang (Ph.D)\nRead More\nSpring 2019 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Research Scientist, NEC Labs America\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nWuyang Chen (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2019 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, CS@Simon Fraser University, starting Fall 2024 after another year of postdoc at UC Berkeley\n​\nTianlong Chen (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2019 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, CS@UNC Chapel Hill, starting Fall 2024 after another year of postdoc at MIT/Harvard\n​\nJiayi Shen (Ph.D)\nRead More\nSpring 2020 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Applied Scientist, Amazon\n​\n​\n​\nYan Han (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2017 - Summer 2023 (with VITA: since Fall 2021)\nCurrent: Member of Technical Staff, Microsoft AI\n​\nXinyu Gong (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2017 - Summer 2023\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Adobe Firefly\n​\n​\n​\nShiwei Liu (Postdoc)\nRead More\nAug 2022 - Oct 2023\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, MPI Intelligent Systems Tübingen, starting Spring 2025 after another year of Newton visiting fellowship at Oxford\nYifan Jiang (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2019 - Summer 2024\nCurrent: Senior Research Scientist, Meta Superintelligence Lab\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nScott Hoang (Ph.D)\nRead More\nFall 2021 - Summer 2024* (degree frozen, as job offer is too good : -)\nCurrent: Senior Research Scientist, Apple AIM\nL\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nYuning You (Ph.D)\nRead More\nco-advised with Dr. Yang Shen, Fall 2019 - Summer 2024\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, CS@CUHK Shenzhen, starting Fall 2025 after another year of postdoc at Caltech\nDejia Xu (Ph.D)\nRead More\nSpring 2022 - Spring 2025\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Luma AI\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nZiwei Yang (Postdoc)\nRead More\nAug 2023 - Dec 2024\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, School of Medicine@The University of Hong Kong\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nJunyuan Hong (Postdoc)\nRead More\nAug 2023 - Aug 2025\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, ECE@National University of Singapore\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nZhiwen Fan (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2021 - Summer 2025\nCurrent: Assistant Professor, ECE@Texas A&M University\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nAjay Jaiswal (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2021 - Summer 2025\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Apple AIML\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nWes Robbins (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2023 - Summer 2025* (degree frozen, as job offer is too good : -)\nCurrent: Research Engineer, Clearview AI\nXuxi Chen (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2021 - Summer 2025\nCurrent: Researcher, XTX Markets\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nZhangheng Li (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2021 - Summer 2025\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Zoom AI\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nRunjin Chen (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nFall 2023 - Summer 2025*\n(degree frozen, as job offer is too good : -)\nCurrent: Member of Technical Staff, Anthropic\n​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nLanqing Guo (Postdoc)\nRead More\nAug 2024 - Nov 2025\nCurrent: Research Scientist, Google\n​​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nZhenyu Zhang (Ph.D.)\nRead More\nAug 2022 - Dec 2025\nCurrent: Member of Technical Staff, xAI\n​​\n​\n​\n​\n​\nLong-Term Visitors\nwith VITA for 6 months or more\n​\nMads Toftrup\n, Ph.D student in CS at Aahus University, Denmark, Sep 2024 - Mar 2024\nSimone Angarano\n, Ph.D. student in ML at Politecnico di Torino, Italy, visiting VITA during Aug 2023 - May 2024\nLu Yin\n, Ph.D. student, CS@Eindhoven University of Technology (TU/e), Netherlands, visiting VITA during Aug 2022 - Jul 2023 (now Assistant Professor, CS@ University of Surrey, UK)\nYee Yang Tee, Ph.D. student, EEE@Nanyang Technological University, Singapore, visiting VITA during Aug 2022 - Jan 2023 (now Co-Founder, inspections.ai, Singapore)\nArtur André Oiveira, Ph.D. student, CS@University of São Paulo, Brazil, visiting VITA during Dec 2021 - May 2022 (now Postdoctoral Researcher, CS@University of São Paulo)\nIago Breno Araujo, Ph.D. student, CS@University of São Paulo, Brazil, visiting VITA during Dec 2019 - May 2020 (now Data Scientist, FAPESP, Brazil)\nShuai Yang\n, Ph.D. student, CS@Peking University, China, visiting VITA during Sep 2018 - Sep 2019 (now Assistant Professor, CS@Peking University)\nShort-Term Interns\nwith VITA for 3 months or remotely - we now rarely take interns\nJiajun Zhu, undergraduate, CS@ZJU, Summer 2024 [remote] (Next Move: joining VITA as Ph.D. student)\nSaebyeol Shin, undergraduate, Sungkyunkwan University, South Korea, Fall 2023 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@Cornell)\nDiganta Misra, M.S. student, MILA/University of Montréal, Canada, Summer 2023 [remote] (Next Move: ELLIS Ph.D. student, MPI-IS)\nMukund Varma T, undergraduate, ME@IIT Madras, Summer 2022 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@UCSD)\nXiaolong Luo, undergraduate, Statistics@USTC, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, Bioengineering@Harvard)\nMiao Lu, undergraduate, School of Gifted Young@USTC, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, MS&E@Stanford)\nZhengyuan Li, undergraduate, CS@Tsinghua University, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@Purdue)\nWenyan Cong, M.S. student, CSE@SJTU, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: joining VITA as Ph.D. student)\nQiming Wu, undergraduate, EE@HUST, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: M.S. student, CS@UCSB)\nS P Sharan, undergraduate, ECE@NIT Trichy, Summer 2021 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, ECE@UT Austin)\nZhenyu Zhang, M.S. student, EEIS@USTC, Summer 2020 [remote] (Next Move: joining VITA as Ph.D. student)\nZeyuan Chen, undergraduate, School of Gifted Young@USTC, Summer 2020 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@UCSD)\nTianxin Wei, undergraduate, School of Gifted Young@USTC, Summer 2020 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@UIUC)\nAaditya Singh, undergraduate, IIT Kanpur, Summer 2020 [remote] (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CS@Georgia Tech)\nShreeshail Hingane, undergraduate, IIT Kanpur, Summer 2020 [remote] (Next Move: Research Fellow, Microsoft Research, Bangalore)\nXuxi Chen, undergraduate, Statistics@USTC, Summer 2019 (Next Move: joining VITA as Ph.D. student)\nYue Wang, M.S. student, CS@Rice University, visitng VITA during Summer 2018 (Next Move: Ph.D. student, ECE@Rice)\nYifan Jiang, undergraduate, EE@HUST, visitng VITA during Summer 2018 (Next Move: joining VITA as Ph.D. student)\nM.S. Students\nNitin Bansal, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Aug 2017 - Dec 2018 (Next Move: Senior Deep Learning Engineer, MagicLeap)\nJianghao Shen, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Aug 2017 - Dec 2018 (Next Move: Ph.D. student, ECE@North Carolina State University)\nPengcheng Pi, ECE@TAMU, M.S. student, Aug 2017 - Dec 2018 (Next Move: Ph.D. student, ECE@TAMU)\nSheelabhadra Dey, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Jan 2018 - May 2019 (Next Move: Ph.D. student, CSE@TAMU)\nNalin Dadhich, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Jan 2018 - May 2019 (Next Move: Software Development Engineer, Nvidia)\nAnjali Chadha, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Aug 2018 - May 2019 (Next Move: Software Development Engineer, Amazon Alexa AI)\nPritish Uplavikar, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Aug 2018 - May 2019 (Next Move: Research Engineer, Apple)\nKarthik Suresh, ECE@TAMU, M.S. student, Jan 2018 - May 2019 (Next Move: Applied Machine Learning Scientist, Adobe)\nPrateek Shroff, CSE@TAMU, M.S. student, Jan