    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Yunhao (Robin) Tang\nYunhao (Robin) Tang\nI am interested in model training and reinforcement learning. Currently, I am a member of technical staff on the pre-training team at\nAnthropic\n.\nBefore this, I spent some time working on\nreasoning\nat\nMistral\n.\nBefore that, I was at the\nLlama\nresearch team. I spearheaded the prototype and algorithmic recipes for online RL and, as part of a small team,\nscaled\nthe training to\nLlama 3.3\n-\n4\n. I also worked on post-training for reasoning.\nEt avant ça, I spent a few years at\nDeepMind\nLondon, where I was a core contributor to\nGemini v1\n-\n1.5\npost-training with a focus on tool use and agent. I also researched various aspects of deep RL algorithms and systems.\nPreviously, I was a two-time intern at DeepMind Paris hosted by\nRémi Munos\n. I obtained my PhD at\nColumbia University\nin New York City.\nNews\nModels\nPublications"
  },
