    "homepage_text": "VLOG@DUT\nPeople\nProject\nPublication\nHome\n<!--<h1>Welcome\n--!>\nRisheng Liu\nTenured Full Professor\nInternational School of Information Science & Engineering\nDalian University of Technology\nWelcome to the\nVision, Learning & Optimization Group (VLOG)\nlead by Prof. Risheng Liu, affiliated to International School of Information Science & Engineering, Dalian University of Technology. We perform fundamental research in the fields of machine learning, computer vision and numerical optimization. Our recent projects mainly focus on advanced optimization tools and their applications in visual perception and robot learning in extremely harsh environment.\nNews\nDec.7, 2025,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nJul.7, 2025,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nFeb.27, 2025,\nfour papers are accepted by CVPR.\nDec.12, 2024,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nNov.26, 2024,\none paper is accepted by IJCV.\nJune.19, 2024,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nMay.2, 2024,\none paper is accepted by ICML.\nMar.22, 2024,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nJan.29, 2024,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nNov.1, 2023,\none paper is accepted by IJCV.\nSep.10, 2023,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nSep.1, 2023,\none paper is accepted by IJCV.\nAug.3, 2023,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nJul.26, 2023,\nsix papers are accepted by ACM MM.\nJul.18, 2023,\none paper is accepted by ICCV.\nApr.25, 2023,\none paper is accepted by ICML.\nApr.20, 2023,\none paper is accepted by IJCAI.\nOct.4, 2022,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nMay.15, 2022,\none paper is accepted by ICML.\nMar.02, 2022,\nfour papers are accepted by CVPR.\nDec.29, 2021,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nNov.26, 2021,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\nSep.28, 2021,\none paper is accepted by IEEE TPAMI.\n© 2025 |  vog"
