    "linkedin": "https://www.linkedin.com/in/mo-zhou-9bb99021b/",
    "homepage_text": "Mo Zhou | Johns Hopkins University\nMo Zhou\nPh.D. Student\nJohns Hopkins University\nmzhou32 (at) jhu.edu\nAbout Me\nI am currently an Applied Scientist at Amazon.\nMy research focuses on computer vision and deep learning,\nspecifically vision-language models\nand preserving model performance under distribution shifts.\nPrior to this, I received my Ph.D.\nfrom the\nElectrical and Computer Engineering Dept\nat\nJohns Hopkins University\n,\nwhere I was advised by\nProf.\nVishal M. Patel\n.\nI earned my Bachelor’s and Master’s degrees\nfrom\nXidian University\n,\nunder the supervision of\nProf.\nZhenxing Niu\n.\nI have worked\nas a student researcher with\nDr.\nHossein Talebi\n,\nDr.\nKeren Ye\n,\nDr.\nMauricio Delbracio\n,\nand Dr.\nPeyman Milanfar\nat\nGoogle Research\n;\nas a research intern with\nDr.\nSaeed Amizadeh\nand Dr.\nKazuhito Koishida\nat\nMicrosoft Research\n;\nas a research intern with\nDr.\nYiding Yang\n,\nDr.\nHaoxiang Li\n,\nand Dr.\nGang Hua\nat\nWormpex AI Research\n;\nand as a research assistant with\nProf.\nLe Wang\nand Prof.\nSanping Zhou\nat\nXi’an Jiaotong University\n.\nI have been an official Debian Developer since 2018.\nI am also an amateur photographer.\nResearch Interests\nComputer Vision:\nobject detection, cross-modal retrieval, text-to-image synthesis.\nDeep Learning:\ndeep metric learning, adversarial attack and defense.\nNatural Language Processing:\nlarge language models.\nNews\n[Jun. 2024]\nOutstanding Reviewer for CVPR 2024.\n[Feb. 2024]\nOne paper for robust metric learning is accepted to T-PAMI.\n[Sept. 2022]\nOne paper for federated learning is accepted to NeurIPS 2022.\n[Mar. 2022]\nOne paper for robust deep metric learning is accepted to CVPR 2022.\n[Aug. 2021]\nI was selected as an “Outstanding Reviewer” for ICCV 2021.\nPublications\nICCV\nUniRes: Universal Image Restoration for Complex Degradations\nMo Zhou\n, Keren Ye, Mauricio Delbracio, Peyman Milanfar, Vishal M. Patel, Hossein Talebi\nICCV, 2025.\narXiv\nICLR\nField-DiT: Diffusion Transformer on Unified Video, 3D, and Game Field Generation\nKangfu Mei,\nMo Zhou\n, Vishal M. Patel\nICLR, 2025.\nPDF\narXiv\nTMLR\nMixedNUTS: Training-Free Accuracy-Robustness Balance via Nonlinearly Mixed Classifiers\nYatong Bai,\nMo Zhou\n, Vishal M. Patel, Somayeh Sojoudi\nTMLR, 2024.\narXiv\nICPR\nOn Trace of PGD-Like Adversarial Attacks\nMo Zhou\n, Vishal M. Patel\nICPR, 2024.\narXiv\nTPAMI\nAdversarial Attack and Defense in Deep Ranking\nMo Zhou\n, Le Wang, Zhenxing Niu, Qilin Zhang, Nanning Zheng, Gang Hua\nTransactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI), 2024.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nNeurIPS\nResource-Adaptive Federated Learning with All-In-One Neural Composition\nYiqun Mei, Pengfei Guo,\nMo Zhou\n, Vishal M. Patel\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(NeurIPS)\n, 2022.\nPDF\nGithub\nCVPR\nEnhancing Adversarial Robustness for Deep Metric Learning\nMo Zhou\n, Vishal M. Patel\nIEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2022.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nT-MM\nAdaptive Ladder Loss for Learning Coherent Visual-Semantic Embedding\nLe Wang,\nMo Zhou\n, Zhenxing Niu, Qilin Zhang, Nanning Zheng\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n(T-MM)\n, 2021.\nPDF\nICCV\nPractical Relative Order Attack in Deep Ranking\nMo Zhou\n, Le Wang, Zhenxing Niu, Qilin Zhang, Yinghui Xu, Nanning Zheng, Gang Hua\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2021.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nCVPR\nSGCN: Sparse Graph Convolution Network for Pedestrian Trajectory Prediction\nLiushuai Shi, Le Wang, Chengjiang Long, Sanping Zhou,\nMo Zhou\n, Zhenxing Niu, Gang Hua\nIEEE Conf. on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2021.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nECCV\nAdversarial Ranking Attack and Defense\nMo Zhou\n, Zhenxing Niu, Le Wang, Qilin Zhang, Gang Hua\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n, 2020.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nAAAI\nLadder Loss for Coherent Visual-Semantic Embedding\nMo Zhou\n, Zhenxing Niu, Le Wang, Zhanning Gao, Qilin Zhang, Gang Hua\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2020.\nPDF\narXiv\nCode\nICCV\nHierarchical Multimodal LSTM for Dense Visual-Semantic Embedding\nZhenxing Niu,\nMo Zhou\n, Le Wang, Xinbo Gao, Gang Hua\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2017.\nPDF\nCVPR\nOrdinal Regression with Multiple Output CNN for Age Estimation\nZhenxing Niu,\nMo Zhou\n, Le Wang, Xinbo Gao, Gang Hua\nIEEE Conf. on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2016.\nPDF\nPreprints\narXiv\nReference-Guided Identity Preserving Face Restoration\nMo Zhou\n, Keren Ye, Viraj Shah, Kangfu Mei, Mauricio Delbracio, Peyman Milanfar, Vishal M. Patel, Hossein Talebi\narXiv\n(preprint)\n, 2025.\narXiv\narXiv\nDeployment Prior Injection for Run-time Calibratable Object Detection\nMo Zhou\n, Yiding Yang, Haoxiang Li, Vishal M. Patel, Gang Hua\narXiv\n(preprint)\n, 2024.\narXiv\narXiv\nSecuring Deep Generative Models with Universal Adversarial Signature\nYu Zeng,\nMo Zhou\n, Yuan Xue, Vishal M. Patel\narXiv\n(preprint)\n, 2023.\narXiv\nServices\nConference Reviewers\nCVPR, NeurIPS, ICCV, ECCV, ICLR, ICML, AAAI, WACV, ACCV, ICPR\nJournal Reviewers\nTPAMI, TNNLS, TMM, TDSC, NeuNet, NeuComp, IMAVIS, IJCV, MVA, CAIS, COMPJ\nWorkshop Organizer\n4th Workshop on Adversarial Robustness In the Real World (AROW), ICCV, 2023\n4th Workshop of Adversarial Machine Learning on Computer Vision: Robustness of Foundation Models, CVPR, 2024\nPowered by Jekyll and\nMinimal Light\ntheme."
