    "homepage_text": "Hongyu Ren | Homepage\nHongyu Ren\nResearch scientist at OpenAI\nHome\nPublication\nHomepage\nAbout me\nI’m a research scientist at OpenAI exploring ChatGPT.\nI received my Ph.D. in Computer Science from Stanford University and a B.S. with honors in Computer Science from Peking University.\nAwards\nApple PhD Fellowship\nBaidu PhD Fellowship\nMasason Foundation Fellowship\nTeaching\nHead TA,\nCS246 Mining Massive Datasets\n, Winter 2022\nTA,\nCS231n Deep Learning for Computer Vision\n, Spring 2022\nTA,\nCS224w Machine Learning on Graphs\n, Fall 2021\nFeel free to reach me at\nhongyu\nopenai.com\n(work) or\nhyren\ncs.stanford.edu\n(personal)."
