    "homepage_text": "Shaofeng Zhang | USTC\nSHAOFENG\nShaofeng Zhang (张少锋)\nI am a tenure-track assistant professor (预聘副教授) at the\nSchool of Artificial Intelligence and Data Science (SAIDS)\n, University of Science and Technology of China (USTC).\nI received my Ph.D. from Shanghai Jiao Tong University (SJTU), advised by Prof.\nJunchi Yan\nand Hongyuan Zha. Prior to that, I earned my bachelor's degree from UESTC in 2021.\nResearch Interests:\nSelf-supervised representation learning, Diffusion models, Point cloud understanding, and World model.\nRecruiting:\nI am actively recruiting highly motivated Master's and Ph.D. students, as well as outstanding undergraduates. Please email me if interested.\nEmail\nGoogle Scholar\nNews\n02/2026:\nSeven papers accepted to\nCVPR 2026\n.\n09/2025:\nThree papers accepted to\nNeurIPS 2025\n.\n06/2025:\nOne paper accepted to\nTPAMI 2025\n.\n06/2025:\nTwo papers accepted to\nICCV 2025\n.\n03/2025:\nOne paper accepted to\nCVPR 2025\n.\n01/2025:\nOne paper accepted to\nICLR 2025\n.\n09/2024:\nOne paper accepted to\nNeurIPS 2024\n.\n01/2024:\nOne paper accepted to\nICLR 2024\n.\n04/2023:\nOne paper accepted to\nICML 2023\n.\n01/2023:\nTwo papers accepted to\nICLR 2023\n.\n07/2022:\nOne paper accepted to\nECCV 2022\n.\n05/2022:\nOne paper accepted to\nSIGKDD 2022\n.\n03/2022:\nOne paper accepted to\nCVPR 2022\n.\n01/2022:\nOne paper accepted to\nICLR 2022\n.\n09/2020:\nOne paper accepted to\nNeurIPS 2020\n.\nResearch\nSelected Publication\n(† indicates corresponding author, * indicates equal contribution)\nDreamWorld: Unified World Modeling in Video Generation\nBoming Tan*, Xiangdong Zhang*, Ning Liao*, Yuqing Zhang,\nShaofeng Zhang†\n, Xue Yang, Qi Fan, Yanyong Zhang\narxiv 2603.00466 preprint\nRepulsor: Accelerating Generative Modeling with a Contrastive Memory Bank\nShaofeng Zhang*†\n, Xuanqi Chen*, Ning Liao*, Haoxiang Zhao, Xiaoxing Wang, Haoru Tan, Sitong Wu, Xiaosong Jia, Qi Fan, Junchi Yan\narxiv 2512.08648 preprint\nDual-Branch Center-Surrounding Contrast: Rethinking Contrastive Learning for 3D Point Clouds\nShaofeng Zhang*†\n, Xuanqi Chen*, Xiangdong Zhang, Sitong Wu, Junchi Yan\narxiv 2512.08673 preprint\nPointAlign: Feature-Level Alignment Regularization for 3D Vision-Language Models\nYuanhao Su,\nShaofeng Zhang†\n, Xiaosong Jia, Qi Fan\nCVPR 2026\nEasyOutPainter: One Step Image Outpainting with Both Continuous Multiple and Resolution\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Qiang Zhou, Zhibin Wang, Hao Li, Junchi Yan\nIEEE TPAMI 2025\nTowards More Diverse and Challenging Pre-training for Point Cloud Learning: Self-Supervised Cross Reconstruction with Decoupled Views\nXiangdong Zhang*,\nShaofeng Zhang*\n, Junchi Yan\nICCV 2025\nCR2PQ: Continuous Relative Rotary Positional Query for Dense Visual Representation Learning\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Qiang Zhou, Sitong Wu, Haoru Tan, Zhibin Wang, Jinfa Huang, Junchi Yan\nICLR 2025\nPCP-MAE: Learning to Predict Centers for Point Masked Autoencoders\nXiangdong Zhang*,\nShaofeng Zhang*\n, Junchi Yan\nNeurIPS 2024 (Spotlight)\nContinuous-Multiple Image Outpainting in One-Step via Positional Query and A Diffusion-based Approach\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Jinfa Huang, Qiang Zhou, Zhibin Wang, Fan Wang, Jiebo Luo, Junchi Yan\nICLR 2024\nPatch-level Contrastive Learning via Positional Query for Visual Pre-training\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Qiang Zhou, Zhibin Wang, Fan Wang, Junchi Yan\nICML 2023\nPatch-Level Contrasting without Patch Correspondence for Accurate and Dense Contrastive Representation Learning\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Feng Zhu, Rui Zhao, Junchi Yan\nICLR 2023\nContextual Image Masking Modeling via Synergized Contrasting without View Augmentation\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Feng Zhu, Rui Zhao, Junchi Yan\nICLR 2023\nSelf-supervised Learning of Visual Graph Matching\nChang Liu*,\nShaofeng Zhang*\n, Junchi Yan, Xiaokang Yang\nECCV 2022\nM-Mix: Generating Hard Negatives via Multi-sample Mixing for Contrastive Learning\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Meng Liu, Junchi Yan, Hengrui Zhang, Lingxiao Huang, Pinyan Lu, Xiaokang Yang\nKDD 2022 (Oral)\nAlign Representations with Base: A New Approach to Self-Supervised Learning\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Lyn Qiu, Feng Zhu, Junchi Yan, Hengrui Zhang, Rui Zhao, Hongyang Li, Xiaokang Yang\nCVPR 2022\nZero-CL: Instance and Feature decorrelation for negative-free symmetric contrastive learning\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Feng Zhu, Junchi Yan, Rui Zhao, Xiaokang Yang\nICLR 2022\nThe Diversified Ensemble Neural Network\nShaofeng Zhang\n, Meng Liu, Junchi Yan\nNeurIPS 2020\nServices\nPC Member / Reviewer:\nTPAMI, CVPR, ECCV, ICCV, NeurIPS, ICLR, ICML, AAAI."
