    "homepage_text": "董未名-中国科学院大学-UCAS\n[中文]\n[English]\nEducation\nExperience\nPublications\nGeneral\nWeiming DONG,  Professor,\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences\nNational Laboratory of Pattern Recognition\nSino-European Laboratory in Computer Science, Automation and Applied Mathematics\nResearch Areas\nArtificial Intelligence Generated Content (AIGC), Computational Visual Media,  Computational Creativity\nEducation\n2004-04--2007-06   INRIA, France / University of Henri Poincare, Nancy 1    PhD\n2001-09--2004-01   Department of Computer Science and Technology, Tsinghua Universiry, China    M.E.\n1997-09--2001-07   Department of Computer Science and Technology, Tsinghua Universiry, China    B.E.\nExperience\nWork Experience\n2016-10,  National Laboratory of Pattern Recognition, Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Professor\n2010-10~2016-10,  National Laboratory of Pattern Recognition, Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Associate Professor\n2009-11~2010-10,  National Laboratory of Pattern Recognition, Institute of Automation, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Assistant Professor\n2007-10~2009-10,  Sino-European Laboratory in Computer Science, Automation and Applied Mathematics, PostDo\nPublications\nPapers\nYuxin Zhang, Minyan Luo, Weiming Dong, Xiao Yang, Haibin Huang, Chongyang Ma, Oliver Deussen, Tong-Yee Lee, Changsheng Xu: IP-Prompter: Training-Free Theme-Specific Image Generation via Dynamic Visual Prompting.\nACM SIGGRAPH\n(Conference Paper Track) 2025 [\nProject Page\n]\nYuxin Zhang, Weiming Dong, Fan Tang, Nisha Huang , Haibin Huang , Chongyang Ma , Pengfei Wan , Tong-Yee Lee , Changsheng Xu: MotionCrafter: Plug-and-play Motion Guidance for Diffusion Models.\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n(2025) [\nProject Page\n]\nNisha Huang, Weiming Dong, Yuxin Zhang, Fan Tang, Ronghui Li, Chongyang Ma, Xiu Li, Tong-Yee Lee, Changsheng Xu: CreativeSynth: Cross-Art-Attention for Artistic Image