    ],
    "github": "https://github.com/SimiaoZuo",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "About me - Simiao Zuo\nSimiao Zuo (左思邈)\nData Scientist at Microsoft\nFollow\nRedmond, Washington\nEmail\nTwitter\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout me\nI am a Data Scientist at Microsoft. I received my Ph.D. in Machine Learning at Georgia Institute of Technology in 2023, where I was advised by\nProf. Tuo Zhao\n. Before joining Georgia Tech, I received my Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science (with Highest Honors) and my Bachelor’s degree in Mathematics (with Highest Honors) from The University of Texas at Austin, where I worked with\nProf. Qixing Huang\n. My CV is downloadable\nhere\n.\nMy research interests include machine learning and natural language processing. In particular, I am interested in developing principled machine learning algorithms using tools such as weak supervision and adversarial training. I am also interested in point process."
  },
  "serper::Yujia Bao": {
    "homepage": "https://www.yujia.io/",
    "emails": [
