    "homepage_text": "Keyu Wang – Home\nKeyu Wang's Homepage\nPostdoctoral Researcher, Faculty of Mathematics, University of Vienna\nCurriculum Vitae\n2024-  Postdoc at Universität Wien\n\t\t\t  (hosted by\nJian-Rong Li\n)\n2023-2024   ATER at Université Paris Cité\n2020-2024   Ph.D. in Mathematics at Université Paris Cité, lab IMJ-PRG\n                          (advisor:\nDavid Hernandez\n)\n2019 spring   Exchange student via Erasmus at ETH Zürich\n\t\t\t   (hosted by\nGiovanni Felder\n)\n2018-2020   Master in Mathematics at Ecole Normale Supérieure\n2017-2018   Double Bachelor in Mathematics-Physics at Ecole Normale Supérieure\n2014-2018   Bachelor in Mathematics at Tsinghua University\nContact\nEmail Address:\nkeyu.wang [at] univie.ac.at\nFaculty of Mathematics\nUniversity of Vienna\nOskar Morgenstern-Platz 1\n1090 Vienna, Austria\nLinks\nhomepage at IMJ-PRG\nhomepage at University of Vienna\npage Orcid\narXiv personal page\npage Mathscinet\n, or search author id 1559977"
