    "homepage_text": "Xingzhe He\nXingzhe He\nPublications\nBio\nHome\nXingzhe He\nE-mail: xingzhehe95 at gmail dot com\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nLinkedIn\nCV\nI am a research tech lead at Descript.\nI lead teams of video and audio generation research, and video editing agent.\nI finished PhD student at\nthe University of British\n                Columbia\n, advised by Prof.\nHelge Rhodin\n. My\n            research interests mainly focus on computer vision, machine learning, and generative models (images, shapes,\n            physics).\nBefore this, I spent a year at Dartmouth College as a research intern, working on physics-based machine\n            learning, advised by Prof.\nBo Zhu\n. I received my M.Sc\n            degree at Rutgers\n            University. I received my B.Sc degree at the University of Liverpool and Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University, advised by Prof.\nCorina\n                Constantinescu\n.\nPublications\nA Data Perspective on Enhanced Identity Preservation for Diffusion Personalization\nWACV 2025\nXingzhe He\n, Zhiwen Cao, Nicholas Kolkin, Lantao Yu, Kun Wan, Helge Rhodin, Ratheesh Kalarot\npaper\nUnsupervised keypoints from pretrained diffusion models\nCVPR 2024\nEric Hedlin, Gopal Sharma, Shweta Mahajan,\nXingzhe He\n, Hossam Isack, Abhishek Kar Helge Rhodin, Andrea Tagliasacchi, Kwang Moo Yi\npaper\n/\ncode\n/\nproject page\nFew-shot Geometry-Aware Keypoint Localization\nCVPR 2023\nXingzhe He\n, Gaurav Bharaj, David Ferman, Helge Rhodin, Pablo Garrido\npaper\n/\nproject page\n/\nvideo\nLatentKeypointGAN: Controlling GANs via Latent Keypoints\nCRV 2023\n(Best Paper Award)\nXingzhe He\n, Bastian Wandt, Helge Rhodin\npaper\n/\nvideos\n/\nextended abstract\nAutoLink: Self-supervised Learning of Human Skeletons and Object Outlines by Linking Keypoints\nNeurIPS 2022\n(Spotlight ~3% acceptance rate)\nXingzhe He\n, Bastian Wandt, Helge Rhodin\npaper\n/\nproject page\n/\ncode\n/\n🤗demo\nGANSeg: Learning to Segment by Unsupervised Hierarchical Image Generation\nCVPR 2022\nXingzhe He\n, Bastian Wandt, Helge Rhodin\npaper\n/\ncode\nNonseparable Symplectic Neural Networks\nICLR 2021\nShiying Xiong, Yunjin Tong,\nXingzhe He\n, Shuqi Yang, Cheng Yang,\n                Bo Zhu\npaper\n/\nsupplementary\n/\nwebpage\nLearning Physical Constraints with Neural Projections\nNeurIPS 2020\nShuqi Yang,\nXingzhe He\n, Bo Zhu\npaper\n/\nvideo\n/\nwebpage\nAdvectiveNet: An Eulerian-Lagrangian Fluidic Reservoir for Point Cloud Processing\nICLR 2020\nXingzhe He\n, Helen L. Cao, Bo Zhu\npaper\n/\ncode\nSymplectic Neural Networks in Taylor Series Form for Hamiltonian Systems\nJournal of Computational Physics\nYunjin Tong*, Shiying Xiong*,\nXingzhe He\n, Guanghan Pan, Bo Zhu\npaper\n/\nwebpage\nSoft Multicopter Control using Neural Dynamics Identification\nCoRL 2020\nYitong Deng, Yaorui Zhang,\nXingzhe He\n, Shuqi Yang, Yunjin Tong,\n                Michael Zhang, Daniel M. DiPietro, Bo Zhu\npaper\n/\nvideo\nRoeNets: Predicting Discontinuity of Hyperbolic Systems from Continuous Data\nInternational Journal for Numerical Methods in Engineering\nYunjin Tong, Shiying Xiong,\nXingzhe He\n, Shuqi Yang, Zhecheng Wang, Rui Tao, Runze Liu, Bo Zhu\npaper\nXingzhe He © 2021"
  },
