    "homepage_text": "Hang Zhao's Homepage\nHang Zhao's Homepage\nPublications\nServices\nHang (Alex) Zhao\nWuhan University\nLinks\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout Me\nI am Hang Zhao （赵航）, currently  a postdoctoral researcher at Wuhan University,  working in collaboration with Professor\nKai Xu\nfrom  Institute of AI for Industries, Chinese Academy of Sciences. I received  my Ph.D. in Computer Science in 2025 from NUDT, under the supervision of Professor Kai Xu. Upon the recommendation of Professor\nXin Xu\n, I served as a visiting researcher in\nLAMDA\nled by Professor\nZhi-Hua Zhou\nat Nanjing University,  under the guidance of Professor\nYang Yu\n,  from June 2021 to March 2024. Prior to my doctoral studies, I completed my Bachelor’s degree at the Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT).\nWe are hiring PhD, Msc, and visiting students in embodied intelligence.\nOur group is research-driven, offering  active academic mentoring, ample  computational resources, and a focus on valuable, exciting research topics. Students working with us have published in top-tier venues such as SIGGRAPH and RSS, or received perfect review scores for their papers.  If you are interested,  please drop me an email at\nhangzhao@whu.edu.cn\n,\nalexfrom0815@gmail.com\n(WeChat: alex_hang_zhao).\nResearch Interests\nIndustrial Embodied Intelligence, Reinforcement Learning, Combinatorial Optimization\nNews\n2026/02/16: 入选 CCF-CAD&CG 博士学位论文激励计划.\n2025/11/25: 获中国博士后科学基金第78批面上资助.\n2025/10/13: 获湖北省博士后尖端人才引进项目资助.\n2025/09/15: Our\nintelligent assembly system\nfor automobile doors has been successfully accepted and deployed on the\nSERES AITO M8 production line\n, with the order exceeding\n10 million RMB\n! （我们的\n汽车门盖智能装调系统\n已顺利验收并成功部署于\n赛力斯问界 M8 生产线\n，订单金额超过\n1000万元人民币\n！）\n2025/08/28: 获国自然青年科学基金项目（C类）资助.\n2025/08/25: Our work on the\nindustrial packing  robot\nhas been accepted by\nIJRR\n! The system has successfully passed acceptance testing at the\nDeli Smart Logistics Park\n. The corresponding order exceeds\n10 million RMB\n! （我们的\n工业码垛具身智能机器人\n研究成果已被机器人领域顶级期刊\nIJRR\n录用！该系统已在\n得力智慧物流园\n顺利验收，订单金额超过\n1000万元人民币\n！）\n2025/06/11: I am honored  as\nOutstanding Graduate of Hunan Province\n.\n2025/06/07: 获人社部“博新计划”资助.\n2025/04/30: Our paper “Learning Practically Feasible Policies for Online 3D Bin Packing” is selected as an\nOutstanding Paper of the Year (Two-Year Hot Paper)\nby Science China Information Sciences.\n2024/04/21: We are honored with the\nOutstanding Poster Award\nat China3DV, ranking first among 100 participants.\n2023/12/01: I am awarded with\nNational Scholarship\nfor Ph.D. students.\n2023/08/11: The code we published has been nominated for the\nOutstanding Graphics Open Source Project of 2023\nby the Computer-Aided Design and Computer Graphics (CAD&CG) Technical Committee  of the China Computer Federation (CCF).\n2023/05/20: Our paper for irregular object packing has been accepted by\nACM TOG\n!\n2022/02/27: The\ncode\nof our\nICLR\nwork has been released now, all kinds of feedback and any contribution is welcome!\n2022/02/25: I am awarded\nLingdi Scholarship\nof 30,000 yuan.\n2022/01/21: The work on continuous domain packing has been accepted at\nICLR 2022\n! I independently completed this project as a student, and I genuinely take pride in the recognition it has received.\n2019/06/01: I am honored  as\nOutstanding Graduate of Beijing\n.\n2018/11/01: I am awarded with\nNational Scholarship\nfor  undergraduate students.\nPublications\nFrom Specialist to Generalist: A Comprehensive Survey on World Models\n[\nPaper\n]\nKai Xu,\nHang Zhao\n, Ruizhen Hu, Yuhang Huang, Ziqiao Zhou, Wancheng Feng, Li Yi, Sida Peng,\n        Xing Liu, Zihao Liu, Jin Zhang, Chenyang Zhu, Renjiao Yi, Qin Zou, Bo Du, Haibin Yu\nComputational Visual Media, 2026\nDeliberate Planning of 3D Bin Packing on Packing Configuration Trees\n[\nPaper\n]\nHang Zhao\n,\n        Juzhan Xu, Kexiong Yu, Ruizhen Hu, Chenyang Zhu,\nBo Du\n,\n        Kai Xu\nInternational Journal of Robotics Research, 2025\nDISCO: Efficient Diffusion Solver for Large-Scale Combinatorial Optimization Problems\n[\nPaper\n]\nHang Zhao\n,\n        Kexiong Yu, Yuhang Huang, Renjiao Yi, Chenyang Zhu, Kai Xu\nGraphical Models, 2025\nCAD/Graphics Best Paper, CCF Distinguished Paper\nPIN-WM: Learning Physics-INformed World Models for Non-Prehensile Manipulation\n[\nPaper\n]\nWenxuan Li,\nHang Zhao*\n, Zhiyuan Yu, Yu Du, Qin Zou,\nRuizhen Hu\n,\n      Kai Xu\nRobotics: Science and Systems, 2025\nEmbodied Intelligence for Flexible Manufacturing: A Survey\n[Paper]\nKai Xu,\nHang Zhao\n, Ruizhen Hu, Min Yang, Hao Liu, Hui Zhang, Haibin Yu\nROBOT, 2025\nDesigning Pin-pression Gripper and Learning its Dexterous Grasping with Online In-hand Adjustment\n[\nPaper\n]\nHewen Xiao, Xiuping Liu,\nHang Zhao*\n, Jian Liu,  Kai Xu\nSIGGRAPH, 2025\nDeep Demonstration Tracing: Learning Generalizable Imitator Policy for Runtime Imitation from a Single Demonstration\n[\nPaper\n]\nXiong-Hui Chen, Junyin Ye,\nHang Zhao*\n, Yi-Chen Li, Xu-Hui Liu, Haoran Shi, Yu-Yan Xu, Zhihao Ye, Si-Hang Yang, Yang Yu, Anqi Huang, Kai Xu, Zongzhang Zhang\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning, 2024\nLearning Physically Realizable Skills for Online Packing of General 3D Shapes\n[\nPaper\n•\nCode\n•\nVideo\n]\nHang Zhao\n,\nZherong Pan\n,\n        Yang Yu, Kai Xu\nACM Transactions on Graphics, 2023 (presented at SIGGRAPH 2024)\nLearning Efficient Online 3D Bin Packing on Packing Configuration Trees\n[\nPaper\n•\nCode\n•\nVideo\n]\nHang Zhao\n,\n        Yang Yu, Kai Xu\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations, 2022\nLearning practically feasible policies for online 3D bin packing\n[\nPaper\n]\nHang Zhao\n, Chenyang Zhu, Xin Xu,\nHui Huang\n,\n        Kai Xu\nScience China Information Sciences, 2022\nOutstanding Paper of the Year (Two-Year Hot Paper), ESI Highly Cited Paper\nLearning Efficient Online 3D Bin Packing on Packing Configuration Trees\n[\nPaper\n•\nCode\n•\nVideo\n]\nHang Zhao\n,\n         Qijin She,\nChenyang Zhu\n,\nYin Yang\n,\n          Kai Xu\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence, 2021\nActive scene understanding via online semantic reconstruction\n[\nPaper\n]\nLintao Zheng, Chenyang Zhu, Jiazhao Zhang,\nHang Zhao\n, Hui Huang, Matthias Niessner, Kai Xu\nComputer Graphics Forum, 2019\nServices\nConference\nSIGGRAPH 2024, SIGGRAPH Asia 2024\nNeurIPS 2023, 2024, 2025\nICLR 2024, 2025\nAAAI 2025，2026\nAISTATS 2025，2026\nIROS 2023\nJournal\nIEEE Transactions on Robotics\nInternational Journal of Robotics Research\nIEEE Transactions on Automation Science and Engineering\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\nSCIENCE CHINA Information Sciences\nIEEE Robotics and Automation Letters\nFrontiers of Computer Science\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\nElsevier Journal of Information Sciences\n自动化学报\nPublications\nServices"
