    "homepage_text": "Sijia Huang – Multimaterial Lab\nSkip to content\nSijia Huang\nEmail: sijia.huang@utah.edu\nGoogle scholar\nAbout\nEducation\nPh.D. in Chemical Engineering, University of Colorado - Boulder, 2021\nB.S. in Chemical Engineering, University of Minnesota - Twin Cities, 2015\nProfessional Experience\nAssistant Professor (2025-Present)\nDepartment of Chemical Engineering, University of Utah\nDepartment of Material Science & Engineering, University of Utah\nLawrence Fellow (2021-2024)\nLawrence Livermore National Lab\nResearch Intern (2019)\nReality Labs-Research at Meta\nTechnical Aide (2015)\n3M Company"
