  "serper::Wei Wei": {
    "homepage": "http://www.weiwei.one/",
    "emails": [
      "weiwei@weiwei.one"
    ],
    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Wei Wei's Homepage\nWei Wei\nweiwei@weiwei.one\nHome\nPublications\nBiography\nContact\nWelcome\nI am currently a research scientist at Google, where I work in the\nCloud AI group\nheaded by\nAndrew Moore\n. I am also an adjunct faculty member in Computer Science at Stanford univeristy. I teach\nFair, Accountable, and Transparent (FAccT) Deep Learning\nat Stanford together with\nJames Landay\n. I have broad interests in machine learning and have worked on a wide range of problems such as conversational models and adversarial robustness. Before I joined Google, I got my Ph.D. from the School of Computer Science at Carnegie Mellon University. You can find me on my\nGoogle AI homepage\n, my\nstanford webpage\n, my\nscholar profile\n, and my old\nCMU homepage\n."
  },
