    "homepage_text": "Yuqian Zhang\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nYuqian Zhang\nYuqian Zhang\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment of Electrical and Computer Engineering\nRutgers University\nOffice: CoRE 719, 94 Brett Rd, Piscataway, NJ\nEmail:\nyqz.zhang@rutgers.edu\nGoogle Scholar\nPreviously, I was a postdoc with the\nTripods Center for Data Science\nat Cornell University. I received my Ph.D. and M.S. in Electrical Engineering from Columbia University, under the supervision of Prof.\nJohn Wright\n. I received my B.S. in\nInformation Engineering\nfrom Xi'an Jiaotong University.\nGroup Members:\nDian Jin\n(PhD)\nJinxuan Xu\n(PhD)\nMaahin\nRathinagiriswaran\n(Master\n)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
