    "homepage_text": "Yingying Li's Home Page\nWelcome to\nYingying's\nhomepage!\n-----------------------------------------------------------------\nBy\nYingying\nLi\nFinStaR\nShort Bio\nResearch\nTeaching\nYingying\nLi\nCurriculum Vitae\nChair Professor, Fung Term Professor of Business (\n馮氏商學教授\n)\nDepartment of ISOM and Department of Finance,\nHong Kong University of Science and Technology,\nClear Water Bay, Kowloon, Hong Kong\nE-mail:\nyyli\nat\nust.hk\nPEACE\n&\nLOVE\n!"
