    "homepage_text": "Welcome to Zhang Lab | Zhang Lab\nSkip to main content\nOur mission\nDr. Zhang’s laboratory is interested in understanding the molecular mechanisms and functional roles of signaling enzymes such as protein kinases and phosphatases. We seek a fundamental understanding of spatiotemporal regulation of cell signaling.\nJoin us\nInterested post-doctoral candidates should contact Jin Zhang with curriculum vitae, a brief description of research interests, and three letters of recommendation.\nProspective graduate students should apply through the\nBiomedical Sciences\n,\nBioengineering\n, or\nChemistry & Biochemistry\ngraduate programs at UCSD.\nPlease e-mail\nJin\nif you are a current graduate student interested in rotating in Jin Zhang lab.\nDr. Jin Zhang\nAffiliation\nDept. of Pharmacology\n, UCSD\nMoores Cancer Center\n, UCSD\nDept. of Bioengineering\n, UCSD\nDept. of Chemistry and Biochemistry\n, UCSD\nBioPAC\nDepartment of Pharmacology\nUniversity of California, San Diego\n9500 Gilman Drive, BRFII, Room 1120\nLa Jolla, CA 92093-0702"
  },
