    "homepage_text": "Yazheng Yang\n      -  Beijing Institute of Technology\nBeijing Institute of Technology Home\nEnglish\n中文\nSearch content at Beijing Institute of Technology\nView Scopus Profile\nYazheng Yang\nInstitute of Advanced Structure Technology\nh-index\n1957\nCitations\n25\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2008\n2022\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Yazheng Yang is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n12\nSimilar Profiles\nCarbon Fiber\nMaterial Science\n100%\nEnergy Density\nMaterial Science\n95%\nSurface Energy\nMaterial Science\n79%\nOxidation Reaction\nMaterial Science\n77%\nNanocrystalline Material\nMaterial Science\n69%\nFunctional Surface\nMaterial Science\n66%\nSingle Crystal\nMaterial Science\n66%\nSurface Effect\nEngineering\n66%\nView full fingerprint\nResearch output\n46\nArticle\n1\nReview article\nEnhancing cryogenic mechanical properties of epoxy resins toughened by biscitraconimide resin\nLiu, N., Wang, H., Ma, B.,\nXu, B.\n, Qu, L.,\nFang, D.\n&\nYang, Y.\n,\n22 Mar 2022\n,\nIn:\nComposites Science and Technology.\n220\n, 109252.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nCarbon Fiber\n100%\nUltimate Tensile Strength\n100%\nFlexural Strength\n100%\nEpoxy\n100%\nImpact Strength\n100%\n62\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nInterfacial Competitive Debonding of a Bilayer Elastic Film on a Rigid Substrate\nYin, H.,\nYao, Y.\n,\nYang, Y.\n,\nPeng, Z.\n&\nChen, S.\n,\nJan 2022\n,\nIn:\nJournal of Applied Mechanics, Transactions ASME.\n89\n,\n1\n, 011003.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nDebonding\n100%\nInterfacial Debonding\n42%\nDetermines\n28%\nMultilayer Film\n28%\nFilm\n20%\n8\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nMicrostructure evolution of lithium-ion battery electrodes at different states of charge: Deep learning-based segmentation\nYang, Y.\n, Li, N., Wang, B., Li, N., Gao, K., Liang, Y., Wei, Y.,\nYang, L.\n,\nSong, W. L.\n&\nChen, H.\n,\nMar 2022\n,\nIn:\nElectrochemistry Communications.\n136\n, 107224.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nMicrostructure\n100%\nLithium-Ion Batteries\n100%\nDeep Learning\n100%\nState of Charge\n100%\nMicrostructure Evolution\n100%\n21\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nProgress in research on composite cryogenic propellant tank for large aerospace vehicles\nLiu, N., Ma, B., Liu, F., Huang, W.,\nXu, B.\n, Qu, L. &\nYang, Y.\n,\nApr 2021\n,\nIn:\nComposites Part A: Applied Science and Manufacturing.\n143\n, 106297.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nReview article\n›\npeer-review\nSpace Vehicle\n100%\nAerospace Vehicle\n100%\nCryogenic Tank\n50%\n92\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nTemperature field evolution of cylindrical battery: In-situ visualizing experiments and high fidelity internal morphology simulations\nYang, Y.\n, An, H. Y., Zhang, M. L.,\nSong, W. L.\n,\nYang, L.\n&\nChen, H. S.\n,\n1 Jul 2021\n,\nIn:\nJournal of Power Sources.\n499\n, 229910.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nBattery (Electrochemical Energy Engineering)\n100%\nLithium Ion Battery\n100%\nTemperature Distribution\n100%\nTomography\n50%\nLithium Ion\n50%\n8\nLink opens in a new tab\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nView all 47 research outputs"
