    "homepage_text": "Shifeng Zhang's Homepage\nShifeng Zhang\nCenter for Biometrics and Security Research (CBSR)\nNational Laboratory of Pattern Recognition (NLPR)\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academic of Sciences (CASIA)\nNo.95 Zhongguancun East Road, Haidian District, Beijing, China\nAbout Me\nI received the PhD degree in\nNational Laboratory of Pattern Recognition\nin the\nInstitute of Automation, Chinese Academic of Sciences\nin 2020. \n        My supervisor is\nProf. Stan Z. Li\n. \n        Before that, I received the B. Eng degree from\nSchool of Communication and Information Engineering\nin\nUniversity of Electronic Science and Technology of China\nin 2015.\nMy research interest includes machine learning and pattern recognition, \n        with a focus on generic object detection, face detection, pedestrian detection and video detection.\nNews\nâ â¢ 06 / 2020:   Our paper\nATSS\nwas nominated for Best Paper Award at\nCVPR 2020\nâ â¢ 05 / 2020:   One paper is accepted by\nTPAMI\nâ â¢ 04 / 2020:   One paper is accepted by\nTCSVT\nâ â¢ 02 / 2020:   One paper is accepted by\nCVPR 2020\nas Oral\nâ â¢ 02 / 2020:   One paper is accepted by\nTBIOM\nâ â¢ 11 / 2019:   Three papers are accepted by\nAAAI 2020\nâ â¢ 07 / 2019:   One paper is accepted by\nNeurocomputing\nâ â¢ 07 / 2019:   One paper is accepted by\nTMM\nâ â¢ 06 / 2019:   We win\n1st\nplace in\nUG\n2\nChallenge\non the Dark Face Detection track\n[report]\n[poster]\nâ â¢ 02 / 2019:   Two papers are accepted by\nCVPR 2019\nâ â¢ 01 / 2019:   One paper is accepted by\nIJCV\nâ â¢ 12 / 2018:   We release all the training and testing\ncodes\nof the CPU Real-time face detector - FaceBoxes\nâ â¢ 11 / 2018:   One paper is accepted by\nAAAI 2019\nâ â¢ 08 / 2018:   We win\n3rd\nplace in\nWIDER Challenge\non the face detection track\n[report]\n[poster]\nâ â¢ 07 / 2018:   One paper is accepted by\nECCV 2018\nâ â¢ 04 / 2018:   One paper is accepted by\nIJCAI 2018\nâ â¢ 02 / 2018:   One paper is accepted by\nCVPR 2018\nâ â¢ 01 / 2018:   One paper is accepted by\nNeurocomputing\nâ â¢ 10 / 2017:   One paper is awarded the\nBest Student Paper\non\nCCBR 2017\nâ â¢ 08 / 2017:   One paper is accepted by\nCCBR 2017\nâ â¢ 07 / 2017:   One paper is accepted by\nICCV 2017\nâ â¢ 06 / 2017:   One paper is accepted by\nIJCB 2017\nPublications\nRefineFace: Refinement Neural Network for High Performance Face Detection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Cheng Chi, Zhen Lei, Stan Z Li\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\npaper\nBridging the Gap Between Anchor-based and Anchor-free Detection via Adaptive Training Sample Selection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Cheng Chi, Yongqiang Yao, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, Oral,\nBest Paper Nomination\n, 2020\npaper,\nppt\ncode\nRefineDet++: Single-Shot Refinement Neural Network for Object Detection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Longyin Wen, Zhen Lei, Stan Z Li\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT)\npaper\nCASIA-SURF: A Large-scale Multi-modal Benchmark for Face Anti-spoofing\nShifeng Zhang\n, Ajian Liu, Jun Wan, Yanyan Liang, Guogong Guo, Sergio Escalera, Hugo Jair Escalante, Stan Z Li\nIEEE Transactions on Biometrics, Behavior, and Identity Science (TBIOM)\npaper,\ndataset\nPedHunter: Occlusion Robust Pedestrian Detector in Crowded Scenes\nCheng Chi\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*â\n, Junliang Xing, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li, Xudong Zou\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2020\n*\nequal contribution\n,\nâ\ncorresponding author\npaper\nRelational Learning for Joint Head and Human Detection\nCheng Chi\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*â\n, Junliang Xing, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li, Xudong Zou\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n, 2020\n*\nequal contribution\n,\nâ\ncorresponding author\npaper\nMis-classified Vector Guided Softmax Loss for Face Recognition\nXiaobo Wang\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*\n, Shuo Wang, Tianyu Fu, Hailin Shi, Tao Mei\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n,\nOral\n, 2020\n*\nequal contribution\npaper\nFaceBoxes: A CPU Real-Time and Accurate Unconstrained Face Detector\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiaobo Wang, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li\nNeurocomputing\npaper\nWiderPerson: A Diverse Dataset for Dense Pedestrian Detection in the Wild\nShifeng Zhang\n, Yiliang Xie, Jun Wan, Hansheng Xia, Stan Z. Li, Guodong Guo\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\npaper,\nproject page\nA Dataset and Benchmark for Large-scale Multi-modal Face Anti-spoofing\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiaobo Wang, Ajian Liu, Chenxu Zhao, Jun Wan, Sergio Escalera, Hailin Shi, Zezheng Wang, Stan Z. Li\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2019\npaper,\nposter,\ndataset\nScratchDet: Training Single-Shot Object Detectors from Scratch\nRui Zhu\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*\n, Xiaobo Wang, Longyin Wen, Hailin Shi, Liefeng Bo, Tao Mei\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n,\nOral\n, 2019\n*\nequal contribution\npaper,\nposter,\nppt\nSingle-Shot Scale-Aware Network for Real-Time Face Detection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Longyin Wen, Hailin Shi, Zhen Lei, Siwei Lyu, Stan Z. Li\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV)\npaper\nSelective Refinement Network for High Performance Face Detection\nCheng Chi\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*â\n, Junliang Xing, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li, Xudong Zou\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n,\nOral\n, 2019\n*\nequal contribution\n,\nâ\ncorresponding author\npaper,\nppt\ncode\nOcclusion-aware R-CNN: Detecting Pedestrians in a Crowd\nShifeng Zhang\n, Longyin Wen, Xiao Bian, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n(ECCV)\n, 2018\npaper,\nposter\nEnsemble Soft-Margin Softmax Loss for Image Classification\nXiaobo Wang\n*\n,\nShifeng Zhang\n*\n, Zhen Lei, Si Liu, Xiaojie Guo, Stan Z. Li\nInternational Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence\n(IJCAI)\n,\nOral\n, 2018\n*\nequal contribution\npaper\nSingle-Shot Refinement Neural Network for Object Detection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Longyin Wen, Xiao Bian, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(CVPR)\n, 2018\npaper,\nposter\ncode\nDetecting Face with Densely Connected Face Proposal Network\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Zhen Lei, Hailin Shi, Xiaobo Wang, Stan Z. Li\nNeurocomputing\npaper\nS\n3\nFD: Single Shot Scale-invariant Face Detector\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Zhen Lei, Hailin Shi, Xiaobo Wang, Stan Z. Li\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n(ICCV)\n, 2017\npaper,\nposter\ncode\nFaceBoxes: A CPU Real-time Face Detector with High Accuracy\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Zhen Lei, Hailin Shi, Xiaobo Wang, Stan Z. Li\nInternational Joint Conference on Biometrics\n(IJCB)\n,\nSpotlight\n, 2017\npaper,\nposter,\nppt\ncode_caffe,\ncode_pytorch\nDetecting Face with Densely Connected Face Proposal Network\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Zhen Lei, Hailin Shi, Xiaobo Wang, Stan Z. Li\nCCF Chinese Conference Biometric Recognition\n(CCBR)\n,\nBest Student Paper\n, 2017\npaper,\nposter,\nppt\nLoss Function Search for Face Recognition\nXiaobo Wang, Shuo Wang, Chi Cheng,\nShifeng Zhang\nâ\n, Tao Mei\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(ICML)\n, 2020\nâ\ncorresponding author\nFLDet: A CPU Real-time Joint Face and Landmark Detector\nChubin Zhuang,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Zhen Lei, Xiangyu Zhu, Jinqiao Wang\nIAPR International Conference On Biometrics\n(ICB)\n, 2019\npaper\nLearning Lightweight Face Detector with Knowledge Distillation\nHaibo Jin,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Yinhang Tang, Zhen Lei\nIAPR International Conference On Biometrics\n(ICB)\n, 2019\npaper\nFeature Enhancement for Joint Human and Head Detection\nYongming Zhang,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Chubin Zhuang, Zhen Lei\nCCF Chinese Conference Biometric Recognition\n(CCBR)\n, 2019\npaper\nSingle Shot Attention-Based Face Detector\nChubin Zhuang,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xiangyu Zhu, Zhen Lei, Stan Z. Li\nCCF Chinese Conference Biometric Recognition\n(CCBR)\n, 2018\npaper\nMetric Embedded Discriminative Vocabulary Learning for High-Level Person Representation\nYang Yang, Zhen Lei,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Hailin Shi, Stan Z. Li\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n(AAAI)\n,\nOral\n, 2016\npaper\nCross-Modality Interactive Attention Network for Multispectral Pedestrian Detection\nLu Zhang, Zhi-Yong Liu,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Xu Yang, Hong Qiao, Kaizhu Huang, Amir Hussain\nInformation Fusion\npaper\nTask-oriented Feature-fused Network with Multi-variate Dataset for Joint Face Analysis\nXuxin Lin, Jun Wan, Yiliang Xie,\nShifeng Zhang\n, Chi Lin, Yanyan Liang, Guodong Guo, Stan Z. Li\nIEEE Transactions on Cybernetics\n(TCYB)\npaper\nPreprints\nImproved Selective Refinement Network for Face Detection\nShifeng Zhang\n, Rui Zhu, Xiaobo Wang, Hailin Shi, Tianyu Fu, Shuo Wang, Tao Mei, Stan Z. Li\nTechnical report, achieving\nstate-of-the-art performance\non\nWIDER FACE\npaper\nAcademic Activities\nPresentation\n• Open a course named\nObject Dection Based on Deep Learning\nat\nshenlanxueyuan\n• CVPR 2020 Oral presentation, Poster\n• AAAI 2020 Oral presentation, Poster\n• CVPR 2019 Oral presentation, Poster\n• AAAI 2019 Oral presentation\n• ECCV 2018 Poster\n• IJCAI 2018 Oral presentation\n• CVPR 2018 Poster\n• ICCV 2017 Poster\n• IJCB 2017 Spotlight presentation, Poster\n• CCBR 2017 Oral presentation, Poster\nReviewer\n• European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2020\n• International Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence (IJCAI), 2020\n• IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2020\n• Association for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2020\n• IEEE International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2019\n• IEEE/CVF Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2019\n• European Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 20