    "github": "https://github.com/haolsun",
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Home\nPublications\nCourses\nServices\nPeople\nHaoliang Sun (孙皓亮)\n[\nGoogle Scholar\n,\nGitHub\n,\nCurriculum Vitae\n]\nAssociate Professor\nArtificial Intelligence Research Center\nSchool of Software\n,\nShandong University\nAbout me\nI am an associate professor at\nSchool of Software\n,\nShandong University\n. I obtained my PhD degree (2020) and Bachelor degree (2014) in engineering from Shandong University under the supervision of Prof. Yilong Yin. I have also studied in Prof. Shuo Li’s group at Western University, CA in 2016 as the visiting student. After that, I was supported by China Scholarship Council (CSC) and spent one and half years at University of Wisconsin-Madison, under the supervision of Prof. Vikas Singh. Besides, I pursued an internship at Inception Institute of Artificial Intelligence (IIAI), UAE.\nMy research interests span both machine learning and computer vision, including meta-learning, weakly supervised learning, generative model, etc.\n招生信息请参看中文主页\n(\nChinese homepage\n).\nCurrently, I am only able to consider applications from domestic students. Thank you for your understanding and interest.\nNews\n18/11/2025  Dr. Nick Tobin from Karolinska Institute visited our group for academic exchange.\n17/11/2025  I attended the 8th SDU-KI Joint Symposium and gave a talk of “Human–AI Collaborative Methods and Applications in Medical Decision-Making”.\n04/29/2025  Two papers were accepted by IJCAI-25. Congrats to Ren Wang and Shilu Yuan.\n02/27/2025  One paper was accepted by Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR 2025). Congrats to Ren Wang.\n09/27/2024  I gave a talk of “SSL-based noisy label learning and beyond” at Guilin University of Electronic Technology.\n07/28/2024  One paper was accepted by International Journal of Computer Vision (IJCV). Congrats to all co-authors.\n07/01/2024  One paper was accepted by Conference on Information and Knowledge Management (CIKM). Congrats to Yang An.\n12/01/2023  I have been awarded the title of Young Expert of Taishan Scholars in Shandong Province."
  },
