    "homepage_text": "Bin Jia\nBin Jia\nBin Jia\nI received my MS degree from\nUniversity of the Chinese Academy of Sciences\n, Beijing, China, and the Ph.D. degree in the\nDepartment of Aerospace Engineering at Mississippi State University\n, Starkville, USA.\nI am working with\nTorc Robotics\n, an independent subsidiary of Daimler Truck, as a Staff ML engineer. Before I joined Torc, I worked with\nAptiv.\nMy current research interests include nonlinear estimation, information fusion,  object detection and tracking,  and machine learning.\nPage 1 / 1"
