    "homepage_text": "张子杰课题组\nHome\nResearch\nTeam\nPublications\nPhotos\nZhang Lab\nTeam\nPrincipal Investigator\nZijie Zhang （张子杰）, PhD\nPrincipal Investigator\nState Key Laboratory for Conservation and Utilization of Bio-Resources\nYunnan University\nVice Director, Yunnan Vaccine Laboratory\nzijiezhang@ynu.edu.cn\nAssistant Professors/Postdocs (\n助理研究员/博士后\n)\nWei Yang (杨薇）\nAssistant Professor\nChunmei Li (李春梅）\nAssistant Professor\nRui Cheng (成睿）\nAssistant Professor\nYanli Chen (陈燕丽）\nPostdoc\nResearch Assistant (\n科研助理\n)\nZumi Zhou (周祖密)\nResearch Assistant\nB.S. Kunming Medical University Haiyuan College\nZhou is familiar with flow cytometry, fluorospot, pseudovirus neutralization assay, and human cytokine screening panel 48 detection.\nMei Yang (杨梅)\nResearch Assistant\nM.S. Yunnan University\nB.S. Anhui Agriculture University\nYang is familiar with polyploidy genomics and epigenetics.\nXiao Zhu (朱潇)\nResearch Assistant\nB.S. Kunming University\nZhu is familiar with pseudovirus neutralization assay.\nPostgraduate Students (\n研究生\n)\nRong Wang (王蓉)\nPhD candidate\n​​​\nM.S. Kunming Institute of Zoology, CAS\nB.S. Northwest University\nWang is interested in using single-cell multiomics to explore the transcriptional regulation of multi-point inactivated COVID-19 vaccines at the epigenetic level.\nWanting Qin (秦婉婷)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Yunnan University\nQin is interested in genomics.\nTianpei Shi (石田培)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Institute of Animal Sciences of CAAS\nShi is interested in genetics and works on genetic elucidation of herd vaccine immune responses.\nLei Xing (邢蕾)\nPhD candidate\nXing is intrested in animal cytology experiments, pseudovirus neutralization experiments, and single-cell data analysis.\nLipei Sun (孙立霈)\nPhD candidate\nSun is interested in genetics.\nQingqin Wu (吴青琴)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Kunming Institute of Zoology, CAS\nB.S. Southwest Forestry University\nWu is interested\nin\nsingle-cell immune repertoire and alternative splicing analysis of RNA.\nJingmei Li (李敬美)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Army Medical University\nLi is interested in\ndisease model-based immune heterogeneity studies.\nHuajie Hu (胡华杰)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Yunnan University\nB.S. Anhui University\nHu is interested in m\nulti-omics data analysis and mining based on machine learning.\nXuanjing Yu (余泫静)\nPhD candidate\nM.S. Queen Mary University of London\nB.S. Fujian Medical University\nYu is interested in precision medicine and data analysis of vaccine-induced immune response.\nNa Wan (万娜)\nPhD\ncandidate\nB.S.\nChina Pharmaceutical University\nWan is interested in\nvaccine-induced immune responses\n.\nXinyu Jiang (姜信宇)\nPhD candidate\nB.S. Xi'an University of Technology\nJiang is interested in single-cell multi-omics data mining.\nXupu Ma (马旭普)\nPhD\ncandidate\nB.S. China Pharmaceutical University\nMa is interested in\nin vitro transcription of mRNA nucleoside modifications.\nHouze Yu (喻厚泽)\nM.Sc. candidate\nB.S.\nYunnan University\nYu is interested in\npseudovirus neutralization assays and flow cytometry\n.\nJunze Wu (巫俊泽)\nPhD. candidate\nB.S. Fujian Medical University\nWu is intersted in pathogenesis of IgA nephropathy and gene expression analysis in single-cell transcriptomics\n.\nYupeng Xue (薛宇鹏)\nPhD.\ncandidate\nB.S.\nChina Pharmaceutical University\nSifan Chen (陈思帆)\nM.Sc. candidate\nB.S.\nNanjing Forestry University\nChen is interested in\nvaccine design\n.\nXuan Li (李炫)\nM.Sc. candidate\nB.S.\nChina Pharmaceutical University\nLi is interested in\nbioinformatics analysis\n.\nUndergraduate Students (\n本科生\n)\nZiyi Xiao (肖子义)\nM.B. candidate\nField of Study: Clinical Medicine\nYang Hu (胡杨)\nB.S. candidate\nField of Study: Biological Sciences\nYilin Zhang (张亿林)\nB.S. candidate\nField of Study:\nBiological Sciences\nGroup Alumni\nYuemiao Zhang (张月苗)\nAssociate professor/Resident, Peking University First Hospital\nPostdoc, Biology, Kunming Institute of Zoology, CAS\nPhD Internal Medicine, Peking University\nM.S Clinical Medicine, Peking University\nB.S Clinical Medicine, Ningbo University\nXinshuai Zhao (赵鑫帅)\nResearch Assistant, Affiliated Hospital of Yunnan University\nM.Sc. in Biomedical Engineering\nB.S. Zhengzhou University\n© 2021  Zhanglab for State Key Laboratory for Conservation and Utilization of Bio-resource. All right reserved.\nZhangLab\nState Key Laboratory for Conservation and Utilization of Bio-resource\nSchool of Life Sciences\nYunnan University\nYunnan 650091\nChina"
