    "github": null,
    "linkedin": null,
    "homepage_text": "Machine Learning and Data Science | UMD Department of Computer Science\nSkip to main content\nUMD Department of Computer Science\nToggle navigation\nExplore Research\nResearch\nResearch Areas\nAlgorithms & Theory\nAI & Robotics\nBioinformatics & Computational Biology\nComputer Vision & Machine Perception\nCybersecurity & Cryptography\nDatabases & Big Data\nGraphics, Visualization, and VR/AR\nHigh Performance & Scientific Computing\nHuman-Computer Interaction\nInformation Retrieval and Geographic Information Systems (GIS)\nIoT & Wearables Technology\nMachine Learning & Data Science\nNatural Language Processing\nProgramming Languages & Software Engineering\nQuantum Computing\nSystems & Networking\nUMIACS\nCfAR\nCLIP\nHCIL\nMaryland Cybersecurity Center (MC2)\nResearch Projects\nResearch Overview\nMachine Learning and Data Science\nMachine Learning and Data Science\nData science is an emerging field encapsulating interdisciplinary activities used to create data-centric products, applications or programs, that address specific scientific, socio-political, or business questions. It is making deep inroads in industry, government, health, and journalism. Data Science incorporates practices from a variety of fields in computer science: Machine Learning, Statistics, Databases, Visualization, Natural Language Processing, Systems, Algorithms, and others. The University of Maryland Computer Science Department, and other partner departments on campus, have world-class expertise in these areas.\nAssociated Faculty\nAshok Agrawala\nProfessor\nFardina Alam\nLecturer\nFaculty Director, Data Science MS Program\nCalin Belta\nProfessor\nBrendan Iribe Endowed Professor\nJordan Boyd-Graber\nProfessor\nMarine Carpuat\nAssociate Professor\nYizheng Chen\nAssistant Professor\nHal Daumé III\nProfessor\nVolpi-Cupal Family Endowed Professor\nAmol Deshpande\nProfessor\nAssociate Chair for Graduate Education\nSoheil Feizi\nAssociate Professor\nCan Firtina\nAssistant Professor\nRuohan Gao\nAssistant Professor\nTom Goldstein\nProfessor\nVolpi-Cupal Endowed Professor\nRitwik Gupta\nAssistant Professor\n(joining July 2026)\nMohammad Hajiaghayi\nProfessor\nJack and Rita G. Minker Professor\nJia-Bin Huang\nAssociate Professor\nCapital One Endowed Professor\nHeng Huang\nProfessor\nBrendan Iribe Endowed Professor\nFurong Huang\nAssociate Professor\nMohit Iyyer\nAssociate Professor\nMing Lin\nProfessor\nDr. Barry Mersky and Capital One   E-Nnovate Endowed Professor; Distinguished University Professor\nRuoshi Liu\nAssistant Professor\nIncoming\nZhicheng Liu\nAssistant Professor\nChristopher Metzler\nAssistant Professor\nBinghui Peng\nAssistant Professor\nRachel Rudinger\nAssistant Professor\nHanan Samet\nProfessor\nDistinguished University Professor\nHan Shao\nAssistant Professor\nAbhinav Shrivastava\nAssociate Professor\nMohammad Nayeem Teli\nSenior Lecturer\nSarah Wiegreffe\nAssistant Professor\nXiaodi Wu\nAssociate Professor\nBen Shneiderman\nProfessor Emeritus\nDistinguished University Professor\nLeilani Battle\nAdjunct Assistant Professor\nJohn Dickerson\nAdjunct Associate Professor\nMax Ehrlich\nAdjunct Assistant Professor\nResearch Scientist, NVIDIA Hardware Engineering\nMarc Lichtman\nAdjunct Assistant Professor\nLeila De Floriani\nAffiliate Professor\nSanghamitra Dutta\nAffiliate Assistant Professor\nNaomi Feldman\nAffiliate Associate Professor\nVanessa Frias-Martinez\nAffiliate Associate Professor\nJennifer Golbeck\nAffiliate Professor\nHernisa Kacorri\nAffiliate Assistant Professor\nRichard Marciano\nAffiliate Professor\nLouiqa Raschid\nAffiliate Professor\nPhilip Resnik\nAffiliate Professor\nMPower Professor, Department of Linguistics and Institute for Advanced Computer Studies\nHaizhao Yang\nAffiliate Associate Professor\nCunxi Yu\nAffiliate Assistant Professor\nKaiqing Zhang\nAffiliate Assistant Professor"
