    "homepage_text": "Yiheng Lin | Online Learning & Control PhD Student at Caltech.\nSkip to the content.\nHome\nNews\nPublications\nCV\nYiheng Lin\nOnline Learning & Control | PhD Student at Caltech.\nI am a fifth-year PhD student in the\nDepartment of Computing and Mathematical Sciences\nat California Institute of Technology. I am fortunate to be co-advised by\nProf. Adam Wierman\nand\nProf. Yisong Yue\n. My research interests are online learning, control, and reinforcement learning.\nPreviously, I completed my undergraduate program in Computer Science and Technology at Andrew Chi-Chih Yao’s CS pilot class at\nIIIS, Tsinghua University\n, where I was advised by\nProf. Longbo Huang\n.\nContact\nMy first name plus the first letter of my last name AT caltech.edu."
  },
  "serper::Tian Luo": {
