    "homepage_text": "Linqi (Alex) Zhou\nLinqi (Alex) Zhou\nLinqi (Alex) Zhou\nResearch Scientist @ OpenAI\nFollow\nEmail\nGithub\nGoogle Scholar\nAbout Me\nI am a Research Scientist at\nOpenAI\n. Previously, I was a Research Scientist at\nLuma AI\nand a co-founder at\nApparate Labs\n(acquired by\nLuma AI\n). I was also a Ph.D. student at Stanford University advised by\nProf. Stefano Ermon\n. I received my bachelor’s degrees in Computer Science and Applied Mathematics at University of California, Los Angeles and was advised by\nProf. Song-Chun Zhu\nand\nProf. Ying-Nian Wu\n. I work on machine learning methods for generative modeling.\nPublications\nTerminal Velocity Matching\nLinqi Zhou\n, Mathias Parger, Ayaan Haque, Jiaming Song\nICLR 2026\npdf\nwebsite\ncode\nInductive Moment Matching\nLinqi Zhou\n, Stefano Ermon, Jiaming Song\nICML 2025 (\nOral\n)\npdf\nwebsite\ncode\nConsistency Policy: Accelerated Visuomotor Policies via Consistency Distillation\nAaditya Prasad, Kevin Lin, Jimmy Wu,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Jeannette Bohg\nRSS 2024\npdf\nwebsite\ncode\nDreamPropeller: Supercharge Text-to-3D Generation with Parallel Sampling\nLinqi Zhou\n, Andy Shih, Chenlin Meng, Stefano Ermon\nCVPR 2024 (\nHighlight\n)\npdf\nwebsite\ncode\nDiffusion Model Alignment Using Direct Preference Optimization\nBram Wallace, Meihua Dang, Rafael Rafailov,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Aaron Lou, Senthil Purushwalkam, Stefano Ermon, Caiming Xiong, Shafiq Joty, Nikhil Naik\nCVPR 2024\npdf\ncode\nDiffusionSat: A Generative Foundation Model for Satellite Imagery\nSamar Khanna, Patrick Liu,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Chenlin Meng, Robin Rombach, Marshall Burke, David Lobell, Stefano Ermon\nICLR 2024\npdf\nDenoising Diffusion Bridge Models\nLinqi Zhou\n, Aaron Lou, Samar Khanna, Stefano Ermon\nICLR 2024\npdf\ncode\nAO-Grasp: Articulated Object Grasp Generation\nCarlota Parés Morlans, Claire Chen, Yijia Weng, Michelle Yi, Yuying Huang, Nick Heppert,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Leonidas Guibas, Jeannette Bohg\nIROS 2024\npdf\nwebsite\nDeep Latent State Space Models for Time-Series Generation\nLinqi Zhou\n, Michael Poli, Winnie Xu, Stefano Massaroli, Stefano Ermon\nICML 2023\npdf\ncode\nCurious Replay for Model-based Adaptation\nIsaac Kauvar*, Chris Doyle*,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Nick Haber\nICML 2023\npdf\ncode\nButterflyFlow: Building Invertible Layers with Butterfly Matrices\nChenlin Meng*,\nLinqi Zhou*\n, Kristy Choi*, Tri Dao, Stefano Ermon\nICML 2022\npdf\ncode\n3D Shape Generation and Completion through Point-Voxel Diffusion\nLinqi Zhou\n, Yilun Du, Jiajun Wu\nICCV 2021 (\nOral\n)\npdf\nwebsite\nDeep Unsupervised Clustering with Clustered Generator Model\nDandan Zhu, Tian Han,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Xiaokang Yang, Ying Nian Wu\narXiv 2021\npdf\nbibtex\nLearning Multi-layer Latent Variable Model via Variational Optimization of Short Run MCMC for Approximate Inference\nErik Nijkamp, Bo Pang, Tian Han,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Song-Chun Zhu, Ying Nian Wu\nECCV 2020\npdf\nbibtex\nJoint Training of Variational Auto-Encoder and Latent Energy-Based Model\nTian Han*, Erik Nijkamp*,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Bo Pang, Song-Chun Zhu, Ying Nian Wu\nCVPR 2020\npdf\ncode\nbibtex\nTowards Holistic and Automatic Evaluation of Open-Domain Dialogue Generation\nBo Pang*, Erik Nijkamp*, Wenjuan Han*,\nLinqi Zhou*\n, Yixian Liu, Kewei Tu\nACL 2020\npdf\ncode\nbibtex\nEmergence of Theory of Mind Collaboration in Multiagent Systems\nLuyao Yuan, Zipeng Fu,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Kexin Yang, Song-Chun Zhu\nNeurIPS 2019 Workshop\npdf\nNeural Architecture Search for Joint Optimization of Predictive Power and Biological Knowledge\nZijun Zhang,\nLinqi Zhou\n, Liangke Gou, Ying Nian Wu\narXiv 2019\npdf\nbibtex"
