ement and Awards\nKnowledge Transfer\nResearch and Consultancy\nOpen / close\nback\nResearch and Consultancy\nResearch Overview\nHighlighted Research Projects\nResearch Outcomes\nCAS AMSS-PolyU Joint Laboratory of Applied Mathematics (JLab)\nThe PolyU--SDU Joint Interdisciplinary Research Center on Applied Mathematics and FinTech (JRC)\nCITIC-PolyU Interdisciplinary Mathematical Digital AI Joint Laboratory (AIJLab)\nPolyU-Huawei Mathematical Optimization Innovation Laboratory (MOILab)\nUniversity Research Facility in Big Data Analytics (UBDA)\nResearch Centre for Intelligent Operations Research (IOR)\nResearch Centre for Mathematical Foundations of Generative AI (CMFAI)\nResearch Centre for Nonlinear Analysis (RCNA)\nResearch Centre for Quantitative Finance (RCQF)\nCAM-Net\nSIAM PolyU Student Chapter\nStatistical Advisory Unit\nNews and Events\nOpen / close\nback\nNews and Events\nNews\nEvents\nPublications\nOpen / close menu\nProgramme Booklet\nNewsletter\nAMA in the News\nPhoto Gallery\nVideo Gallery\nArchived Events and Photo Gallery\nAbout AMA\nOpen / close\nback\nAbout AMA\nMessage from the Head\nAlumni Corner\nAMA at a Glance\nOpen / close menu\nAwards and Achievements\nVision and Objectives\nFact and Figures\nMilestone\nDepartmental Advisory Committees\nContact Us\nJob Opportunities\nFacilities and Resources\nCurrent Student\nStaff\nQuick Access\nStart main content\nHome\nPeople\nAcademic Staff\nDr He Yangbo\nAcademic Staff\nPolyU Scholars Hub\nDr He Yangbo\nLecturer\n何楊波博士\nLocation\nTU715, Yip Kit Chuen Bldg.\nPhone\n+852 2766 6960\nmail\nbob.he@polyu.edu.hk\nstream\nPersonal Website\nPolyU Scholars Hub\nSCOPUS ID\nBiography\nDr He received his Bachelor of Science in Mathematics at Fudan University in 2002 and Doctor of Philosophy in Mathematics at City University of Hong Kong in 2008. Dr. He used to work for American International Assurance Company (Bermuda) Limited and taught at The Hong Kong Polytechnic University, Hong Kong Community College, Community College at Lingnan University and Lingnan Institute of Further Education. He is now a Teaching Fellow of Department of Applied Mathematics at The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\nEducation and Academic Qualifications\nBachelor of Science, Fudan University\nDoctor of Philosophy, City University of Hong Kong\nResearch Interests\nNonlinear dynamical system\nWe use Cookies to give you a better experience on our website. By continuing to browse the site without changing your privacy settings, you are consenting to our use of Cookies. For more information, please see our\nPrivacy Policy Statement\n.\nAccept\nYour browser is not the latest version. If you continue to browse our website,  Some pages may not function properly.\nYou are recommended to upgrade to a newer version or switch to a different browser. A list of the web browsers that we support can be found\nhere\nWhat are you looking for?\nSite Search\nSearch\nInternal Document Search\nPopular Search\nMathematics\nData Science\nInvestment Science\nNews\nEvents\nPublications"
