    "homepage_text": "Yujun Shen (Damon)\nYujun Shen (Damon)\nI currently serve as the Chief Scientist at\nRobbyant\n.\n        I also lead the Interactive Intelligence Lab at Ant Research, with research interests focusing on\ngenerative models\n,\nspatial intelligence\n, and\nembodied intelligence\n.\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nLinkedIn\n/\nEmail\nConference News\n[09/2025]\n2 papers accepted at\nNeurIPS 2025\n(San Diego, U.S.).\n[08/2025]\n1 paper, including 1 conference, accepted at\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2025\n(Hong Kong).\n[06/2025]\n7 papers, including 1 highlight, accepted at\nICCV 2025\n(Hawaii, U.S.).\n[06/2025]\n2 papers, including 2 oral, accepted at\nIROS 2025\n(Hangzhou, China).\n[03/2025]\n2 papers, including 2 journal, accepted at\nSIGGRAPH 2025\n(Vancouver, Canada).\n[02/2025]\n17 papers, including 3 highlight, accepted at\nCVPR 2025\n(Nashville, U.S.).\n[01/2025]\n3 papers accepted at\nICLR 2025\n(Singapore).\n[11/2024]\n1 paper accepted at\n3DV 2025\n(Singapore).\n[09/2024]\n3 papers, including 1 D&B Track, accepted at\nNeurIPS 2024\n(Vancouver, Canada).\n[07/2024]\n7 papers, including 1 oral, accepted at\nECCV 2024\n(Milano, Italy).\n[05/2024]\n2 papers accepted at\nICML 2024\n(Vienna, Austria).\n[03/2024]\n3 papers, including 3 conference, accepted at\nSIGGRAPH 2024\n(Denver, U.S.).\n[03/2024]\n9 papers, including 1 oral and 2 highlight, accepted at\nCVPR 2024\n(Seattle, U.S.).\n[01/2024]\n1 paper, including 1 oral, accepted at\nICLR 2024\n(Vienna, Austria).\n[09/2023]\n8 papers, including 2 D&B Track, accepted at\nNeurIPS 2023\n(New Orleans, U.S.).\n[08/2023]\n1 paper, including 1 journal, accepted at\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2023\n(Sydney, Australia).\n[07/2023]\n5 papers accepted at\nICCV 2023\n(Paris, France).\n[04/2023]\n1 paper accepted at\nICML 2023\n(Hawaii, U.S.).\n[03/2023]\n8 papers, including 1 highlight, accepted at\nCVPR 2023\n(Vancouver, Canada).\n[01/2023]\n1 paper accepted at\nICLR 2023\n(Kigali, Rwanda).\n[09/2022]\n4 papers, including 2 spotlight, accepted at\nNeurIPS 2022\n(New Orleans, U.S.).\n[07/2022]\n2 papers, including 1 oral, accepted at\nECCV 2022\n(Tel Aviv, Israel).\n[05/2022]\n1 paper accepted at\nICML 2022\n(Baltimore, U.S.).\n[03/2022]\n4 papers, including 1 oral, accepted at\nCVPR 2022\n(New Orleans, U.S.).\n[09/2021]\n2 papers accepted at\nNeurIPS 2021\n(Virtual).\n[03/2021]\n5 papers, including 2 oral and 2 workshop, accepted at\nCVPR 2021\n(Virtual).\n[07/2020]\n1 paper accepted at\nECCV 2020\n(Virtual).\n[02/2020]\n2 papers accepted at\nCVPR 2020\n(Virtual).\n[03/2018]\n1 paper accepted at\nCVPR 2018\n(Salt Lake City, U.S.).\n[Show more]\nJournal News\n[10/2025]\nHeadArtist-VL\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2025\n.\n[08/2025]\nNeuMesh++\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2025\n.\n[08/2025]\nUrbanGen\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2025\n.\n[04/2025]\nAnyDoor\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2025\n.\n[11/2024]\nT2S-DA\nincluded in\nIJCV 2024\n.\n[10/2024]\nU\n2\nPL\nincluded in\nIJCV 2024\n.\n[07/2024]\nSpatialGAN\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2024\n.\n[02/2024]\nIDInvert\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2024\n.\n[12/2022]\nGH-Feat\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2022\n.\n[02/2021]\nHiGAN\nincluded in\nIJCV 2021\n.\n[10/2020]\nInterFaceGAN\nincluded in\nTPAMI 2020\n.\n[Show more]\nSoftware News\n[11/2024]\nWe release\nMagicQuill\n, a practical tool to facilitate efficient interactive image editing.\n[09/2023]\nWe release\nAurora\n, an open-sourced GAN-based text-to-image generation model.\n[08/2023]\nWe release\nCoDeF\n, a novel representation for temporally consistent video processing.\n[07/2023]\nWe release\nCarver\n, a highly modularized codebase for 3D-aware image synthesis.\n[02/2022]\nWe release\nHammer\n, a sufficiently upgraded version of GenForce, to facilitate the training of deep models.\n[09/2020]\nWe release\nGenForce\n, an efficient PyTorch library for deep generative modeling.\nPublications\nRecent\n/\nSelected\n/\nFull\n/\n2D Gen\n/\n3D Gen\n/\nVideo Gen\n/\nEditing\n/\n3D Vision\n/\nDataset & Survey\n/\nMisc\nExperiences\nAnt Group\nJul. 2024 - Present\nSenior Staff Research Scientist\nAnt Group\nApr. 2022 - Jul. 2024\nStaff Research Scientist\nByteDance\nMar. 2021 - Apr. 2022\nSenior Researcher\nGoogle\nNov. 2019 - May 2020\nSoftware Engineer Intern\nFacebook Reality Lab (FRL)\nMay 2019 - Sep. 2019\nResearch Intern\nGoogle\nJul. 2018 - Dec. 2018\nSoftware Engineer Intern\nThe Chinese University of Hong Kong\nAug. 2016 - May. 2021\nPh.D. Degree in Information Engineering\nTsinghua University\nAug. 2012 - Jul. 2016\nBachelor Degree in Electronic Engineering\nSecond Bachelor Degree in Management\nProfessional Activities\nConference reviewer: CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, NeurIPS, ICML, ICLR, SIGGRAPH, SIGGRAPH Asia, AAAI\nJournal reviewer: TPAMI, IJCV, ToG, TIP, TNNLS, TMM, Computers & Graphics, TVCJ"
  },
