    "homepage_text": "Nanxuan Zhao\nNanxuan (Cherry) Zhao\nnanxuanzhao [at] gmail [dot] com\nAbout\nI  am a Research Scientist at\nAdobe Research\n(\nA cute official chat 💬\n). I was previously an Assistant Professor in the\nDepartment of Computer Science\n,\nUniversity of Bath\n.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDuring my study, I was fortunate to work with\nZoya Bylinskii\n,\nProf. Rynson W.H. Lau\n,\nProf. Dahua Lin\n,\nSteve Lin\n,\nProf. Hanspeter Pfister\n, and\nZhirong Wu\n.\nAt Adobe, I initiated and led the instruction-based image editing research, which has been adopted in\nAdobe Products\n. And 30 patents have been filed/published until end of 2025.\nMy research lies in the areas of computer graphics, computer vision/machine learning, and human-computer interaction.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRecently I am interested in using data wisely for\ncontent generation & editing\nand\ndata-driven graphic design\n. I am more focus on multi-modal control for customizing pixels, vectors, and 3D shapes.\nWe are actively looking for research interns. If you are interested in doing research project(s) at Adobe or remote collaboration with me, please drop me an email with your CV.\nSelected Service\nSIGGRAPH Asia 2026, 2023 Paper Committee (AC)\nCVPR 2026 (Lead) Area Chair\nPG 2026 Poster Chair\n3DV 2026 Area Chair\nSIGGRAPH 2025, 2024 Paper Committee (AC)\nCG&A Associate Editor\nPublications\nFilter by Research Area:\nAll Papers\nImage Editing\nVideo Editing\nHCI\nGenAI\nInterpretability\nNeRF/GS/3D\nVector Graphics\nColor/Style\nGraphic Design\nUnsupervised Learning\nLinear Image Generation by Synthesizing Exposure Brackets\nYuekun Dai, Zhoutong Zhang, Shangchen Zhou,\nNanxuan Zhao\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2026\nImage Editing\nGenAI\nProject (Coming Soon)\nDuetSVG: Unified Multimodal SVG Generation with Internal Visual Guidance\nPeiying Zhang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Matthew Fisher, Yiran Xu, Jing Liao, Difan Liu\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2026\nVector Graphics\nGenAI\nProject\nSemLayer: Semantic Generative Segmentation and Layer Reconstruction for Vector Icons\nHaiyang Xu, Ronghuan Wu, Li-Yi Wei,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Chenxi Liu, Cuong Nguyen, Zhuowen Tu, Zhaowen Wang\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2026\nVector Graphics\nGenAI\nProject (Coming Soon)\nIllustrator's Depth: Monocular Layer Index Prediction for Image Decomposition\nNissim Maruani, Peiying Zhang, Siddhartha Chaudhuri, Matthew Fisher,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Vladimir Kim, Pierre Alliez, Mathieu Desbrun, Wang Yifan\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2026\nImage Editing\nGenAI\nProject (Coming Soon)\nEditVerse: Unifying Image and Video Editing and Generation with In-Context Learning\nXuan Ju, Tianyu Wang, Yuqian Zhou, He Zhang, Qing Liu,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Zhifei Zhang, Yijun Li, Yuanhao Cai, Shaoteng Liu, Daniil Pakhomov, Zhe Lin, Soo Ye Kim, Qiang Xu\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2026\n(Oral)\nImage Editing\nVideo Editing\nGenAI\nProject\nLearning an Image Editing Model without Image Editing Pairs\nNupur Kumari, Sheng-Yu Wang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Yotam Nitzan, Yuheng Li, Krishna Kumar Singh, Richard Zhang, Eli Shechtman, Jun-Yan Zhu, Xun Huang\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2026\nImage Editing\nGenAI\nProject\nNotational Animating: An Interactive Approach to Creating and Editing Animation Keyframes\nXinyu Shi, Li-Yi Wei,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Jian Zhao, Rubaiat Habib Kazi\nACM Conference on Human Factors in Computing Systems (CHI), 2026\n🏆 Best Paper Honorable Mention\nHCI\nGenAI\nProject\nBeyond Simple Edits: X-Planner for Complex Instruction-Based Image Editing\nChun-Hsiao Yeh, Yilin Wang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Richard Zhang, Yuheng Li, Yi Ma, Krishna kumar Singh\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (AAAI), 2026\nGenAI\nImage Editing\nProject\narXiv\nBézier Splatting for Fast and Differentiable Vector Graphics Rendering\nXi Liu, Chaoyi Zhou,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Siyu Huang\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS), 2025\nGenAI\nVector Graphics\nNeRF/GS/3D\nProject\narXiv\nRethinking Layered Graphic Design Generation with a Top-Down Approach\nJingye Chen, Zhaowen Wang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Li Zhang, Difan Liu, Jimei Yang, Qifeng Chen\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2025\nGenAI\nGraphic Design\nProject\narXiv\nPresentation\n3D-Fixup: Advancing Photo Editing with 3D Priors\nYen-Chi Cheng, Krishna Kumar Singh, Jae Shin Yoon, Alex Schwing, Liangyan Gui, Matheus Gadelha, Paul Guerrero,\nNanxuan Zhao\nSiggraph 2025\nGenAI\nNeRF/GS/3Ds\nImage Editing\nProject\narXiv\nStyle Customization of Text-to-Vector Generation with Image Diffusion Priors\nPeiying Zhang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Jing Liao\nSiggraph 2025\nVector Graphics\nGenAI\nProject\narXiv\nMotionBridge: Dynamic Video Inbetweening with Flexible Controls\nMaham Tanveer, Yang Zhou, Simon Niklaus, Ali Mahdavi Amiri, Hao Zhang, Krishna Kumar Singh,\nNanxuan Zhao\nVideo Editing\nGenAI\nProject\narXiv\nSUGAR: Subject-Driven Video Customization in a Zero-Shot Manner\nYufan Zhou, Ruiyi Zhang, Jiuxiang Gu,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Jing Shi, Tong Sun\nVideo Editing\nGenAI\nProject\narXiv (Tech Report)\nUniReal: Universal Image Generation and Editing via Learning Real-world Dynamics\nXi Chen, Zhifei Zhang, He Zhang, Yuqian Zhou, Soo Ye Kim, Qing Liu, Yijun Li, Jianming Zhang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Yilin Wang, Hui Ding, Zhe Lin, Hengshuang Zhao\nComputer Vision and Pattern Recognition (CVPR), 2025\n(Highlight)\nImage Editing\nGenAI\nProject\narXiv\nGroupDiff: Diffusion-based Group Portrait Editing\nYuming Jiang,\nNanxuan Zhao\n#\n, Qing Liu, Krishna kumar Singh, Shuai Yang, Chen Change Loy, Ziwei Liu\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV), 2024\nImage Editing\nGenAI\narXiv\nSwapAnything: Enabling Arbitrary Object Swapping in Personalized Image Editing\nJing Gu,\nNanxuan Zhao\n, Wei Xiong, Qing Liu, Zhifei Zhang, He Zhang, Jianming Zhang, HyunJoon Jung, Yilin Wang, Xin Eric Wang\nEu