.\nMulti-Instance Multi-Label Classification from Crowdsourced Labels.\nProceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence (\nAAAI\n)\n, 2025.\nLin Long, Xijun Gu, Xinjie Sun, Wentao Ye,\nHaobo Wang\n, Sai Wu, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nBridging the Semantic Gap Between Text and Table: A Case Study on NL2SQL.\nIn Proceedings of the 13th International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2025.\nYuena Lin, Yiyuan Wang, Gengyu Lyu, Yongjian Deng, Haichun Cai, Huibin Lin,\nHaobo Wang\n, Zhen Yang.\nEnhance Multi-View Classification Through Multi-Scale Alignment and Expanded Boundary.\nIn Proceedings of the 13th International Conference on Learning Representations (\nICLR\n)\n, 2025.\nYuena Lin, Gengyu Lyu, Haichun Cai, Deng-Bao Wang,\nHaobo Wang\n, and Zhen Yang.\nSimplified Graph Contrastive Learning Model without Augmentation.\nIEEE Transactions on Knowledge and Data Engineering (\nTKDE\n)\n, 2025.\nJianan Yang, Yanming Zhang,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Gang Chen, Sai Wu, Junbo Zhao.\nCaCOM: Customizing Text-to-Image Diffusion Models in the Wild via Continual Active Selection.\nMachine Learning Journal (\nMLJ\n)\n, 2025.\nJianan Yang, Chenchao Gao, Zhiqing Xiao,\nHaobo Wang*\n, Sai Wu, Gang Chen, Junbo Zhao.\nLocating What You Need: Towards Adapting Diffusion Models to OOD Concepts In-the-Wild.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2024.\nZhonghao Wang, Danyu Sun, Sheng Zhou,\nHaobo Wang\n, Jiapei Fan, Longtao Huang, Jiajun Bu.\nNoisyGL: A Comprehensive Benchmark for Graph Neural Networks under Label Noise.\nAnnual Conference on Neural Information Processing Systems (\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2024.\nKai Tang, Junbo Zhao, Xiao Ding, Runze Wu, Lei Feng, Gang Chen,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nLearning Geometry-Aware Representations for New Intent Discovery.\nAnnual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (\nACL-Main\n)\n, 2024.\nLin Long, Rui Wang, Ruixuan Xiao, Junbo Zhao, Xiao Ding, Gang Chen,\nHaobo Wang*\n.\nOn LLMs-Dri