    "homepage_text": "Zichen Miao\nZichen Miao\n☰\n×\nAbout me\nEducation\nLinks\nLinkedIn\nGoogle Scholar\nZichen Miao\nContact\n:\nMSEE 289, Purdue University\nWest Lafayette, IN 47907\nmiaoz [at] purdue.edu\nI am a 4th year PhD student in\nElmore Family School of Electrical and Computer Engineering\nat\nPurdue University\n, advised by\nProf. Qiang Qiu\n. My current research interests are machine learning and computer vision.\nPreviously, I got my B.S. from\nSchool of Automation and Electrical Engineering\n,\nBeihang University\nin 2019.\nExperiences\nMicrosoft GenAI (2024.05-2024.08)\nResearch Intern\nMentors: Zhengyuan Yang, Lijuan Wang\nMicrosoft Research & Azure (2023.05-2023.08)\nResearch Intern\nMentors: Jiang Wang, Zicheng Liu\nPublications (* means equal contribution.)\nCoeff-Tuning: A Graph Filter Subspace View for Tuning Attention-Based Large Models\nZichen Miao\n*, Wei Chen*, Qiang Qiu\nCVPR 2025 (Highlight)\n[\npdf\n]\nTuning Timestep-Distilled Diffusion Model Using Pairwise Sample Optimization\nZichen Miao\n, Zhengyuan Yang, Kevin Lin, Ze Wang, Zicheng Liu, Lijuan Wang, Qiang Qiu\nICLR 2025\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nLarge Convolutional Model Tuning via Filter Subspace\nWei Chen,\nZichen Miao\n, Qiang Qiu\nICLR 2025\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nTraining Diffusion Models Towards Diverse Image Generation with Reinforcement Learning\nZichen Miao\n, Jiang Wang, Ze Wang, Zhengyuan Yang, Lijuan Wang, Qiang Qiu, Zicheng Liu\nCVPR 2024\n[\npdf\n]\nTraining Bayesian Neural Networks with Sparse Subspace Variational Inference\nJunbo Li,\nZichen Miao\n, Qiang Qiu, Ruqi Zhang\nICLR 2024\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nInner Product-based Neural Network Similarity\nWei Chen*,\nZichen Miao\n*, Qiang Qiu\nNeurIPS 2023\n[\npdf\n]\nContinual Learning With Filter Atom Swapping\nZichen Miao\n, Ze Wang, Wei Chen, Qiang Qiu\nICLR 2022 (Spotlight)\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nSpatiotemporal Joint Filter Decomposition in 3D Convolutional Neural Networks\nZichen Miao\n, Ze Wang, Xiuyuan Cheng, Qiang Qiu\nNeurIPS 2021\n[\npdf\n]\nLearning to Learn Dense Gaussian Processes for Few-Shot Learning\nZe Wang*,\nZichen Miao\n*, Xiantong Zhen, Qiang Qiu\nNeurIPS 2021\n[\npdf\n]\nImage Generation using Continuous Filter Atoms\nZe Wang, Seunghyun Hwang,\nZichen Miao\n, Qiang Qiu\nNeurIPS 2021 (Spotlight)\n[\npdf\n]\nAdaptive Convolutions with Per-pixel Dynamic Filter Atom\nZe Wang,\nZichen Miao\n, Jun Hu, Qiang Qiu\nICCV 2021\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nGraph Neural Networks with Low-rank Learnable Local Filters\nXiuyuan Cheng,\nZichen Miao\n, Qiang Qiu\nICLR 2021 (Spotlight)\n[\npdf\n] [\ncode\n]\nLast edited  on April 16\nth\n2025  10:23PM (Time Zone: UTC).\nPowered by\njemdoc + new design\n."
