    "homepage_text": "Hong Zhang's Academic Webpage\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nHong Zhang's Academic Webpage\nHong Zhang\n（\n张 弘）\nKeppel Professor in Financial Economics\nProfessor of Finance\nSingapore Management University\nEmail: hong\nzhang@\nsmu\n.edu.\nsg\nCV\nPublished Papers\nRecent Working Papers\nSSRN Author Page\nGoogle Scholar Page\nOther Academic Experience and\nPast Employment:\nAsian Bureau of Finance and Economics Research,\nSenior Fellow,\nSept 2018 ~ now.\nINSEAD Emerging Markets Institute, Visiting Fellow, Sept 2015~now;\nPBC School of Finance, Tsinghua University,\nPhoenix Chair Professor of Finance, 2016\n~\n2022;\nJ.D. Capital Chair Associate Professor of Finance, 2014\n~\n2016.\nDirector, China Finance Case Center, Jul 2015~\n2022\n;\nINSEAD,\nAssistant Professor of Finance, 2004 ~ 2014.\nEducation:\nPhD, Finance, Yale University, School of Management, 2004.\nM.S., Physics, New York University, 1999.\nB.S., Physics, Fudan University, 1997.\nBefore college, I had won a\nNational Gold Medal\nat\n8th Chinese Physics Olympics\n(\nI was the\nNational Champaign\nfor the Experiment part) and National 1st\nPrize\n,\n1991 National High School Mathematics Competition\n.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
