    "homepage_text": "Ming Yang | 杨铭\nDr.\nMing Yang\nMing Yang is a CTO with\nCVTE\n(\n002841.SZ\n), where he also serves as a Director of\nCVTE Research\n. His team is focusing on the research, development, and innovation of perception AI (vision, speech, haptics, etc.), with a broad range of applications in smart manufacturing, future education, and corporate services.\nPrior to joining CVTE, Ming received a B.E. (2009) and a Ph.D. (2014, advised by Prof. Hongyang Chao) in Computer Science from Sun Yat-sen University. He has spent time at\nMicrosoft Research Asia\n(2010 ~ 2012, advised by\nJian Sun\nwho lead the\nVisual Computing Group\n).\nTowards Accurate Facial Motion Retargeting with Identity-consistent and Expression-exclusive Constraints\n.\nLangyuan Mo, Haokun Li, Chaoyang Zou, Yubing Zhang, Ming Yang, Yihong Yang, Mingkui Tan\n.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n,\n2022\n.\nDeep View Synthesis via Self-Consistent Generative Network\n.\nZhuoman Liu, Wei Jia, Ming Yang, Peiyao Luo, Yong Guo, Mingkui Tan\n.\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia\n,\n2021\n.\nDeepo\n: setup and customize deep learning environment in seconds\n.\nCreator: Ming Yang. Contributors:\nShanchuan Xu\n,\nHao Cui\n,\nSeiro Ogasawara\n,\nAleks Artamonov\n,\nKristian Klemon\n,\nKeith Mattix II\n,\nEfren Mercado Jr\n,\nArtur Gontijo\n.\nGitHub Public Repository\nhttps://github.com/ufoym/deepo\n.\nREAL2: An end-to-end memory-augmented solver for math word problems\n.\nShifeng Huang, Jiawei Wang, Jiao Xu, Da Cao, Ming Yang\n.\nNeurIPS Workshop on Math AI for Education\n,\n2021\n.\nRecall and Learn: A Memory-augmented Solver for Math Word Problems\n.\nShifeng Huang, Jiawei Wang, Jiao Xu, Da Cao, Ming Yang\n.\nConference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing\n,\n2021\n.\nAuto-Bookkeeping\n: automate personal bookkeeping with machine learning\n.\nCreator: Ming Yang.\nGitHub Private Repository\n.\nDeep Reinforcement Active Learning for Medical Image Classification\n.\nJingwen Wang, Yuguang Yan, Yubing Zhang, Guiping Cao, Ming Yang, Michael Kwok-Po Ng\n.\nMedical Image Computing and Computer Assisted Interventions\n,\n2020\n.\nImbalanced Dataset Sampler\n(PyTorch)\n.\nCreator: Ming Yang. Contributors:\nJirka Borovec\n,\nJihwan Bang\n,\nDong Heon Cho\n,\nWajih Ullah Baig\n,\nZimo Nitrome\n,\nTobias Machnitzki\n,\nLee Tae-hoon\n.\nGitHub Public Repository\nhttps://github.com/ufoym/imbalanced-dataset-sampler\n.\nProbabilistic Latent Factor Model for Collaborative Filtering with Bayesian Inference\n.\nJiansheng Fang, Xiaoqing Zhang, Yan Hu, Yanwu Xu, Ming Yang, Jiang Liu\n.\nInternational Conference on Pattern Recognition\n,\n2020\n.\nRecursiveBF\n: A lightweight C++ library for recursive bilateral filtering\n.\nCreator: Ming Yang\n.\nGitHub Public Repository\nhttps://github.com/ufoym/recursive-bf\n.\nA Weighted Graph Attention Network Based Method for Multi-label Classification of Electrocardiogram Abnormalities\n.\nHongmei Wang, Wei Zhao, Zhenqi Li, Dongya Jia, Cong Yan, Jing Hu, Jiansheng Fang, Ming Yang\n.\nIEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society\n,\n2020\n.\nAn Efficient Lens Structures Segmentation Method on AS-OCT Images\n.\nGuiping Cao, Wei Zhao, Risa Higashita, Jiang Liu, Wan Chen, Jin Yuan, Yubing Zhang, Ming Yang\n.\nIEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society\n,\n2020\n.\nDeep Multi-instance Networks for Bundle Branch Block Detection from Multi-lead ECG\n.\nJing Hu, Wei Zhao, Dongya Jia, Cong Yan, Hongmei Wang, Zhenqi Li, Jiansheng Fang, Ming Yang\n.\nIEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society\n,\n2020\n.\nMOC: Measuring the Originality of Courseware in Online Education Systems\n.\nJiawei Wang, Jiansheng Fang, Jiao Xu, Shifeng Huang, Da Cao, Ming Yang\n.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia\n,\n2019\n.\nWavelet Rasterization\n(Python implementation)\n.\nCreator: Ming Yang\n.\nGitHub Public Repository\nhttps://github.com/ufoym/wavelet-rasterization\n.\nAttention Guided Network for Retinal Image Segmentation\n.\nShihao Zhang, Huazhu Fu, Yuguang Yan, Yubing Zhang, Qingyao Wu, Ming Yang, Mingkui Tan, Yanwu Xu\n.\nMedical Image Computing and Computer Assisted Interventions\n,\n2019\n.\nPM-NET: Pyramid Multi-Label Network for Optic Disc and Cup Segmentation\n.\nPengshuai Yin, Qingyao Wu, Yanwu Xu, Huaqing Min, Ming Yang, Yubing Zhang, Mingkui Tan\n.\nMedical Image Computing and Computer Assisted Interventions\n,\n2019\n.\nInstance-level Human Parsing via Part Grouping Network (Oral)\n.\nKe Gong, Xiaodan Liang, Yicheng Li, Yimin Chen, Ming Yang, Liang Lin\n.\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision\n,\n2018\n.\nImage Blind Denoising With Generative Adversarial Network Based Noise Modeling\n.\nJingwen Chen, Jiawei Chen, Hongyang Chao, Ming Yang\n.\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n,\n2018\n.\nEffective Clipart Image Vectorization Through Direct Optimization of Bezigons\n.\nMing Yang, Hongyang Chao, Chi Zhang, Jun Guo, Lu Yuan, Jian Sun\n.\nIEEE Transactions on Visualization and Computer Graphics\n,\n2015\n.\nECISER: Efficient Clip-art Image SEgmentation by Re-rasterization\n.\nMing Yang, Hongyang Chao\n.\nComputer-Aided Design\n,\n2015\n.\nA Rapid Abnormal Event Detection Method for Surveillance Video Based on a Novel Feature in Compressed Domain of HEVC\n.\nHuang Li, Yihao Zhang, Ming Yang, Yangyang Men, Hongyang Chao\n.\nIEEE International Conference on Multimedia and Expo\n,\n2014\n.\nSemantics-driven Portrait Cartoon Stylization (Oral)\n.\nMing Yang, Shu Lin, Liang Lin, Kun Zeng, Hongyang Chao\n.\nIEEE International Conference on Image Processing\n,\n2010\n."
