    "homepage_text": "Runhao Zeng\nHome\nResearch\nPublications\nGrants\nStudents\nRunhao Zeng\nI am a tenure-track associate professor at the Artificial Intelligence Research Institute of Shenzhen MSU-BIT University, China. I received my Bachelor’s Degree in Automation in 2015 and my Ph.D. in Software Engineering in 2021, both from the South China University of Technology, under the supervision of Prof.\nMingkui Tan\n.\n                My research interests span machine learning and deep learning with a focus on their applications in video understanding and AI+Health. I have a particular interest in the multimodal information-based assessment and analysis of health, mental, and psychological states.\n中文主页\nGoogle Scholar\n|\nContact\n|\nResearch Opportunities\n|\nNews\n|\nExperience\n|\nService\nContact\nEmail: zengrh [at] smbu (dot) edu (dot) cn\nResearch Opportunities\nMaster's & PhD Students:\nAt Computer Science Department, Beijing Institute of Technology.\nVisiting Students/TA Positions:\nResearch opportunities with accommodation and stipend.\nRemote Interns:\nWeekly guidance meetings.\nNews\n2025/08\nOne paper accepted by\nTNNLS\n! Congratulations to\nKunyang\n, the paper was finally accepted one year after graduation!\n2025/06\nOne paper accepted by\nICCV\n! Congratulations to\nJiaqi\nand\nMinghao\n!\n2025/06\nOur undergraduate student\nXu Maokuan\nwas awarded the\nUniversity-Level Outstanding Undergraduate Thesis\n. During his undergraduate studies, he published first-author paper in\nSmartIoT\nand contributed to another paper in a CAS Q1 journal. He will soon pursue further studies at\nNTU\n. Best wishes!\n2025/06\nOne paper accepted by\nESWA\n! Congratulations to\nQiwei\non his first-author publication! He will soon start direct Ph.D. studies at\nHKUST(GZ)\n.\n2025/06\nOne paper accepted by\nnpj Flexible Electronics\n!\n          In collaboration with Prof. Li Hui from Shenzhen University, we researched magnetically driven soft miniature robots\n          integrating motion and perception, combining biomimetic structure design, high-precision printing technology, and\n          intelligent recognition capabilities!\n2025/06\nOne paper on video model\nTTA\naccepted by\nIEEE TCSVT\n!\n          Congratulations to\nDeng Qi\nand\nRonghao\n!\n2025/05\nOne paper on emotion recognition accepted by\nIEEE IoTJ\n!\n          Congratulations to\nZhang Zhen\n!\n2025/05\nFour students from the group successfully passed their Master's thesis defenses. Among them,\nZhuo Yishen\nreceived the\nUniversity Outstanding Thesis Award\nand was honored as an\nOutstanding Graduate\n.\n2025/05\nGroup member\nChen Xiaoyong\nreceived the\nUniversity's Top 100 Thesis Recommendation\n,\n          was named a\nUniversity-Level Outstanding Graduate\n, and graduated with a\nBachelor's Degree with Honors\n!\n2025/04\nTwo papers were selected for the\nPoster Section of VALSE 2025\n! Looking forward to more interactions\n          with everyone in Zhuhai!\n2025/02\nOne paper on model compression and acceleration accepted by\nCVPR 2025\n!\n          Congratulations to\nXiaoyong\n,\nJiaming\n, and\nSitong\n! This is the second CVPR paper for both\n          Xiaoyong and Jiaming!\n2024/12\nOne paper on video semantic segmentation accepted by\nTITS\n!\n          Congratulations to\nJianrui\n, the paper was finally accepted one year after graduation!\n2024/12\nThree papers accepted by\nAAAI 2025\n! Congratulations to\nDeng Qi\n,\nRonghao\n,\nHaifeng\n, and\nJiuyi\n!\n2024/12\nOne paper on video moment retrieval accepted by\nIEEE TCSVT\n!\n          Congratulations to\nYishen\nand\nJialiang\n!\n2024/12\nOne paper on long-form video understanding accepted by\nIEEE TCSVT\n!\n          Congratulations to\nYouzeng\n!\n2024/12\nOne paper on cross-modal video retrieval accepted by the\nJournal of Image and Graphics\n!\n2024/10\nOne paper on embodied AI accepted by\nIEEE TMM\n!\n2024/07\nOne paper on robot behavior learning accepted by\nECAI 2024\n!\n          Congratulations to\nDing Jie\nand\nQiwei\n!\n2024/06\nMemSAM\nwas shortlisted for the\nBest Paper Candidate\nat\nCVPR 2024\n!\n2024/02\nTwo papers on video analysis accepted by\nCVPR 2024\n!\n          Congratulations to\nXiaoyong\nand\nJiaming\n!\n2023/09\nOne paper on Vision-and-Language Navigation accepted by\nNeurIPS 2023\n!\n2023/07\nOne paper on video test-time adaptation accepted by\nACM MM 2023\n!\n          Congratulations to\nDeng Qi\nand\nHuixuan\n!\nService\nConference Program Committee\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning (ICML)\nConference on Neural Information Processing Systems (NeurIPS)\nIEEE / CVF Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition Conference (CVPR)\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV)\nEuropean Conference on Computer Vision (ECCV)\nJournal Reviewer\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence (TPAMI)\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing (TIP)\nIEEE Transactions on Circuits and Systems for Video Technology (TCSVT)\nIEEE Transactions on Multimedia (TMM)\nStudent Awards\nMathematical Contest in Modeling (MCM), International Level, Meritorious Winner\nNational College IoT Design Contest, National First Prize (awarded 2 times), National Third Prize (awarded once)\n\"Blue Bridge Cup\" National Software and Information Technology Professionals Contest, National First Prize (awarded once), National Third Prize (awarded once)\niCAN International Contest of innovAtioN (iCAN Contest), National Third Prize\nGlobal Campus Artificial Intelligence Algorithm Elite Competition (AIC), National Third Prize\n5th \"Huawei Cup\" China Graduate AI Innovation Competition, National Third Prize\n18th China Graduate Electronics Design Contest, Provincial Second Prize\nNational Scholarship (awarded to multiple undergraduate and postgraduate students)\nUniversity-Level Academic Scholarship for Postgraduate Students (Special Class and First Class awarded to multiple recipients)\nMinistry of Education-Huawei \"Intelligent Base\" Future Star\nProvincial Outstanding Graduate\nUniversity-Level Outstanding Graduate\nTencent Corporate First-Class Scholarship\n\"Hongping Evergreen Fund\" Student Science and Technology Innovation Competition Scholarship\nNational Undergraduate Digital Media Technology and Creativity Competition, Third Prize (National Level)\nChinese Journal of Image and Graphics Graduate Academic Salon 2025, Outstanding Presentation Award\nunique visitors since 2022.04"
  },
