    "homepage_text": "Siyue Yu\n      -  Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University\nXi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University Home\nSearch content at Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University\n©\ncopyrightStatement\nView Scopus Profile\nSiyue Yu\nAssistant Professor\nDepartment of Intelligent Science\nPhone\n+86 (0)512 88161507\nEmail\nSiyue.Yu02\nxjtlu.edu\ncn\nh-index\n372\nCitations\n9\nh-index\nCalculated based on number of publications stored in Pure and citations from Scopus\n2021\n2026\nResearch activity per year\nPersonal profile\nPersonal profile\nDr. Siyue Yu graduated from Xian Jiaotong-Liverpool University (Electrical and Electronic Engineering) with a bachelors degree. In December 2022, she received her Ph.D. at the University of Liverpool (Electrical and Electronic Engineering). She was supervised by Prof. Jimin Xiao and Prof. Eng Gee Lim during her PhD. She joined XJTLU in January 2023 as a lecturer. During her doctoral period, she has been researching computer vision, including video object segmentation, weakly supervised salient object detection, and co-salient object detection. She has published papers in CVPR, AAAI, TPAMI and other internationally renowned authoritative conferences or journals, including three papers as the first author. She also serves as a reviewer for several journals and conferences including TPAMI, TIP, and CVPR.https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=AdxzTKsAAAAJhl=zh-CNoi=ao\nIf you are interested in computer vision and MLLM, please contact me through siyue.yu02@xjtlu.edu.cn with your CV.\nResearch interests\nAnomaly Detection, Sample Generation, Semantic Segmentation\nExperience\nLecturer, XJTLU, 2023 - to Present\nTeaching\nINT305\nINT302\nRelated documents\nhttps://scholar.google.com/citations?user=AdxzTKsAAAAJ&hl=zh-CN&oi=ao\nEducation/Academic qualification\nBachelor Xi'an Jiaotong-Liverpool University, 2012-2016\nPh.D. University of Liverpool, 2018-2022\nResearch areas\nComputer Vision\nDeep Learning\nPerson Types\nStaff\nExpertise related to UN Sustainable Development Goals\nIn 2015, UN member states agreed to 17 global\nSustainable Development Goals (SDGs)\nto end poverty, protect the planet and ensure prosperity for all. This person’s work contributes towards the following SDG(s):\nSDG 7\nAffordable and Clean Energy\nFingerprint\nDive into the research topics where Siyue Yu is active. These topic labels come from the works of this person. Together they form a unique fingerprint.\n11\nSimilar Profiles\nWeakly-Supervised Semantic Segmentation\nComputer Science\n100%\nObject Detection\nComputer Science\n50%\nDesign\nComputer Science\n45%\nSemantic Feature\nComputer Science\n41%\nContrastive Learning\nComputer Science\n37%\nAnnotation\nComputer Science\n37%\nEnhancement Module\nComputer Science\n37%\nSalient Region\nComputer Science\n29%\nView full fingerprint\nCollaborations and top research areas from the last five years\nRecent external collaboration on country/territory level. Dive into details by clicking on the dots or\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nDive into details\nSelect a country/territory to view shared publications and projects\nClose\nSelect a country/territory from the list\nExplore network further\nProjects\n1\nFinished\n5\nActive\nAdvancing Research-Led Innovation in Multimedia Security Teaching\nLiu, S.\n(PI),\nYu, S.\n(CoPI),\nWang, J.\n(CoPI),\nXiao, J.\n(CoPI) &\nWang, Q.\n(CoPI)\n1/03/25\n→\n1/03/28\nProject\n:\nInternal Research Project\nActive Learning for Image Semantic Segmentation under Label Constrain\nXiao, J.\n(PI),\nYu, S.\n(Team member), Zhao, X. (Team member), Wang, X. (Team member), Qiu, X. (Team member), Wang, X. (Team member) & Wang, J. (Team member)\n1/09/24\n→\n31/08/27\nProject\n:\nGovernmental Research Project\nActive Learning\n100%\nImage Segmentation\n100%\nIntergral Feature Mining for Image-level Supervised Co-salient Object Detection\nYu, S.\n(PI)\n1/01/24\n→\n31/12/26\nProject\n:\nGovernmental Research Project\nSalient Object Detection\n100%\nResearch on Key Technologies for Small Sample Industrial Visual Inspection\nXiao, J.\n(PI),\nWang, Q.\n(Team member),\nYu, S.\n(Team member),\nJin, X.\n(Team member), Fan, P. (Team member), Wang, X. (Team member), Qiu, X. (Team member), Peng, J. (Team member), Gong, Y. (Team member), Qin, Y. (Team member), Li, H. (Team member) & Wang, X. (Team member)\n1/11/23\n→\n31/12/26\nProject\n:\nGovernmental Research Project\nVisual Inspection\n100%\nComprehensive Exploration of Image-level Supervised Co-salient Object Detection\nYu, S.\n(PI)\n1/07/23\n→\n30/06/26\nProject\n:\nInternal Research Project\nLevel Image\n100%\nSalient Object Detection\n100%\nView all 6 projects\nResearch output\n12\nConference Proceeding\n8\nArticle\n2\nConference article\n1\nShort survey\nDiffClick: Click-differentiated enhancement network for interactive segmentation\nSong, S.,\nYu, S.\n, Zhou, H., Huang, X.,\nYu, L.\n&\nXiao, J.\n,\nMar 2026\n,\nIn:\nPattern Recognition.\n171\n, 112217.\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nEnhancement Module\n100%\nInteractive\n100%\nBackground Region\n100%\n2\nCitations\n(Scopus)\nFFEvent: Fast fourier-based knowledge transfer for event cameras\nLin, Y., Zhang, J.,\nYu, S.\n,\nXiao, J.\n& Lu, J.,\n1 Mar 2026\n,\nIn:\nExpert Systems with Applications.\n299\nResearch output\n:\nContribution to journal\n›\nArticle\n›\npeer-review\nA Training-free Synthetic Data Selection Method for Semantic Segmentation\nTang, H.,\nYu, S.\n, Pang, J. & Zhang, B.,\n11 Apr 2025\n,\nSpecial Track on AI Alignment.\nWalsh, T., Shah, J. & Kolter, Z. (eds.).\n7 ed.\nAssociation for the Advancement of Artificial Intelligence\n,\np. 7229-7237\n9 p.\n(Proceedings of the AAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence; vol. 39, no. 7).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book or Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference Proceeding\n›\npeer-review\nOpen Access\nFilter Similarity\n100%\n1\nCitation\n(Scopus)\nClass Token as Proxy: Optimal Transport-assisted Proxy Learning for Weakly Supervised Semantic Segmentation\nWang, J., Dai, T., Zhang, B.,\nYu, S.\n,\nLim, E. G.\n&\nXiao, J.\n,\n2025\n,\nProceedings of the IEEE/CVF International Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book or Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference Proceeding\n›\npeer-review\nDriftRemover: Hybrid Energy Optimizations for Anomaly Images Synthesis and Segmentation\nYao, S., Xu, H., Sun, M.,\nYu, S.\n,\nXiao, J.\n&\nLim, E. G.\n,\n2025\n,\nProceedings of the 34th International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence, IJCAI 2025.\nKwok, J. (ed.).\nInternational Joint Conferences on Artificial Intelligence\n,\np. 2251-2259\n9 p.\n(IJCAI International Joint Conference on Artificial Intelligence).\nResearch output\n:\nChapter in Book or Report/Conference proceeding\n›\nConference Proceeding\n›\npeer-review\nView all 23 research outputs\nActivities\n5\nPublication Peer-review\n4\nCompleted SURF Project\n2\nMembership of committee\n1\nOrganising an event e.g. a conference, workshop, …\n3\nMore\n1\nParticipating in an event e.g. a conference, workshop, …\n1\nPhD Supervision\n1\nPresentation at conference/workshop/seminar\n3D Point Cloud-Based Intelligent Infrastructure Monitoring for Railway Systems\nYu, S.\n(Supervisor)\nJun 2025\n→\nAug 2025\nActivity\n:\nSupervision\n›\nCompleted SURF Project\nIntelligent Operation and Maintenance for Railway Systems Using AI and 3D Perception\nYu, S.\n(Supervisor)\nJun 2025\n→\nAug 2025\nActivity\n:\nSupervision\n›\nCompleted SURF Project\nLLM-based Weakly-supervised Image Segmentation\nYu, S.\n(Supervisor)\nJan 2025\n→\nDec 2028\nActivity\n:\nSupervision\n›\nPhD Supervision\n[ISE] 2024 IEEE International Conference on Automation in Manufacturing, Transportation and Logistics (iCaMaL2024)\nYu, S.\n(Speaker)\n7 Aug 2024\nActivity\n:\nTalk or presentation\n›\nPresentation at conference/workshop/seminar\nMultimedia Systems (Journal)\nYu, S.\n(Reviewer)\n25 Apr 2024\nActivity\n:\nPeer-review and editorial work of publications\n›\nPublication Peer-review\nView all 15 activities"
