    "homepage_text": "Sicheng Zhao\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nSicheng Zhao\nWelcome to my homepage\nSicheng Zhao\nAssociate Professor, Tsinghua University\nEmail: schzhao at tsinghua.edu.cn, schzhao at gmail.com\nBiography\nI am an associate professor at\nTsinghua University\n. I worked as a postdoc research scientist at\nColumbia University\nfrom 2020 to 2022, as a postdoc research fellow at\nUniversity of California Berkeley\nfrom 2017 to 2020, and as a postdoc at Tsinghua University from 2016 to 2017. I obtained my Ph.D. degree at\nHarbin Institute of Technology\nin 2016. During my Ph.D. study, I visited\nNational University of Singapore\nas a research intern from 2013 to 2014. My research interests include affective computing, multimedia, and domain adaptation.\n赵思成，清华大学副教授，博士生导师，国家级青年人才，哈尔滨工业大学博士，加州大学伯克利分校和哥伦比亚大学博士后，CCF杰出会员，ACM/IEEE/CSIG高级会员。研究方向为情感计算、多模态大模型、计算机视觉等。发表IEEE/ACM汇刊与CCF推荐A类论文60余篇，谷歌学术引用1万余次，H指数为53。担任中国图象图形学学会情感计算与理解专委会秘书长，IEEE TIP/\nIEEE TAFFC等国际期刊编委，IEEE TFS/ACM TOMM/PR等国际期刊首席客座\n编委\n，2023CSIG情感智能大会程序主席，Neur\nIPS/ICML/ICLR/\nCVPR/ECCV/\nACM MM等国际会议领域主席，获得北京市自然科学二等奖、\n中国图象图形学学会\n自然科学二等奖、中国电子学会科技进步一等奖、\n中国图象图形学学会优秀博士学位论文\n等奖励\n，入选人工智能全球最具影响力学者榜单和全球前2%顶尖科学家榜单\n。[\n学校主页\n]\n【访问学者和实习生招聘】\n因项目研究需要，长期招收博士后、访问学者和实习生，从事情感计算、多媒体分析、机器学习、大模型技术等前沿问题研究。欢迎感兴趣的小伙伴邮件联系schzhao@tsinghua.edu.cn。期待与大家一起做出有影响力的科研成果！\nSelected publications [\nfull list\n]\nJounal papers\nHuizai Yao,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Shuo Lu, Hui Chen, Yangyang Li, Guoping Liu, Tengfei Xing, Chenggang Yan, Jianhua Tao, Guiguang Ding. Source-Free Object Detection with Detection Transformer.\nIEEE Transactions on Image Processing\n(\nTIP\n) 34: 5948-5963, 2025.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Huizai Yao, Chuang Lin, Yue Gao, Guiguang Ding. Multi-Source-Free Domain Adaptive Object Detection.\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(\nIJCV\n)\n132(12): 5950-5982, 2024.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Xiaopeng Hong, Jufeng Yang, Yanyan Zhao, Guiguang Ding. Toward Label-Efficient Emotion and Sentiment Analysis.\nProceedings of the IEEE\n(\nPIEEE\n) 111\n(10): 1159-1197\n, 2023.\nJames Z. Wang,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Chenyan Wu, Reginald B. Adams, Michelle G. Newman, Tal Shafir, Rachelle Tsachor. Unlocking the Emotional World of Visual Media: An Overview of the Science, Research, and Impact of Understanding Emotion.\nProceedings of the IEEE\n(\nPIEEE\n)\n111(10): 1236-1286\n, 2023.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Xingxu Yao, Guoli Jia, Jufeng Yang, Guiguang Ding, Tat-Seng Chua, Björn W. Schuller, Kurt Keutzer. Affective Image Content Analysis: Two Decades Review and New Perspectives.\nIEEE Transactions on Pattern Analysis and Machine Intelligence\n(\nTPAMI\n) 44(10): 6729-6751, 2022.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Xiangyu Yue, Shanghang Zhang, Bo Li, Han Zhao, Bichen Wu, Ravi Krishna, Joseph E. Gonzalez, Alberto L. Sangiovanni-Vincentelli, Sanjit A. Seshia, Kurt Keutzer. A Review of Single-Source Deep Unsupervised Visual Domain Adaptation.\nIEEE Transactions on Neural Networks and Learning Systems\n(\nTNNLS\n) 33(2): 473-493, 2022.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Bo Li, Pengfei Xu, Xiangyu Yue, Guiguang Ding, Kurt Keutzer. MADAN: Multi-source Adversarial Domain Aggregation Network for Domain Adaptation.\nInternational Journal of Computer Vision\n(\nIJCV\n) 129(8): 2399-2424, 2021.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Guoli Jia, Jufeng Yang, Guiguang Ding, Kurt Keutzer. Emotion Recognition from Multiple Modalities: Fundamentals and Methodologies.\nIEEE Signal Processing Magazine\n(\nSPM\n) 38(6): 59-73, 2021.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Hongxun Yao, Yue Gao, Guiguang Ding, Tat-Seng Chua. Predicting Personalized Image Emotion Perceptions in Social Networks.\nIEEE Transactions on Affective Computing\n(\nTAFFC\n) 9(4): 526-540, 2018. [\ndata\nPlease send me your name, affiliation, position, and google ID (and also your supervisor's information if you are a student)\nfor the access.\n]\nSicheng Zhao\n, Yue Gao, Guiguang Ding, Tat-Seng Chua. Real-Time Multimedia Social Event Detection in Microblog.\nIEEE Transactions on Cybernetics\n(\nTCYB\n) 48(11): 3218-3231, 2018.\nConference\npapers\nLeqi Shen, Guoqiang Gong, Tao He, Yifeng Zhang, Pengzhang Liu,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Guiguang Ding. FastVID: Dynamic Density Pruning for Fast Video Large Language Models.\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n)\n, 2025.\nDaiqing Wu, Dongbao Yang,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Can Ma, Yu Zhou. An Empirical Study on Configuring In-Context Learning Demonstrations for Unleashing MLLMs' Sentimental Perception Capability.\nInternational Conference on Machine Learning\n(\nICML\n), 2025.\nLeqi Shen, Tianxiang Hao, Tao He,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Yifeng Zhang, Pengzhang Liu, Yongjun Bao, Guiguang Ding. TempMe: Video Temporal Token Merging for Efficient Text-Video Retrieval.\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations\n(\nICLR\n), 2025.\nLeqi Shen, Guoqiang Gong, Tianxiang Hao, Tao He, Yifeng Zhang, Pengzhang Liu,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Jungong Han, Guiguang Ding. DiscoVLA: Discrepancy Reduction in Vision, Language, and Alignment for Parameter-Efficient Video-Text Retrieval.\nIEEE Conference on Computer Vision and Pattern Recognition\n(\nCVPR\n),\npp. 19702-19712, 2025.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Yezhen Wang, Bo Li, Bichen Wu, Yang Gao, Pengfei Xu, Trevor Darrell, Kurt Keutzer. ePointDA: An End-to-End Simulation-to-Real Domain Adaptation Framework for LiDAR Point Cloud Segmentation.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(\nAAAI\n), pp. 3500-3509, 2021.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Yang Xiao, Jiang Guo, Xiangyu Yue, Jufeng Yang, Ravi Krishna, Pengfei Xu, Kurt Keutzer. Curriculum CycleGAN for Textual Sentiment Domain Adaptation with Multiple Sources.\nThe Web Conference\n(\nWWW\n), pp. 541-552, 2021.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Guangzhi Wang, Shanghang Zhang, Yang Gu, Yaxian Li, Zhichao Song, Pengfei Xu, Runbo Hu, Hua Chai, Kurt Keutzer. Multi-source Distilling Domain Adaptation.\nAAAI Conference on Artificial Intelligence\n(\nAAAI\n), pp. 12975-12983, 2020.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Bo Li, Xiangyu Yue, Yang Gu, Pengfei Xu, Runbo Hu, Hua Chai, Kurt Keutzer. Multi-Source Domain Adaptation for Semantic Segmentation.\nAdvances in Neural Information Processing Systems\n(\nNeurIPS\n), pp. 7285-7298, 2019.\nXiangyu Yue, Yang Zhang,\nSicheng Zhao\n, Alberto Sangiovanni-Vincentelli, Kurt Keutzer, Boqing Gong. Domain Randomization and Pyramid Consistency: Simulation-to-Real Generalization without Accessing Target Domain Data.\nIEEE International Conference on Computer Vision\n(\nICCV\n), pp. 2100-2110, 2019.\nSicheng Zhao\n, Yue Gao, Xiaolei Jiang, Hongxun Yao, Tat-Seng Chua, Xiaoshuai Sun. Exploring Principles-of-Art Features for Image Emotion Recognition.\nACM International Conference on Multimedia\n(\nACM MM\n), pp. 47-56, 2014.\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
