    "homepage_text": "Dawei Shi's Homepage\nDawei Shi's Homepage\nHome\nPublications\nResearch\nTeaching\nStudents\nPaintings\nDr. Dawei Shi\nProfessor\n, Institute of Intelligent Sensing & Motion Control, School of Automation, Beijing Institute of Technology (BIT)\nPrinciple Investigator\n, Intelligent Control & Decision of Precision Medicine Systems, BIT Institute of Engineering Medicine\nOffice\n: Room 212, Building #6\nEmail\n:\ndaweishi@bit.edu.cn\nPhone:\n+86 10 6891 8802\nAddress\n: School of Automation,\r\nBeijing Institute of Technology,\r\nBeijing, 100081, P.R. China\nThis page is under construction. We are always looking for highly-motivated PhD, MSc and undergraduate students with a strong mathematical background and interests in control theory and engineering applications.\nPhD Students\nMsc Students\nUndergraduate Research Assistants\nLast updated on Jul. 7, 2020.\nCopyright © 2020 Dawei Shi. All rights reserved."
