    "homepage_text": "Nan Xue\nNan Xue\nNan Xue\nI'm leading a research team in the\nRobbyAnt\n, and a staff research scientist at\nAnt Research\n. \n        My current research focuses on developing general learning algorithms for structured visual geometry in computer vision. Here is a\nresearch statement\nabout my work.\n        My profile photo is computed by my\nHAWPv3\n.\nI'm looking for research interns who are interested in\nstructured visual geometry\n.\n        Please feel free to drop me an email with your CV.\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGithub\n/\nTwitter\n/\nLinkedIn\n/\nEmail\nRecent News\n2026. 01:\nOur new work\nLingBot-VA\non causal world modeling for robot control is now available on\narXiv\nwith\ncode\n.\n2026. 01:\nOur new work\nLingBot-Depth\nfor masked depth modeling is now available on\narXiv\nwith\ncode\n.\n2025. 10:\nOur NeurIPS paper\nPlana3r\nis released with\ncode\n. See you in San Diego!\n2025. 08:\nServed as an Area Chair for\nWACV 2026\n.\n2025. 04:\nFour papers (including 1 highlight paper) were accepted to CVPR 2025. See you in Nashville :)\nSelected Publications"
  },
