    "homepage_text": "Hengjia Li's Homepage\nHengjia Li\nPh.D. Candidate\nComputer Science and Technology\nZhejiang University\nE-mail\n/\nCV\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nLinkedIn\nBiography\nHi, I'm Hengjia Li (李恒佳). \n          I am currently a final-year Ph.D. student in the\nState Key Lab of CAD&CG\nat\nZhejiang University\nguided by\nPro. Deng Cai\nand\nPro. Xiaofei He\n. \n          Fortunatly, I am a visiting student at Human Sensing Lab, Carnegie Mellon University (CMU) guided by\nPro. Fernando De La Torre\n.\n          Before this, I received my bachelor's degree in Mathematical Sciences of Zhejiang University.\nI have a broad interest in most areas of computer vision, especially in image/video generation and multi-modal understanding and reasoning with a recent focus on post training. \n          Please do not hesitate to reach out to me via email at\nlihengjia98@gmail.com\n!\nNews\n[06/2025]\nThree papers accepted by ICCV 2025.\n[01/2025]\nOne paper accepted by ICLR 2025.\n[11/2024]\nVisit\nHuman Sensing Lab\nof Carnegie Mellon University (CMU).\n[11/2024]\nOne paper accepted by ICLR 2024.\n[12/2023]\nOne paper accepted by AAAI 2024.\nSelected Publications\n* equal contribution\nThinkRL-Edit: Thinking in Reinforcement Learning for Reasoning-Centric Image Editing\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Liming Jiang, Qing Yan, Yizhi Song, Hao Kang, Zichuan Liu, Xin Lu, Boxi Wu, Deng Cai\nUnder Review\nRULER-Bench: Probing Rule-based Reasoning Abilities of Next-level Video Generation Models for Vision Foundation Intelligence\nXuming He*, Zehao Fan*,\nHengjia Li*\n, Fan Zhuo, Hankun Xu, Senlin cheng, Di Weng, Haifeng Liu, Can Ye, Boxi Wu\nUnder Review\nProject\n/\narXiv\nMagicView: Multi-View Consistent Identity Customization via Priors-Guided In-Context Learning\nHengjia Li\n, Jianjin Xu, Keli Cheng, Lei Wang, Ning Bi, Zheng Yang, Boxi Wu, Deng Cai, Fernando De la Torre\nUnder Review\narXiv\nMagicID: Hybrid Preference Optimization for ID-Consistent and Dynamic-Preserved Video Customization\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Lifan Jiang, Xi Xiao, Tianyang Wang, Hongwei Yi, Boxi Wu, Deng Cai\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2025\nProject\n/\narXiv\n/\nCode\nPersonalVideo: High ID-Fidelity Video Customization without Dynamic and Semantic Degradation\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Haonan Qiu, Shiwei Zhang, Xiang Wang, Yujie Wei, Zekun Li, Yingya Zhang, Boxi Wu, Deng Cai\nInternational Conference on Computer Vision (ICCV), 2025\nProject\n/\narXiv\n/\nCode\nFew-shot Hybrid Domain Adaptation of Image Generators\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Yang Liu, Linxuan Xia, Yuqi Lin, Tu Zheng, Zheng Yang, Wenxiao Wang, Xiaohui Zhong, Xiaobo Ren, Xiaofei He\nInternational Conference on Learning Representations (ICLR), 2024\nProject\n/\narXiv\n/\nCode\nGCA-3D: Towards Generalized and Consistent Domain Adaptation of 3D Generators.\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Yang Liu, Yibo Zhao, Haoran Cheng, Yang Yang, Linxuan Xia, Zekai Luo, Qibo Qiu, Boxi Wu, Tu Zheng, Zheng Yang, Deng Cai\nUnder Review\narXiv\nUniHDA: A Unified and Versatile Framework for Multi-Modal Hybrid Domain Adaptation\nHengjia Li\n,\n                  Yang Liu, Yuqi Lin, Zhanwei Zhang, Yibo Zhao, weihang Pan, Tu Zheng, Zheng Yang, Yuchun Jiang, Boxi Wu, Deng Cai\nUnder Review\narXiv\nExperiences\nResearch Intern, Bytedance Seed\nTopic: Unified Multi-Modal Model\nSupervised by:\nZihan Ding\nResearch Intern, TikTok\nTopic: Reasoning-Centric Image Editing\nSupervised by:\nLiming Jiang\nResearch Intern, Tongyi WanX\nTopic: Human-Centric Video Generation\nSupervised by:\nShiwei Zhang\nResearch Intern, HeyGen\nTopic: Multimodal Image Generation\nSupervised by:\nYi Ren\nResearch Intern, Hedra\nTopic: Human-Centric Video Generation\nSupervised by:\nHongwei Yi\nVisiting Scholar, Human Sensing Lab, Carnegie Mellon University\nTopic: Human-Centric Image Generation\nSupervised by:\nFernando De La Torre\nProfessional Services\nConference Reviewer for CVPR (2025, 2026), ICLR(2025, 2026), ICCV (2025), NeurIPS (2024, 2025), ICML (2025), AAAI (2026), MM (2025), WACV (2025).\nJournal Reviewer for TIP"
