    "homepage_text": "Zhengkai Jiang\nZhengkai JIANG\nStaff Researcher\nEmail\n/\nGoogle Scholar\n/\nGitHub\n/\nLinkedIn\nMy work focuses on post-training generative AI models for Tencent's Hunyuan multi-modal base model.\nPublications\nHunyuanImage-3.0: A Powerful Native Multimodal Model for Image Generation\nCore Contributors\nof Post-Training for Hunyuan-Image Series\nTechnical Report /\nPaper\nFoundation Cures Personalization: Recovering Facial Personalized Models' Prompt Consistency\nYiyang Cai,\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Yulong Liu, Chunyang Jiang, Wei Xue, Wenhan Luo, Yike Guo\nNeurIPS 2025 /\nPaper\nOSV: One Step is Enough for High-Quality Image to Video Generation\nXiaofeng Mao*,\nZhengkai Jiang*\n, Fuyun Wang*, Jiangning Zhang, Hao Chen, Mingmin Chi, Yabiao Wang, Wenhan Luo\nCVPR 2025 /\nPaper\nVividPose: Advancing Stable Video Diffusion for Realistic Human Image Animation\nQilin Wang*,\nZhengkai Jiang*\n, Chengming Xu, Jiangning Zhang, Yabiao Wang, Xinyi Zhang, Yun Cao, Weijian Cao, Chengjie Wang, Yanwei Fu\nArxiv 2024 /\nPaper\n/\nCode\nPersonalize Segment Anything Model with One Shot\nRenrui Zhang,\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Ziyu Guo, Shilin Yan, Junting Pan, Hao Dong, Yu Qiao, Peng Gao, Hongsheng Li\nICLR 2024 /\nPaper\n/\nCode\nMDT-A2G: Exploring Masked Diffusion Transformers for Co-Speech Gesture Generation\nXiaofeng Mao*,\nZhengkai Jiang\n*, Qilin Wang, Chencan Fu, Jiangning Zhang, Jiafu Wu, Yabiao Wang, Chengjie Wang, Wei Li, Mingnin Chi\nACM MM 2024 /\nPaper\nLearning Unified Reference Representation for Unsupervised Multi-class Anomaly Detection\nLiren He*,\nZhengkai Jiang\n*, Jinlong Peng, Liang Liu, Qiangang Du, Xiaobin Hu, Wenbing Zhu, Mingmin Chi, Yabiao Wang, Chengjie Wang\nECCV 2024 /\nPaper\nDensity Matters: Improved Core-set for Active Domain Adaptive Segmentation\nShizhan Liu*,\nZhengkai Jiang\n*, Yuxi Li, Jinlong Peng, Yabiao Wang, Weiyao Lin\nAAAI 2024 /\nPaper\nPrototypical Contrast Adaptation for Domain Adaptive Segmentation\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Yuxi Li, Ceyuan Yang, Peng Gao, Yabiao Wang, Ying Tai, Chengjie Wang\nECCV 2022 /\nPaper\n/\nCode\nSiamRCR: Reciprocal Classification and Regression for Visual Object Tracking\nJinlong Peng*,\nZhengkai Jiang\n*, Yueyang Gu, Yang Wu, Yabiao Wang, Ying Tai, Chengjie Wang, Weiyao Lin\nIJCAI 2021 /\nPaper\nLearning Where to Focus for Efficient Video Object Detection\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Yu Liu, Ceyuan Yang, Jihao Liu, Peng Gao, Qian Zhang, Shiming Xiang, Chunhong Pan\nECCV 2020 /\nProject Page\n/\nPaper\n/\nCode\nDynamic Fusion with Intra-and Inter-Modality Attention Flow for Visual Question Answering\nPeng Gao,\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Haoxuan You, Pan Lu, Steven CH Hoi, Xiaogang Wang, Hongsheng Li\nCVPR 2019 /\nPaper\nVideo Object Detection with Locally-Weightd Deformable Neighboors\nZhengkai Jiang\n, Peng Gao, Chaoxu Guo, Qian Zhang, Shiming Xiang, Chunhong Pan\nAAAI 2019 /\nPaper\nHonors and Awards\n1st of the Objects 365 Challenge, 2020\n1st of the NuScenes 3D Detection of CVPR WAD workshop, 2019\nOutstanding graduates of Liaoning Province, 2017\n1st of the Chinese Mathematics Competitions (1/6000+ in Liaoning Province), 2015, 2016\nNational Scholarship (Top 0.2% students in China), 2014, 2015, 2016\nContact\nYou are very welcome to contact me. My email is\nkaikaijiang.jzk\n[at]\ngmail\n.com or\nzkjiang\n[at]\nust\n.hk"
