    "homepage_text": "Jie Jiang's homepage\nHome\n(中文)\nResearch\nPublications\nJie Jiang\nJie Jiang\n, Ph.D.\nAssociate Professor of\nCollege of Mathematics and Statistics at Chongqing University\nAddress: No.55 Daxuecheng South Road, Shapingba, Chongqing, 401331, China\nEmail: jiangjiecq@163.com\nTo jump to my homepage in Chongqing University, please click\nhere\n!\nSome other personal websites: \n  [\nGoogle Scholar\n]\n  [\nGoogle Homepage\n] \n  [\nORCID\n]\nAbout me\nI'm a faculty member of\nCollege of Mathematics and Statistics\nat\nChongqing University\n. \n  I got my Bachelor of Applied Mathematics from\nXi'an Jiaotong University\nin 2013. Then I began to study for my doctorate. \n  I participated in a joint PhD program between\nXi'an Jiaotong University\nand\nThe Hong Kong Polytechnic University\n. \n  This makes me to own two PhD degrees: Doctor of Mathematics from\nXi'an Jiaotong University\n(supervised by\nProf. Zhiping Chen\n) and \n  Doctor of Philosophy from\nThe Hong Kong Polytechnic University\n(supervised by\nProf. Xiaojun Chen\n). \n  My both doctoral careers ended in Sep. 2019. In October 2019, \n  I joined\nChongqing University\nlocated in Chongqing municipality of China to be an assistant professor in\nCollege of Mathematics and Statistics\n. \n  In September 2023, I was appointed as an associate professor.\nEducation\n2013–2019: Ph.D. in Mathematics,\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics\n,\nXi'an Jiaotong University\n, Xi'an, Shannxi, China\n2016–2019: Ph.D. in Philosophy,\nDepartment of Applied Mathematics\n,\nThe Hong Kong Polytechnic University\n, Hong Kong, China\n2009–2013: B.S. in Applied Mathematics,\nSchool of Mathematics and Statistics\n,\nXi'an Jiaotong University\n, Xi'an, Shannxi, China\nEmployment\n2023.09--now: Associate Professor, College of Mathematics and Statistics, Chongqing University.\n2026.01--2026.02: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2025.07--2025.08: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2025.01--2025.03: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2024.06--2024.08: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2024.03--2024.06: Visiting Scholar, Department of Systems Engineering and Engineering Management, The Chinese University of Hong Kong.\n2024.01--2024.03: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2023.07--2023.08: Research Fellow, Department of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2022.10--2023.08: Tenured Assistant Professor, College of Mathematics and Statistics, Chongqing University.\n2020.03--2023.06: Postdoctoral Fellow, CAS AMSS-PolyU Joint Laboratory of Applied Mathematics, The Hong Kong Polytechnic University.\n2019.10--2022.09: Assistant Professor, College of Mathematics and Statistics, Chongqing University.\nGrants\nThe China Postdoctoral Science Foundation (Grant No. 2020M673117), 2020.07-2022.06\nThe National Natural Science Foundation of China (Grant No. 12201084), 2023.01-2025.12\nThe China Postdoctoral Science Foundation (Grant No. 2023M730417), 2023.07-2025.06\nThe Chongqing Natural Science Foundation Innovation and Development Joint Fund Project (Grant No. CSTB2025NSCQ-LZX0008), 2025.07-2028.06\nResearch Interests\nStochastic Optimization/Equilibrium\nMultistage Stochastic Programming Problem\nDistributionally Robust Optimization\n(Stochastic) Algorithms for Stochastic Optimization/Equilibrium\nStatistical Inference\nMachine Learning, Deep Neural Networks"
  },
