    "homepage_text": "Bin Sun\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nBin Sun\nAbout Me\nAbout Me\nI am a PhD student of the Group of Foundations of Algorithms and Artificial Intelligence at TU Clausthal. I have a broad interest in theoretical computer science. My favourite topics are social choice theory and algorithmics. In addition, I also have interest in game theory, graph theory and complexity theory.\nPrior to that, I received my master's degree from RWTH Aachen.\nIf you are interested in doing research with me together, please feel free to send me a mail, to bin.sun@tu-clausthal.de  :)\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nGoogle Sites\nReport abuse"
  },
