    "homepage_text": "Amii (Alberta Machine Intelligence Institute) | AI for good and for all\nArtificial Intelligence\nFor Good & For All\nRichard Sutton: Turing Award Winner\nUpper Bound 2026: Bound to Inspire\nAlberta Machine Intelligence Institute\nAmii\nis a world-leading AI Institute\nAt the highest level, we advance the field of AI in two ways:\nResearch\nAmii is a world-renowned leader in artificial intelligence research, advancing the field of AI through groundbreaking discoveries and transformative technologies.\nLearn More\nCommercialization\nAmii sets the standard for partnering with companies—from startups to global enterprises—to create actionable AI strategies and develop custom AI solutions.\nLearn More\nPEOPLE-POWERED DISCOVERY\nWe are home to some of the\nbrightest minds\nin AI.\nMEET THE MINDS\nRichard S. Sutton\nFellow, Canada CIFAR AI Chair & Chief Scientific Advisor\nMartha White\nFellow & Canada CIFAR AI Chair\nJ. Ross Mitchell\nFellow & Canada CIFAR AI Chair\nWe are global leaders in\nReinforcement Learning (RL)\nINCLUSIVE AI\nWe create\nopportunities\nfor everyone to engage in AI.\nBusiness Solutions\nLearn more\nStartups & Investors\nLearn more\nLiteracy & Training\nLearn more\nResearch & Innovation\nLearn more\nTalent Development\nLearn more\nWe work in\npartnership\nwith the most future-thinking organizations.\nNews & Insights\nRead the latest updates from\nAmii\nView All Articles\nHear our latest podcast episode\nListen now"
